<?xml version="1.0" encoding="utf-8"?>
<usx version="3.0">
  <book code="DEU" style="id">- Lugulu Bible Version</book>
  <para style="toc3">Kumb</para>
  <para style="toc2">Kukumbuka</para>
  <para style="toc1">Ichitabu cha kukumbuka ghamalaghitso</para>
  <para style="mt1">KUKUMBUKA GHAMALAGHITSO</para>
  <para style="is">ICHILONGOLE</para>
  <chapter number="1" style="c" sid="DEU 1" />
  <para style="s1">Malaghitso gha ukwing'ondo</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="DEU 1:1" />Aghano ghagho ghamalonga Musa ghayawalongele Wasiraeli wose kumwambu kwa ghumto ghwa Yoridani hawakalile kunyika, mna isi ing'ali ilolesa na Sufu, haghati ha imiji ya Palani, Tofeli, Labani, Hazeloti na Dizahabu. <verse eid="DEU 1:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="DEU 1:2" />Kulawa Holebu, ihomanyika ka chidunda Sinai, mbaka kupfika Kadeshi Barinea mwanza ghwa matsuwa kumi na limwe kwa kwang'ila inzila ili mchidunda Seili. <verse eid="DEU 1:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="DEU 1:3" />Mna litsuwa lya mwanduso lya ghumwetsi ghwa kumi na ghumwe, mwaka ghwa alubaini tangia hawalawile Misiri, Musa tsakawalongela Waisiraeli wose aghala IMNDEWA ghayamlaghitse yawalongele. <verse eid="DEU 1:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="DEU 1:4" />Katenda apfo ahala hayamtowile Sihoni mfalume wa Waamori, iyang'ali yokala mna ghumji ghwa Heshiboni, na Ogu mfalume wa Bashani iyang'ali yokala mna ghumji ghwa Ashitaroti na Edirei. <verse eid="DEU 1:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="DEU 1:5" />Kumwambu mwa Yoridani mna isi ya Moabu kuko Musa kwayanzile kuwalongela ghamalaghitso aghano gholongatse, kalonga, <verse eid="DEU 1:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="DEU 1:6" />“IMNDEWA Imulungu wetu katulongela twetwe hatukalile akula kuchidunda Horebu, ‘Mkala matsuwa mengi mna ichidunda achino, <verse eid="DEU 1:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="DEU 1:7" />lelo mhunduke mghendelele na ghumwaza ghwenu, mghende mna isi ili mna ipfidunda pfa wanu wa Amori, na mghende kuna isi tsose itsili habehi na ghumto Yoridani, mna isi ya Araba, isi itsili mpfidunda na itsili mchiwala, na isi ya Negebu na itsili kumwani, mbaka kuna isi ya Wakanani na Lebanoni, mbaka kuna ghumto mkulu ghwa Efurati. <verse eid="DEU 1:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="DEU 1:8" />Mlole, nomwing'ani isi aino muitawale. Mwingile na msole pfose ipfili mumo ka nene IMNDEWA pfanilahile ka nitsoweng'a iwahenga wenu Aburahamu, Isaka, Yakobu na pfeleko pfawo.’ ”<verse eid="DEU 1:8" /></para>
  <para style="s">Musa kosaghula pfilongotsi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="DEU 1:9" />Hatung'ali twa kuchidunda, tsaniwalongela, “Nene sidaha baye kughala mtsigho aghuno ghwa kuwalongotsani niliyeka. <verse eid="DEU 1:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="DEU 1:10" />IMNDEWA, Imulungu wenu, kawongetsa sideke, na sambi mwa wengi ka tsinondo tsa kulanga. <verse eid="DEU 1:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="DEU 1:11" />IMNDEWA, Imulungu wa iwahenga wenu yawongetse mala elufu kubita pfamli sambi, na yawabaliki ka pfayalongile. <verse eid="DEU 1:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="DEU 1:12" />Lelo nene niliyeka nitsodahatse kusola mtsigho aghuno mtito ghwa kulamlitsa ukwisonga kwenu na maghomba ghenu? <verse eid="DEU 1:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="DEU 1:13" />Muwasaghule iwanu iwakengele, iwomanya, na iwotogholighwa na iwanu kulawa mna makabila ghenu, na nene nitsowatenda wawe pfilongotsi wenu.” <verse eid="DEU 1:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="DEU 1:14" />Namwe mnyidika, mlonga, “Chaubama tutende chinogha.” <verse eid="DEU 1:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="DEU 1:15" />Apfo niwasola iwanu wamuwasaghule kulawa mna ghamakabila ghenu, iwakengele, iwomanya, na iwotogholighwa na iwanu niwatenda wawe pfilongotsi wenu, wamwenga walongotse wanu elufu, wangi walongotse wanu miya, wangi walongotse wanu hamsini, na awala iwolongotsa wanu kumikumi, na wemilitsi ka ghamakabila ghenu pfaghali.<verse eid="DEU 1:15" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="DEU 1:16" />“Kuko kuchidunda pfipfila niwalaghitsa walamlitsi wenu, niwalongela, ‘Mghategheletse maghomba gha ndughu tsenu na mghahighe pfinoghile, ka lighomba alyo lyolawa kwa Waisiraeli wayenu, au hata ka lyolawa kwe wagheni iwokala na mwemwe. <verse eid="DEU 1:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="DEU 1:17" />Hamuhigha ghamaghomba, mleke kulola pfihanga pfa iwanu. Muwategheletse iwabala na awala iwakwoneka mbughilambughila. Mleke kumpfuka munu wowose kwaapfila ukuhigha kwamughigha kolawa kwa Imulungu. Ka hana ghomba kulu na ng'amdaha baye kulilamla, ngalileni nene nani nitsolitegheletsa.’ <verse eid="DEU 1:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="DEU 1:18" />Matsuwa ghagho tsaniwalongela chila chinu cha ukutenda.”<verse eid="DEU 1:18" /></para>
  <para style="s">Musa kowatuma wapelembi Kanaani</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="DEU 1:19" />“Ka IMNDEWA Imulungu wetu pfayatulaghitse, twanza ghumwanza ghwetu kulawa kuchidunda Horebu, twang'a mna inyika aila ng'ulu ighuma wogha yamuimanyile, tuwinza nzila ighenda mna isi ya ipfidunda pfa wanu wa Amori, na hatupfikile Kadeshi Barinea, <verse eid="DEU 1:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="DEU 1:20" />nene niwalongelani, ‘Lelo mpfika mna isi ya ipfidunda ya wanu wa Amori, iyotwing'a IMNDEWA Imulungu wetu tuitawale. <verse eid="DEU 1:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="DEU 1:21" />Mlole, IMNDEWA Imulungu wenu kamwing'ani isi. Mgheluke na muisole, ka IMNDEWA Imulungu wa iwahenga wenu pfayawalongele. Mleke kupfuka wala kutenyuka ghumoyo.’ ”<verse eid="DEU 1:21" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="DEU 1:22" />“Lekeni mnyitsila na mnongela, ‘Tanu tuwatume wanu walongole muisi, ili wakaipelembe isi na watulongele inzila inoghile ya ukughenda ako, na imiji yake pfaili.’ <verse eid="DEU 1:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="DEU 1:23" />Chamlongile choneka chinogha kuna nene, apfo niwasaghula wanu kumi na weli, munu yumwe kulawa chila kabila. <verse eid="DEU 1:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="DEU 1:24" />Awo woka na wagheluka mna isi ili mchidunda, na waghendelela mbaka wapfika mna lwanda lwa Eshikoli na waipelemba na wayona apfila pfaili. <verse eid="DEU 1:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="DEU 1:25" />Waghondola ghamatunda ghawapatile ako na watughalila watulongela apfino, ‘Isi iyatwing'ile IMNDEWA Imulungu wetu inogha sideke.’ <verse eid="DEU 1:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="DEU 1:26" />Lekeni mwemwe ng'ambamile ukugheluka ako baye, na mlema kukinda lilaghitso lya IMNDEWA Imulungu wenu. <verse eid="DEU 1:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="DEU 1:27" />Mlongeleka mna ipfibumbulika pfenu mlonga, ‘IMNDEWA kotuhila, katulapfa mna isi ya Misiri katughala akuno mna ghamoko gha Waamori ili watukome.’ <verse eid="DEU 1:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="DEU 1:28" />Lelo tughenda kwani? Ndughu tsetu watutenyula imimoyo yetu, watulongela, ‘Matsinu ighali ako ghana bapfu na matali kubita twetwe, imiji yawo mikulu na mibanda yawo mitali mbaka kulanga. Tughona matsinu makulu, gha ilweleko lwa Anaki.’ ” <verse eid="DEU 1:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="DEU 1:29" />“Lekeni nene niwalongelani, ‘Mleke kutenyuka ghumoyo, wala mleke kuwapfuka.’ <verse eid="DEU 1:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="DEU 1:30" />IMNDEWA, Imulungu wenu, iyowalongolela hambele, katsowatowelani ka pfamwonile pfayawatendele akula Misiri, <verse eid="DEU 1:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="DEU 1:31" />na ka pfayatendile akula kunyika. Ako mmwona IMNDEWA Imulungu wenu pfayawabapile mna ghumwanza ghose ka aba pfayombapa imwanaghe mbaka mpfika hanu ahano.” <verse eid="DEU 1:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="DEU 1:32" />Lekeni hamwenga na aghano ghose ghayatendile, mwemwe ng'amumtoghole baye IMNDEWA, Imulungu wenu, <verse eid="DEU 1:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="DEU 1:33" />iyawalongolele mna ghumwanza ghwenu kuwabamila hanu ha ukwika tsindalo tsenu. Nechilo kawalongolela kwa ngutso ya ghumoto na nemisi kawalongolela kwa ngutso ya libingu kuwalangusa inzila.<verse eid="DEU 1:33" /></para>
  <para style="s">IMNDEWA kowahigha Waisiraeli</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" sid="DEU 1:34" />“IMNDEWA hayahulike ukulongeleka kwenu, tsakona maya, kelaha, na kalonga, <verse eid="DEU 1:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="DEU 1:35" />‘Kududu hata yumwe wenu mna lweleko aluno lwihile iyatsoyona isi inoghile yanilahile kuweng'a iwahenga wenu. <verse eid="DEU 1:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="DEU 1:36" />Lekeni Kalebu mwana wa Yefune, ayo katsoyona, na nitsomwing'a yeye na lweleko lwake isi iyaikanyaghe, kwaapfila yeye kanitegheletsa kwa ghumoyo ghwake ghwose.’ <verse eid="DEU 1:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="DEU 1:37" />IMNDEWA kambonela maya nene kwaajili yenu, na kalonga, ‘Wala ghweghwe pfipfila ng'ukwingila ako baye. <verse eid="DEU 1:37" /><verse number="38" style="v" sid="DEU 1:38" />Lekeni Yoshua mwana wa Nuni, iyali mtumighwa wako, yeye katsakwingila ako, mghume ghumoyo kwaapfila yeye katsowagholela Waisiraeli isi ayo.’ ”<verse eid="DEU 1:38" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="39" style="v" sid="DEU 1:39" />“Kuya wadodo wenu, wamlongile watsoghoghighwa, iwana wenu ing'awomanya baye ghanoghile na ighehile awo wawo iwatsakwingila ako, nitsoweng'a isi ayo iwe yawo. <verse eid="DEU 1:39" /><verse number="40" style="v" sid="DEU 1:40" />Lekeni mwemwe, mhunduke na mke kunyika kwa kwang'ila inzila ya Bahali ya Shamu.”<verse eid="DEU 1:40" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="41" style="v" sid="DEU 1:41" />“Lekeni mnyidika, ‘Twetwe tumtotsela IMNDEWA, tutsogheluka kwitowa nawo ka IMNDEWA pfayatulaghitse.’ Apfo chila munu kakinda ipfinu pfake pfa kwitowa ing'ondo, kwaapfila tsampfikitsa mwodaha kuisola isi ayo ya ipfidunda.”<verse eid="DEU 1:41" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="42" style="v" sid="DEU 1:42" />“Naye IMNDEWA kanongela, Walongele, ‘Mleke kughenda kwitowa kwaapfila nene sitsakuwa namwe baye, hela mtsotowighwa na awala wamghenda kwitowa nawo.’ ” <verse eid="DEU 1:42" /><verse number="43" style="v" sid="DEU 1:43" />Na nene niwalongelani, lekeni ng'amniteghetse baye, mlema kutenda achila chayawalongele IMNDEWA, na mghenda mna isi ya ipfidunda. <verse eid="DEU 1:43" /><verse number="44" style="v" sid="DEU 1:44" />Na Waamori iwang'ali wokala kupfidunda, wawalawila na wawawingani ka wanu wowingighwa na wanzukwi, mtowighwa kulawa Seiri mbaka Horima. <verse eid="DEU 1:44" /><verse number="45" style="v" sid="DEU 1:45" />Apfo muya na mlila hambele ha IMNDEWA, lekeni yeye ng'ategheletse baye ichililo chenu, na ghamaghutwi ghake kadiwa.<verse eid="DEU 1:45" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="46" style="v" sid="DEU 1:46" />“Apfo mkala Kadeshi kwa matsuwa mengi.”<verse eid="DEU 1:46" /></para>
  <chapter eid="DEU 1" />
  <chapter number="2" style="c" sid="DEU 2" />
  <para style="s">Waisiraeli woyungayunga mnyika</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="DEU 2:1" />Kuya tuhunduka, na tughenda kunyika kwa nzila ya Bahali ya Shamu ka IMNDEWA pfayanongele, kwa matsuwa mengi tung'ali tuyungayunga mna isi ya ipfidunda ya Seiri.<verse eid="DEU 2:1" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="DEU 2:2" />“Kuya IMNDEWA kanongela, <verse eid="DEU 2:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="DEU 2:3" />Myungayunga mna isi aino ya ipfidunda kwa matsuwa mengi, lelo sambi mhunduke mghende ubali wa kasikazini. <verse eid="DEU 2:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="DEU 2:4" />Walaghitse apfino iwanu, ‘Sambi baha mtsakwang'a mna ghumbaka ghwa ndughu tsenu, ilweleko lwa Esau, iwokala mna isi ya Seiri. Wawo watsowapfukani mwemwe, lekeni mwalangitse, <verse eid="DEU 2:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="DEU 2:5" />mleke kwitowa nawo, kwaapfila sitsoweng'ani baye isi yawo iwe yenu hata hanu chidogho ha ukukanyagha maghulu ghenu, kwaapfila nimwing'a Esau isi ya Seiri iwe yake. <verse eid="DEU 2:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="DEU 2:6" />Mghule ichijo chamkuja na ghamatsi ghamkunwa kulawa kuna wawo.’<verse eid="DEU 2:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="DEU 2:7" />“Kwaapfila IMNDEWA, Imulungu wenu, kawabaliki mwemwe kwa chila sang'ano yamtendile kwa ghamoko ghenu. Yeye tsakawalolesa mwemwe akula kunyika hamng'ali mwa mna ghumwanza, na yeye kahamwe na mwemwe kwa miyaka alubaini, namwe ng'amhungukighwe na chinu chochose baye.”<verse eid="DEU 2:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="DEU 2:8" />“Apfo tughendelela na ghumwanza na tuwabita ndughu tsetu, ilweleko lwa Esau iwokala mna isi ya Seiri. Tuhundukila nzila ya Araba, ilawila Elati na Esioni Geberi, tuhunduka na tubita nzila ili mnyika mwa Moabu. <verse eid="DEU 2:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="DEU 2:9" />Kuya IMNDEWA kanongela, ‘Mleke kuwatsupfa wanu wa Moabu wala kwandusa kwitowa nawo, kwaapfila sitsoweng'a mwemwe baye hata hanu chidogho ya isi yawo. Kwaapfila isi ya Ari niweng'a wana wa Lutu iwe yawo.’”<verse eid="DEU 2:9" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="DEU 2:10" />(Aho ghumwande iwanu iwang'ali wokala ako tsa Waemi, awo tsa wana bapfu, na wengi na watali ka wanu wa Anaki. <verse eid="DEU 2:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="DEU 2:11" />Nawo tsawamanyika ka Warefai ka pfawamanyike Waanaki. Lekeni wanu wa Moabu wowakema Waemi. <verse eid="DEU 2:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="DEU 2:12" />Na Wahori wang'ali wokala ako Seiri, lekeni watsukulu wa Esau wawawinga, wawakoma, na wakala wao wenyegho muisi, ka pfawatendile Wasiraeli mna isi iyaweng'ile IMNDEWA).<verse eid="DEU 2:12" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="DEU 2:13" />“Na IMNDEWA kalonga, ‘Mwinuke, mkaloke chikolongo cha Zeredi ichili mchiwala.’ ” Apfo tuloka ichikolongo acho. <verse eid="DEU 2:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="DEU 2:14" />Tsa ipfosa miyaka salasini na nane tangiya tulawe isi ya Kadeshi Barinea mbaka hatulokile ichikolongo cha Zeredi. Lweleko lwa iwanu wose wa ing'ondo tsawahupa mna indalo, ka apfila IMNDEWA pfayelahile. <verse eid="DEU 2:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="DEU 2:15" />IMNDEWA tsakaghendelela kuwatsupfa mbaka wose wahupa.<verse eid="DEU 2:15" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="DEU 2:16" />Hawafile wose, <verse eid="DEU 2:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="DEU 2:17" />IMNDEWA kanongela, <verse eid="DEU 2:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="DEU 2:18" />“Leloli mtsoloka ghumbaka ghwa Moabu kwa kwang'ila Ari. <verse eid="DEU 2:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="DEU 2:19" />Hamtsopfika habehi na wanu wa Amoni, mleke kuwatsupfa wala kwitowa nawo, kwa apfila sitsoweng'a baye hata hanu chidogho ha isi ya wana wa Amoni iwe yenu. Isi ayo niweng'a watsukulu wa Lutu iwe yawo.”<verse eid="DEU 2:19" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="DEU 2:20" />Isi ayo nayo ing'ali imanyika ka isi ya wanu wa Refai, kwaapfila Warefai wang'ali wokala ako ghumwande, lekeni Waamoni wowakema Wazamzumi. <verse eid="DEU 2:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="DEU 2:21" />Wazamzumi tsa wengi, wana ngupfu, na watali ka Waanaki. Lekeni IMNDEWA kawakoma hambele ha Waamoni, iwawabokile isi yawo na ukukala wawo. <verse eid="DEU 2:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="DEU 2:22" />IMNDEWA katenda ka pfayawatendele wana wa Esau, Waedomu, iwang'ali wokala Seiri, hayawakomile Wahori hambele hawo, nawo wawaboka isi yawo na wakala wawo mna isi ayo mbaka leloli. <verse eid="DEU 2:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="DEU 2:23" />Pfipfila Waavi, aho ghumwande wang'ali wokala mmbalimbali mwa Ibahari ya Mediteraniya mbaka ghumji ghwa Gaza, Wakafutori iwolawila isi ya Kirete wawakoma nawo wakala mna isi yawo.<verse eid="DEU 2:23" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="DEU 2:24" />“Kuya IMNDEWA katulongela, ‘Mke mloke ilwanda lwa Arinoni. Mlole nimwika mmoko mwenu Sihoni, mfalume wa Waamori wa Heshiboni na isi yake, mwanze kuisola isi yake na mumtowe. <verse eid="DEU 2:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="DEU 2:25" />Kulawa leloli nitsowatenda iwanu wose wali hasi ha lilanga wampfukeni na wone wogha. Na hawatsohulika mbuli tsenu watsoghudema, na kupfuka.’ ”<verse eid="DEU 2:25" /></para>
  <para style="s">Waisiraeli womtowa mfalume Sihoni</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="DEU 2:26" />“Kuya tsaniwatuma wanu mna inyika ya Kademoti waghenda kwa mfalume Sihoni wa Heshboni, waghale usenga auno iumbama yeye na iwanu wake waleke kwitowa na twetwe.” <verse eid="DEU 2:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="DEU 2:27" />Utuleke twang'e mna isi yako, tulumbilila kuwinza inzila yetu bila kuhunduka kumoso wala kujilo. <verse eid="DEU 2:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="DEU 2:28" />Utuutsile ichijo chatukuja na ghamatsi ghatukunwa. Lekeni utuleke twang'e muisi mwako, <verse eid="DEU 2:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="DEU 2:29" />mbaka tuloke ghumto ghwa Yoridani na kwingila mna isi iyotwing'a IMNDEWA, Imulungu wetu. Watsukulu wa Esau, iwokala Seiri na Wamoabu, iwokala Ari, pfipfila watuleka twang'a muisi yawo. <verse eid="DEU 2:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="DEU 2:30" />Lekeni Sihoni mfalume wa Heshboni katughoma tuleke kwang'a mna isi yake. Kwaapfila IMNDEWA, Imulungu wenu kalitenda litwi lyake na ghumoyo ghwake ghuwe msughu. <verse eid="DEU 2:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="DEU 2:31" />“IMNDEWA, Imulungu wetu kanongela, ‘Mlole, nimwika mmoko mwenu, mfalume Sihoni na isi yake, lelo mwanduse kumtowa na msole isi yake.’ ” <verse eid="DEU 2:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="DEU 2:32" />Sihoni kalawa na wanu wake katsa kwitowa na twetwe habehi na ghumji ghwa Jahazi. <verse eid="DEU 2:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="DEU 2:33" />Lekeni IMNDEWA Imulungu wetu kamwika mna ghamwoko ghetu. Tumkoma Sihoni, wanaghe, na wanu wake wose. <verse eid="DEU 2:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="DEU 2:34" />Bahala tumboka imiji yake yose na kuihinya yose, na tumkoma chila munu, wamale, wapinga na wana wadowado na ng'atumlekile munu wowose baye yawe mgima. <verse eid="DEU 2:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="DEU 2:35" />Tughogha iwanyama wawo na ipfinu ipfili mna ghumji pfiwe pfetu. <verse eid="DEU 2:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="DEU 2:36" />IMNDEWA katwapfila kuisola imiji ili mna isi ya Aroeli, na ikalile mmbalimbali mwa lwanda lwa Arinoni na ila ikalile mghati mwe lwanda alyo mbaka Gileadi na kuduhu mji ghwatonile ghuna ngupfu kuna twetwe, IMNDEWA Imulungu tsakatwing'a yose. <verse eid="DEU 2:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="DEU 2:37" />Lekeni ng'atughendile baye habehi na isi ya Waamoni wala mmbalimbali mwa kolongo lya Yaboki, au mna imiji ili mna isi itsili mpfidunda au hanu hohose ahala hayatughomile IMNDEWA wetu tughende.<verse eid="DEU 2:37" /></para>
  <chapter eid="DEU 2" />
  <chapter number="3" style="c" sid="DEU 3" />
  <para style="s">Waisiraeli womtowa Mfalume Ogu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="DEU 3:1" />“Kuya tuhunduka, na tugheluka kubitila nzila ighenda Bashani, na mfalume wa Bashani na wanu wake watutsila wetowe na twetwe habehi na ghumji ghwa Edirei. <verse eid="DEU 3:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="DEU 3:2" />IMNDEWA kanongela, ‘Mleke kumpfuka, kwaapfila nimwika mna ghamoko ghenu, yeye na iwanu wake wose na isi yake. Mtoweni ka pfamumtowile Sihoni, imfalume wa Waamori, iyang'ali yokala mna isi ya Heshiboni.’ ”<verse eid="DEU 3:2" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="DEU 3:3" />“Apfo IMNDEWA Imulungu wetu katwapfila tumtowa Ogi mfalume wa Bashani na iwanu wake, tuwadughadugha, na ng'atulekile munu baye. <verse eid="DEU 3:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="DEU 3:4" />Baho tumboka imiji yake, na kuduhu hata ghumwe ghwatughulekile mna imiji yose sitini ili mna isi ya Arigobu, isi iyaitawale mfalume Ogu wa Bashani. <verse eid="DEU 3:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="DEU 3:5" />Imiji yose ayo tsaitsungulusighwa mibanda mitali, na milango mikulu ine tsikufuli, pfipfila tsatuboka pfijiji pfilihela imibanda. <verse eid="DEU 3:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="DEU 3:6" />Tuihinya imiji ayo na kukoma chila munu, wamale, wapinga na wana wadowado ka pfatutendile mna isi ya Heshboni ya mfalume Sihoni. <verse eid="DEU 3:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="DEU 3:7" />Tuwaboka iwanyama na tsimali itsili mna imiji yawo.”<verse eid="DEU 3:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="DEU 3:8" />“Matsuwa agho tuisola isi ayo ya wafalume weli wa Waamori iwang'ali wokala kumwambu mwa ghumto Yoridani, haghati ha ghumto Arinoni na chidunda cha Herimoni. <verse eid="DEU 3:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="DEU 3:9" />Iwanu wa Sidoni wochikema ichidunda cha Herimoni Sirioni, na iwanu wa Amori wochikema Seniri. <verse eid="DEU 3:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="DEU 3:10" />Tuboka imiji yose ikalile mpfidunda, na isi yose ya Gileadi mbaka Saleka na Edirei na imiji ya Ogi, mfalume wa Bashani. <verse eid="DEU 3:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="DEU 3:11" />(Ogi mfalume wa Bashani yuyo iyakalile yaliyeka mna iwanu wa Refai, lusatsi lwake tsa lwa chuma, na tsaluna utali wa futi kumi na ndatu na nusu, na ughatsi wake tsa futi sita, na lung'ali lwabaho mna ghumji ghwa Raba mna isi ya Waamori.)”<verse eid="DEU 3:11" /></para>
  <para style="s">Ghamakabila ighakalile mashaliki ya Yoridani</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="DEU 3:12" />“Hatuibokile isi ayo iwe yetu, niweng'a Warubeni na Wagadi isi ilawa Aroeli ili mmbalimbali mwa chiwala cha Arinoni, na nusu isi ya pfidunda pfa Gileadi, na imiji yose ili mumo. <verse eid="DEU 3:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="DEU 3:13" />Kuya niweng'a nusu ya likabila lya Manase isi ikalile ya Gileadi, Bashani yose iyaitawale mfalume Ogu, isi yose ya Arigobu ayo yose ing'ali ikemighwa Bashani. Isi yose ya Bashani ing'ali imanyika ka isi ya wanu wa Refai.” <verse eid="DEU 3:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="DEU 3:14" />Yaili, munu wa likabila lya Manasse kasola isi yose ya Argobu mbaka hatsibakane isi tsa Geshuli na Maaka Katsikema isi atso kwa taghwa lyake mwenyegho, mbaka leloli isi ya Bashani yokemighwa Pfijiji pfa Yaili.<verse eid="DEU 3:14" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="DEU 3:15" />“Wanu wa lukolo lwa Makini iwolawila mna likabila lya Manase niwenng'a isi ya Gileadi. <verse eid="DEU 3:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="DEU 3:16" />Lekeni likabila lya Rubeni na lya Gadi niweng'a isi yose ya Gileadi mbaka kune ghumto ghwa Arnoni, aghati mwa lwanda lwa ghumto Anoni tsakuna ghumbaka ghwa kusini, na ghumbaka ghwa mashaliki tsa ghumto Yaboki, ghubakane na isi ya wanu wa Amori. <verse eid="DEU 3:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="DEU 3:17" />Na ubali wa maghalibi kuna ghumto Yoridani, kulawa tsiwa Galilaya na ghuhulumka mbaka bahali ya Araba, bahali ya munyu, mbaka kuhisi kwa Pisiga, ubali wa mashaliki.”<verse eid="DEU 3:17" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="DEU 3:18" />“Matsuwa aghala niwalaghitsani, ‘IMNDEWA Imulungu wenu kamwing'ani isi ino iwe yenu. Lelo mwemwe mna bapfu, msole tsisilaha tsenu mkaloke ghumto Yoridani aku muwalongolele Waisiraeli. <verse eid="DEU 3:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="DEU 3:19" />Lekeni wehe tsenu, wanenu na wanyama wenu, na nomanya mna wanyama wengi, watsokala mna imiji yaniweng'ile. <verse eid="DEU 3:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="DEU 3:20" />Muwapfile Wasiraeli wayenu mbaka wabwihile ka mwemwe pfambwihile, nawo wabokele isi iyoweng'a IMNDEWA, Imulungu wenu iwe yawo, isi ili kumwambu mwa ghumto Yoridani. Mng'atenda apfo mwodaha kuya mna isi ino yaniweng'ile iwe yenu.’ ”<verse eid="DEU 3:20" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="DEU 3:21" />“Kuya nimlaghitsa Yoshua, ‘Ghweghwe tsakona kwa nenge tsako mwenyegho aghala ghose ghayatendile IMNDEWA Imulungu wenu kwa wafalume awano weli, naye katsowatendela pfipfo wafalume wose wa chila isi yamtsoiboka iwe yenu. <verse eid="DEU 3:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="DEU 3:22" />Mleke kuwapfuka kwaapfila, IMNDEWA Imulungu wenu katsowatowelani mwemwe.’ ”<verse eid="DEU 3:22" /></para>
  <para style="s">Musa koghomighwa ukwingila Kanaani</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="DEU 3:23" />“Matsuwa agho nimdedetsa IMNDEWA, nilomba, <verse eid="DEU 3:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="DEU 3:24" />‘Ghwee IMNDEWA Mulungu, tsakwanza kunangusa nene mtumighwa wako, ukulu wako na ghumoko ghwako ghuna ngupfu. Kwaapfila kuna mulungu wachi yali kulanga au muisi iyodaha kutenda pfinu pfikulu pfakukangawatsa ka pfautendile ghweghwe? <verse eid="DEU 3:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="DEU 3:25" />Undeke niloke ghumto Yoridani, ndole isi ayo inoghile ili kumwambu mwa ghumto Yoridani, isi ine pfidunda pfinoghile na pfidunda pfa Lebanoni.’ ”<verse eid="DEU 3:25" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="DEU 3:26" />“Lekeni mwemwe mumtenda IMNDEWA Imulungu yambonele maya, kalema kunitegheletsa, kanongela, ‘Imala! Leka kunongela keli imbuli aino. <verse eid="DEU 3:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="DEU 3:27" />Ughende hane hanu ha ukutambikila cha chidunda Pisiga na ulole ghoya maghalibi, kasikazini, kusini na mashaliki. Lola pfinoghile achila chaukona, kwaapfila ng'autsoloka baye ghumto Yoridani. <verse eid="DEU 3:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="DEU 3:28" />Ummlaghitse Yoshua, umghume ghumoyo na ingupfu, kwaapfila yeye yuyo iyatsowalongotsa iwanu awano waloke ghumto, na kuisola isi yamuyona.’ ”<verse eid="DEU 3:28" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="DEU 3:29" />“Apfo tukala mna chiwala chili babehi na ghumji ghwa Beti Peori.”<verse eid="DEU 3:29" /></para>
  <chapter eid="DEU 3" />
  <chapter number="4" style="c" sid="DEU 4" />
  <para style="s1">Musa kowalaghitsa Waisiraeli wakinde malaghitso</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="DEU 4:1" />Musa kawalongela keli, “Tegheletseni mwemwe Waisiraeli, muikinde imiko na ghamalaghitso ghose ghaniwalangulitsa. Ghakindeni namwe mtsakuwa waghima na mtsoisola isi aila iyatsoweng'a IMNDEWA, Imulungu wa iwahenga wenu. <verse eid="DEU 4:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="DEU 4:2" />Mleke kongetsa wala kuhungutsa mbuli yoyose mna aghano ghaniwalaghitsa. Lekeni mghakinde ghamalaghitso gha IMNDEWA, Imulungu wenu ghaniwalaghitsa. <verse eid="DEU 4:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="DEU 4:3" />Mwemwe mwona kwa tsinenge tsenu chayatendile IMNDEWA kwa Baali Peori, IMNDEWA, Imulungu wenu kamkoma chila munu kulawa mna mwemwe, iyamuwinzile Baali Peori. <verse eid="DEU 4:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="DEU 4:4" />Lekeni mwemwe yamwikindilise na IMNDEWA, Imulungu wenu, mwawaghima mbaka leloli aino.”<verse eid="DEU 4:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="DEU 4:5" />“Mlole! Niwafunda imiko na ghamalaghitso ka pfayanilaghitse IMNDEWA, Imulungu wangu ili mkaghakinde hamtsakwingila na kuisola isi ayo iwe yenu. <verse eid="DEU 4:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="DEU 4:6" />Mng'aghakinda agho pfinoghile, wanu wa isi tsingi hawatsohulika ghamalaghitso agho, watsomanya ka mwemwe mkengela na mna mbutsi, nawo wotsolonga, ‘Iwanu wa isi ino ng'ulu wakengela na wana mbutsi’ ”.<verse eid="DEU 4:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="DEU 4:7" />“Haduhu isi yoyose aila, hata iwe ng'ulu pfihi, ine Imulungu iyali habehi nawo ka IMNDEWA, lmulungu wetu pfayali habehi na twetwe, iyotwidika chila hatumkema yatwapfile. <verse eid="DEU 4:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="DEU 4:8" />Wala haduhu isi yoyose aila, hata iwe ng'ulu pfihi, ina ghamalaghitso ghanoghile na igholongesa ka aghano ghaniwalangulitse leloli.”<verse eid="DEU 4:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="DEU 4:9" />“Lekeni mwalangitse mleke kwisemwa aghala ghose ghamwonile kwa nenge tsenu wenyegho. Ileke kulawila mwemwe kughasemwa mmoyo mwenu agho ghose mna ughima wenu. Muwapetele iwanenu na iwatsukulu wenu. <verse eid="DEU 4:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="DEU 4:10" />Mlikumbuke litsuwa alila hamwimile hambele ha IMNDEWA, Imulungu wenu ako Horebu, hayanongele, ‘Muwatinganitse hamwe iwanu awano hambele hangu, wahulike malonga ghangu, ili welangulitse kunipfuka nene matsuwa ghose gha ughima wawo muisi, nawo wadahe kuwalangulitsa iwana wawo.’ ”<verse eid="DEU 4:10" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="DEU 4:11" />Mseghela habei na mwima hasi ha ichidunda achila iching'ali chikwaka ghumoto ighupfikile mbaka kulanga, ichighubikighwe na ichisi na libingu. <verse eid="DEU 4:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="DEU 4:12" />Kuya IMNDEWA kalonga namwe kulawa mna ghumoto aghula. Muhulika ghamalonga ghayalongile lekeni ng'ammwonile baye umbo lyake lili pfihi, ila muhulika litsi liliyeka. <verse eid="DEU 4:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="DEU 4:13" />Kawapetelani laghano lyake, kawalaghitsa mlikinde, ghamalaghitso aghala kumi, ghayandike mna mabamba meli gha ghamabwe. <verse eid="DEU 4:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="DEU 4:14" />Na IMNDEWA kandaghitsa mna ghamatsuwa aghala niwalangulitse ghamalaghitso ghose ghambamighwa kughakinda mna isi yamghenda kuisola iwe yenu.<verse eid="DEU 4:14" /></para>
  <para style="s">Ukutambikila pfinyagho koghomighwa</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="DEU 4:15" />“Lelo mwalangitse, kwaapfila ng'amwonile lumbo lyolyose baye akula Horebu, IMNDEWA hayalongile namwe kulawa mna ghumoto, <verse eid="DEU 4:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="DEU 4:16" />ili mleke kutenda nzambi, kwa kwitendela wenyegho chinyagho cha lumbo lyolyose, liwe lya mmale au lya pinga, <verse eid="DEU 4:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="DEU 4:17" />au liwe lya mnyama yali muisi wala lya chideghe iyoghuluka mlanga, <verse eid="DEU 4:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="DEU 4:18" />au lilumbo ilighala na chiumbe ichitambala muisi, wala isomba yali mmatsi. <verse eid="DEU 4:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="DEU 4:19" />Na hamlola kulanga na kwona litsuwa, ilwetsi, na tsinondo na pfose pfili kuko, mwalangitse, mleke kunoghelwa napfo na kupfitamanila wala kupfitumikila, kwaapfila IMNDEWA, Imulungu wenu kapfiumba pfiwe pfa wanu wose iwali hasi ha lilanga. <verse eid="DEU 4:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="DEU 4:20" />Lekeni IMNDEWA kawasolani mna litanulu lya chuma akula Misiri ili muwe wanu wake, ka apfino pfamli leloli. <verse eid="DEU 4:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="DEU 4:21" />IMNDEWA tsakanighudubukila nene kwajili yenu, naye tsakelaha ghendo ka nene sitsoloka baye ghumto ghwa Yoridani na kwingila mna isi inoghile iyomwing'ani IMNDEWA, Imulungu wenu muisole iwe yenu. <verse eid="DEU 4:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="DEU 4:22" />Nene nitsakufila mna isi ino, sitsoloka baye ghumto, lekeni mwemwe mloke na muisole isi ayo inoghile iwe yenu. <verse eid="DEU 4:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="DEU 4:23" />Mwalangitse, mleke kwisemwa lilaghano IMNDEWA wenu lyayekile na mwemwe. Mleke kusongola chinyagho chochose ichighala na lumbo lyolyose lyawaghomile IMNDEWA, Imulungu wenu. <verse eid="DEU 4:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="DEU 4:24" />Kwaapfila IMNDEWA, Imulungu wenu ka lilambi ililakatsa, na Imulungu yane wipfu.”<verse eid="DEU 4:24" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="DEU 4:25" />“Hamtsokala matsuwa mengi mna isi ayo, na kweleka wana na kupata watsukulu, mng'anza ukwagha na kusongola chinyagho cha lumbo lyolyose, na kutenda ghehile hambele he IMNDEWA, Imulungu wenu na kumtenda yone maya, <verse eid="DEU 4:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="DEU 4:26" />nene leloli nokema lilanga lyone na isi yone pfamtsosumka kuhupa mna isi ili kumwambu kwa ghumto ghwa Yoridani yamloka mkaisole. Ng'amtsokala baye matsuwa mengi, lekeni mtsokomighwa ghendo. <verse eid="DEU 4:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="DEU 4:27" />Na IMNDEWA, Imulungu katsowapwililisa mna isi tsingi, na iwatsokala waghima ako watsakuwa chidogho, kuna tsiisi IMNDEWA, Imulungu tsayatsowawingila.”<verse eid="DEU 4:27" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="DEU 4:28" />Ako mtsotumikila milungu ya mibiki na ghamabwe, isongolighwe na ghamoko gha iwanu, nayo ng'aidaha baye kwona, wala kuhulika, wala kuja, wala kunusa. <verse eid="DEU 4:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="DEU 4:29" />Lekeni ako, mng'ambama IMNDEWA, Imulungu wenu mtsomwona ka mtsombama kwa ghumoyo ghwenu ghwose, na kwa ghumuhe ghwenu ghwose. <verse eid="DEU 4:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="DEU 4:30" />Hamtsoghanzika, na agho ghose ma ghang'awalawila, mtsomhundukila IMNDEWA, Imulungu wenu na kumhulikitsa chayolonga. <verse eid="DEU 4:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="DEU 4:31" />Kwaapfila IMNDEWA, Imulungu wenu, ka Imulungu wa libatsi, ng'atsowaleka baye au kuwalagha au kwisemwa lilaghano lyayekile na iwahenga wenu kwa ukwilaha. <verse eid="DEU 4:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="DEU 4:32" />“Lelo mghutse ipfinu pfilawile ghumwande, matsuwa aghala mwemwe ng'ana mwelekighwe baye, tangia litsuwa alila Imulungu hayaumbile imunu mna isi, muighutse isi yose kulawa membe imwe mbaka membe ingi, ka kulawila chinu chochose chikulu ka achino, au ka chihulikighwa chinu ka achino. <verse eid="DEU 4:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="DEU 4:33" />Angu hana wanu wangi iwahulike litsi lya Imulungu kolonga kulawa mmoto, ka mwemwe pfamuhulike, na waghendelela kuwa waghima? <verse eid="DEU 4:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="DEU 4:34" />Angu hana mulungu wowose iyaghetsile kughenda kusola iwanu wa isi imwe kulawa mna isi ingi kwa kuwaghetsa, kwa pfitango, kwa pfihulo, au kwa ng'ondo au kwa ghumoko ghuna ingupfu, au kwa ghumoko ighugholoke, au kwa pfinu ipfighuma wogha, ka apfila IMNDEWA, Imulungu wenu pfayawatendele ako Misiri, aku mwakwona kwa tsinenge tsenu? <verse eid="DEU 4:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="DEU 4:35" />Namwe mlangusighwa aghano ghose ili mmanye ghendo ka IMNDEWA yuyo Imulungu, yeye kayeka na haduhu yungi ka yeye. <verse eid="DEU 4:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="DEU 4:36" />Kawatenda muhulikitse litsi lyake kulawa kulanga ili yawafunde. Mne isi yeye kawalangusa ghumoto ghwake mkulu, na muhulika chayalongile kulawa mmoto. <verse eid="DEU 4:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="DEU 4:37" />Kwaapfila yeye kawakunda iwahenga wenu, na kawasaghula iwatsukulu wawo, kamlapfani kulawa isi ya Misiri kwa kughenda hamwe namwe na kwa ngupfu yake ili ng'ulu, <verse eid="DEU 4:37" /><verse number="38" style="v" sid="DEU 4:38" />ili kuwawinga hambele henu iwanu wa isi ng'ulu na tsina ingupfu kubita mwemwe, na kawaghala mkakale mna isi tsawo, na kamwing'ani tsiwe tsenu, ka pfaili leloli. <verse eid="DEU 4:38" /><verse number="39" style="v" sid="DEU 4:39" />Apfo mtange ghendo na mwike mna imimoyo yenu, ka IMNDEWA yuyo Imulungu iyali uchanya kulanga na iyali hasi kuisi. Kuduhu yungi. <verse eid="DEU 4:39" /><verse number="40" style="v" sid="DEU 4:40" />Apfo mkinde imiko na ghamalaghitso ghake ghanimwing'ani leloli, ili mbwede, mwemwe na iwatsukulu wenu iwatsakwoneka, na ili mkale matsuwa mengi mna isi iyomwing'ani IMNDEWA, Imulungu wenu iwe yenu matsuwa ghose.”<verse eid="DEU 4:40" /></para>
  <para style="s">Imiji ya ukutsumila</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="41" style="v" sid="DEU 4:41" />Kuya Musa kabaghula miji midatu ili kumwambu mwa ghumto Yoridani ubali wa kwalilawila litsuwa, <verse eid="DEU 4:41" /><verse number="42" style="v" sid="DEU 4:42" />ili munu wowose yadahe kutsumila ako ka kakoma imunu bila kumanya wala ng'amwihile baye. Imunu ka ayo katsotsumila mji ghwoghwose mna imiji ayo ili yahone kwa kukala mumo. <verse eid="DEU 4:42" /><verse number="43" style="v" sid="DEU 4:43" />Imiji yenyegho iyo aino, Beseri ili mna ichiwala cha nyika, wekilighwa Warubeni, na Ramoti ili Gileadi, wekilighwa Wagadi, na Golani ili Bashani wekilighwa Wamanase.<verse eid="DEU 4:43" /></para>
  <para style="s">Musa koweng'a ghamalaghitso Waisiraeli</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="44" style="v" sid="DEU 4:44" />Aghano ghagho ghamalaghitso Musa ghayaweng'ile Waisiraeli. <verse eid="DEU 4:44" /><verse number="45" style="v" sid="DEU 4:45" />Aino iyo imiko, malaghitso, na mahigho, Musa ghayaweng'ile hawalawile Misiri, <verse eid="DEU 4:45" /><verse number="46" style="v" sid="DEU 4:46" />hawang'ali wa kumwambu kwa ghumto ghwa Yoridani, mna lwanda iluli hambele ha Beti Peori, mna isi ya Waamori ya mfalume Sihoni, iyatawale ghumji ghwa Heshboni, iyatowighwe na Musa na Waisiraeli hawalawile Misiri. <verse eid="DEU 4:46" /><verse number="47" style="v" sid="DEU 4:47" />Waisola isi ayo iwa yawo, na isi ya Ogi mfalume wa Bashani, wawo iwafalume weli iwang'ali wokala kumwambu kwa ghumto ghwa Yoridani, ubali wa kwalilawila litsuwa. <verse eid="DEU 4:47" /><verse number="48" style="v" sid="DEU 4:48" />Isi aino yenela kulawa mmbalimbali mwa ghumto ghwa Arinoni mbaka mna chidunda cha Sirioni, sambi yomanyika Herimoni. <verse eid="DEU 4:48" /><verse number="49" style="v" sid="DEU 4:49" />Pfipfila na isi ili kumwambu kwa ghumto ghwa Yoridani ubali wa kwalilawila litsuwa, ibakane na Bahari ya Munyu, ili mna imihulumko ya Pisiga.<verse eid="DEU 4:49" /></para>
  <chapter eid="DEU 4" />
  <chapter number="5" style="c" sid="DEU 5" />
  <para style="s1">Malaghitso kumi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="DEU 5:1" />Musa kawakema hamwe wanu wose wa Isiraeli, kawalongela, “Mwemwe Isiraeli, tegheletseni malaghitso na mahigho ghaniwalongela leloli. Mwilangulitse na mwalangitse ukughakinda ghoya. <verse eid="DEU 5:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="DEU 5:2" />IMNDEWA, Imulungu wetu tsakeka laghano na twetwe ako Horebu. <verse eid="DEU 5:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="DEU 5:3" />Ng'ekile lilaghano alyo na iwahenga wetu waliyeka baye, lekeni keka na twetwe, twose ituli waghima leloli. <verse eid="DEU 5:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="DEU 5:4" />Yeye tsakalonga na mwemwe akula kuchidunda kulawa mna ghumoto ka imunu pfayolonga na miyaghe chihanga kwa chihanga. <verse eid="DEU 5:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="DEU 5:5" />Matsuwa aghala nene tsanyima haghati henu na IMNDEWA, kuwalongela achila chayalongile, kwaapfila tsampfuka ghumoto aghula, wala ng'amgheluke baye kuchidunda, naye kalonga, <verse eid="DEU 5:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="DEU 5:6" />‘Nene na IMNDEWA, Imulungu wenu yaniwalapfile isi ya Misiri, kwamkalile watumwa.’ ”<verse eid="DEU 5:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="DEU 5:7" />“Mleke kuwa na milungu ingi, ila nene niliyeka.”<verse eid="DEU 5:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="DEU 5:8" />“Mleke kwisongolela chinyagho, ichighala na chinu chochose chili kulanga au chili muisi wala chili mmatsi hasi ha isi.”<verse eid="DEU 5:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="DEU 5:9" />“Mleke kwinama na kupfitumikila, kwaapfila nene IMNDEWA, Imulungu wenu, na Imulungu yane wipfu, nowahigha iwana kwa aghala ghehile gha iwahenga wawo, mbaka mweleko ghwa kadatu na ghwa kane ghwa awala iwonihila. <verse eid="DEU 5:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="DEU 5:10" />Lekeni nowonela libatsi iwanu wa lweleko elufu iwonikunda, na iwokinda malaghitso ghangu.”<verse eid="DEU 5:10" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="DEU 5:11" />“Mleke kulikema hela taghwa lya IMNDEWA, Imulungu wenu, kwaapfila IMNDEWA ng'atsoleka baye ukumuhigha munu wowose iyolikema hela litaghwa lyake.”<verse eid="DEU 5:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="DEU 5:12" />“Mlikinde litsuwa lya Sabato, na mlike lienzeluke, ka IMNDEWA, Imulungu wenu pfayawalaghitse. <verse eid="DEU 5:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="DEU 5:13" />Matsuwa sita msang'ane, mtende sang'ano tsenu tsose, <verse eid="DEU 5:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="DEU 5:14" />lekeni tsuwa lya saba tsuwa lya Sabato, alyo libaghulighwa liwe lyangu nene. Mna litsuwa alyo mleke kusang'ana, mwemwe wala iwanenu wamale, wala iwanenu wapinga, wala imtumwa wenu mmale au pinga, wala ng'ombe wenu, wala chihongwe wenu, wala iwagheni iwokala mkaye mwenu ili watumwa wenu wapinga na wamale pfipfila wabwihile ka mwemwe. <verse eid="DEU 5:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="DEU 5:15" />Mkumbuke ka mwemwe tsa mwa watumwa ako Misiri, na ka IMNDEWA, Imulungu wenu kawakombola kwa ghumoko ghwake ghuna ingupfu na ighugholoke, apfo Imulungu wenu kawalaghitsa mlikinde litsuwa lya Sabato.”<verse eid="DEU 5:15" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="DEU 5:16" />“Muwategheletse aba tsenu na mai tsenu, ka IMNDEWA, Imulungu wenu pfayawalaghitse, ili mkale matsuwa mengi, na mkabalikighwe mna isi iyomwing'ani IMNDEWA, Imulungu wenu.”<verse eid="DEU 5:16" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="DEU 5:17" />“ ‘Mleke kukoma.’ ”<verse eid="DEU 5:17" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="DEU 5:18" />“ ‘Mleke kutenda ughoni.’ ”<verse eid="DEU 5:18" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="DEU 5:19" />“ ‘Mleke kwiba.’ ”<verse eid="DEU 5:19" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="DEU 5:20" />“ ‘Wala mleke kuwabangitsila wayenu.’ ”<verse eid="DEU 5:20" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="DEU 5:21" />“ ‘Mleke kuwasulukila wehe wa wayenu, wala mleke kusulukila ng'anda ya wayenu, mighunda yawo, wala iwatumwa wawo wamale, wala iwatumwa wawo wapinga, wala wang'ombe wawo, wala pfihongwe wawo, wala chinu chochose chayawali nacho wayenu.’ ”<verse eid="DEU 5:21" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="DEU 5:22" />“Aghano ghagho ghamalaghitso IMNDEWA ghayawalongele mwemwe wose kwa kukemelela akula kuchidunda kulawa mmoto, na libingu, na ichisi chikulu, wala ng'ongetse chinu chingi baye. Kuya kaghandika mna mabamba meli gha ghamabwe kangaya nene.”<verse eid="DEU 5:22" /></para>
  <para style="s">Iwanu wopfuka</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="DEU 5:23" />“Namwe hamuhulike litsi kulawa mchisi aku ichidunda chakwaka moto, iwakulu wose wa ghamakabila ghenu na wanzehe wenu wasoghela habehi. <verse eid="DEU 5:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="DEU 5:24" />Nawo walonga, ‘IMNDEWA, Imulungu wetu katulangusa utunitso wake, na ukulu wake, na tuhulika litsi lyake kulawa mmoto. Na leloli twona ghendo ka yodahika Imulungu kulonga na munu, na imunu ayo yawe mghima. <verse eid="DEU 5:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="DEU 5:25" />Lekeni lelo, hebali tufe? Ghumoto aghuno mkulu ghutsotukoma ghendo, na tung'ahulika keli litsi lye IMNDEWA, Imulungu wetu, tutsakufa. <verse eid="DEU 5:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="DEU 5:26" />Angu munu wachi yahulike litsi lya Imulungu yali mghima kolonga kulawa mmoto, ka twetwe pfatumuhulike, kuya yawe mghima? <verse eid="DEU 5:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="DEU 5:27" />Seghela habehi ghweghwe Musa, ukahulike ghayatsolonga IMNDEWA, Imulungu wetu, kuya uye utulongele ghose ghayokulongela. Twetwe tutsoghahulikitsa na kughakinda.’ ”<verse eid="DEU 5:27" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="DEU 5:28" />“Naye IMNDEWA kahulika litsi lya ghamalonga ghenu ghamnilongele nene, naye kanongela, ‘Nihulika ghawakulongele iwanu awano, na ghose ghawakulongele ghanogha.’ <verse eid="DEU 5:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="DEU 5:29" />Wang'awile na ghumoyo ka aghuno matsuwa ghose, ghwa kunipfuka, na kukinda malaghitso ghangu matsuwa ghose, wang'abwedile wawo na wana wawo matsuwa ghose. <verse eid="DEU 5:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="DEU 5:30" />Lelo uke, uwalongele, ‘Muye kuna ipfibumbulika pfenu. <verse eid="DEU 5:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="DEU 5:31" />Lekeni ghweghwe Musa wime habehi na nene, nani nitsokulongela imiko yose, mahigho, na malaghitso, ghautsowalangulitsa waghakinde mna isi yaniweng'a iwe yawo.’ ”<verse eid="DEU 5:31" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="DEU 5:32" />“Apfo mwalangitse, mghatende ghose ka IMNDEWA, Imulungu wenu pfayawalaghitse, ghakindeni ghendo. <verse eid="DEU 5:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="DEU 5:33" />Muiwinze inzila yose iyawalaghitse IMNDEWA, Imulungu wenu, ili mkale waghima, na kuko mtsobokela ghanoghile, namwe mtsakongetsa matsuwa ghenu ghawe mengi mna isi yamsola iwe yenu.”<verse eid="DEU 5:33" /></para>
  <chapter eid="DEU 5" />
  <chapter number="6" style="c" sid="DEU 6" />
  <para style="s1">Mumkunde IMNDEWA, Imulungu wenu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="DEU 6:1" />“Aghano ghagho ghamalaghitso, imiko, na malamtsi IMNDEWA, Imulungu wenu ghayanilaghitse niwafunde. Mkaghakinde mna isi yamghenda kuisola iwe yenu, <verse eid="DEU 6:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="DEU 6:2" />ili mwemwe, na wana wenu na watsukulu wenu, wadahe kumpfuka IMNDEWA, Imulungu wenu matsuwa ghose, kwa kukinda ghamalaghitso ghake na imiko yake yose, ili mkale matsuwa mengi. <verse eid="DEU 6:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="DEU 6:3" />Lelo, mtegheletse mwemwe Waisiraeli, mwalangitse kughakinda ghamalaghitso ili mkamotetsighwe na mwongetseke muwe wengi mna isi ayo ine lidongo linoghile kwa kulima na kufughila wanyama, ka IMNDEWA, Imulungu wa iwahenga wenu pfayelaghane namwe.”<verse eid="DEU 6:3" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="DEU 6:4" />“Tegheletseni mwemwe Waisiraeli, IMNDEWA, Imulungu wetu, yeye ka IMNDEWA yaliyeka. <verse eid="DEU 6:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="DEU 6:5" />Mumkunde IMNDEWA, Imulungu wenu kwa ghumoyo ghwenu ghwose, na kwa ghumuhe ghwenu ghwose, na kwa tsingupfu tsenu tsose. <verse eid="DEU 6:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="DEU 6:6" />Mleke kwisemwa ghamalonga aghano ghanimlaghitsani leloli, ila mgheke mmoyo mwenu. <verse eid="DEU 6:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="DEU 6:7" />Muwafunde iwana wenu, muwapetele hamkala mkaye mwenu, na hamghenda mnzila, hamuwasa na hamlamka. <verse eid="DEU 6:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="DEU 6:8" />Mghohe mmoko mwenu, na mghapfale mchihanga mwenu ka msipi ili mghakumbukeghe. <verse eid="DEU 6:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="DEU 6:9" />Mghandike mna imilango yenu na mna ghamalango gha imiji yenu.”<verse eid="DEU 6:9" /></para>
  <para style="s">Waisiraeli wokanyighwa</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="DEU 6:10" />“IMNDEWA, Imulungu wenu hayatsowaghala mna isi iyelahile kwa iwahenga wenu Aburahamu, Isaka na Yakobu ka katsoweng'ani isi ina imiji mikulu na inoghile, ing'aitsengighwe baye na mwemwe, <verse eid="DEU 6:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="DEU 6:11" />na tsing'anda itsimemile pfinu pfinoghile, ing'ampfimemetse baye mwemwe, pfisima pfa matsi ing'ampfihimbile mwemwe, na mighunda ya minzeituni na minzabibu ing'aihandighwe na mwemwe, hamtsakuja na kwighuta, <verse eid="DEU 6:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="DEU 6:12" />mwalangitse mleke kumsemwa IMNDEWA, iyawalapfile Misiri, isi yamkalile watumwa. <verse eid="DEU 6:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="DEU 6:13" />Mumpfuke IMNDEWA, Imulungu wenu, mumtumikile yeye yaliyeka, na mwilahe kwa taghwa lyake. <verse eid="DEU 6:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="DEU 6:14" />Mleke kuitumikila milungu ingi, imilungu ya iwanu iwowatsunguluka, <verse eid="DEU 6:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="DEU 6:15" />kwaapfila IMNDEWA, Imulungu wenu, iyali haghatighati henu, ka Imulungu yana iwipfu, hela imaya ya IMNDEWA, Imulungu wenu itsowakilani mwemwe na kuwakoma wose mhupe kulawa mna isi.”<verse eid="DEU 6:15" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="DEU 6:16" />“Mleke kumghetsa IMNDEWA, Imulungu wenu, ka pfamumghetsile akula Masa. <verse eid="DEU 6:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="DEU 6:17" />Ghakindeni ghoya ghamalaghitso ghose gha IMNDEWA, Imulungu wenu, ghamalamtsi ghake, na imiko yake iyawalaghitse. <verse eid="DEU 6:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="DEU 6:18" />Namwe mtende aghala ighanoghile hambele ha IMNDEWA, ili mkamotetsighwe, na mdahe kwingila na kuisola iwe yenu, isi inoghile iyelahile kwa iwahenga wenu, <verse eid="DEU 6:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="DEU 6:19" />ka katsowawinga awala wose iwowehila ka IMNDEWA pfayalongile.”<verse eid="DEU 6:19" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="DEU 6:20" />“Na matsuwa ighakutsa, iwanenu wang'awaghutsa apfino, ‘Ule IMNDEWA, Imulungu wetu katulaghitsa kughakinda malaghitso, malamtsi na imiko aino?’ <verse eid="DEU 6:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="DEU 6:21" />Namwe muwedike apfino, ‘Tsatukala watumwa wa Farao ako Misiri, lekeni IMNDEWA katulapfa kulawa Misiri kwa ghumoko ghwake ghune ingupfu. <verse eid="DEU 6:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="DEU 6:22" />IMNDEWA kalangusa pfitango, pfinzonza, na pfihulo kwa Wamisiri, na kwa Farao, na kwa iwakulu wake, aku twakona kwa tsinenge tsetu wenyegho. <verse eid="DEU 6:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="DEU 6:23" />Na katulapfa Misiri katughala akuno, na katwing'a isi iyelahile kuweng'a iwahenga wetu. <verse eid="DEU 6:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="DEU 6:24" />IMNDEWA katulaghitsa kuikinda imiko ino, na kumpfuka IMNDEWA Imulungu, ili matsuwa ghose twibwede na yatwike waghima ka leloli ino. <verse eid="DEU 6:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="DEU 6:25" />Tung'alangitsa kughakinda ghamalaghitso aghano hambele ha IMNDEWA, Imulungu wetu, ka pfayatulaghitse, tutsotogholighwa hambele hake.’ ”<verse eid="DEU 6:25" /></para>
  <chapter eid="DEU 6" />
  <chapter number="7" style="c" sid="DEU 7" />
  <para style="s1">Kuwawinga iwanu muisi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="DEU 7:1" />“IMNDEWA, Imulungu wenu hayatsowaghala mna isi yamghenda kuisola iwe yenu, katsowawinga wanu wali muisi amwo, Wahiti, Wagirigashi, Waamori, Wakanani, Waperizi, Wahivi, na Wayebusi, iwanu awo wa tsiisi atso saba wakulu na wana ngupfu kubita mwemwe. <verse eid="DEU 7:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="DEU 7:2" />Kuya IMNDEWA, Imulungu wenu hayatsoweka iwanu awo mna ghamoko ghenu, muwatowe, na muwakome ghendo, mleke kwilaghana nawo, na mleke kuwonela libatsi. <verse eid="DEU 7:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="DEU 7:3" />Mleke kwikwela nawo, mleke kuwaleka wanenu wamale wawakwele wana wawo mapinga, au wanenu iwapinga wakwelighwe nawo. <verse eid="DEU 7:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="DEU 7:4" />Mng'atenda apfo wawo watsowaghitsa wanenu kuitegheletsa milungu ingi, naye IMNDEWA katsowonela maya mwemwe na ng'atsokawa baye kuwakoma. <verse eid="DEU 7:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="DEU 7:5" />Lekeni muwatendele pfino, mbomole matsabahu tsawo, tsituleni tsingutso tsawo tsa ghamabwe, mupfighane pfinyagho pfawo pfa Ashera, na mpfilakatse pfinyagho pfawo pfo kusongola. <verse eid="DEU 7:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="DEU 7:6" />Kwaapfila mwemwe mwa wanu iwenzeluke we IMNDEWA, Imulungu wenu. Kamsaghulani mwemwe kulawa mna iwanu wose iwali muisi muwe iwanu wake mwenyegho.”<verse eid="DEU 7:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="DEU 7:7" />“IMNDEWA ng'awakundile baye mwemwe wala ng'awasaghuleni mwemwe baye kwaapfila tsa mwawengi kubita wanu wose, ila tsakawakunda na kawasaghula hata ka tsa mwa chidogho kubita wanu wose. <verse eid="DEU 7:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="DEU 7:8" />Lekeni ilawila apfo kwaapfila IMNDEWA, Imulungu tsakawakunda na tsakabama kutenda achila chayelahile ne wahenga wenu, chinu acho chicho ichimtendile yeye yawaghombole mwemwe kwa ngupfu tsake ng'ulu mlawe mna isi ayo ya utumwa, na mna ghumoko ghwa Farao mfalume wa Misiri. <verse eid="DEU 7:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="DEU 7:9" />Apfo mmanye ghendo IMNDEWA, Imulungu ka Imulungu, yeye ka Imulungu yotogholighwa, yokinda laghano lyake, kotenda wende kwa pfeleko pfingi pfe wanu awala iwomkunda yeye, na iwokinda ghamalaghitso ghake. <verse eid="DEU 7:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="DEU 7:10" />Lekeni yeye katsowaliha awala wose iwomwihila, wala ng'atsokawa baye, katsowahigha awala iwomwihila. <verse eid="DEU 7:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="DEU 7:11" />Apfo mwalangitse kukinda imiko, ghamalaghitso, na malamtsi ghaniwalaghitsa leloli.”<verse eid="DEU 7:11" /></para>
  <para style="s">Tsibalaka tsa ukukinda Ghamalaghitso</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="DEU 7:12" />“Mng'aghategheletsa malaghitso aghano, na mng'aghakinda na kughatenda, naye IMNDEWA, Imulungu wenu katsokinda laghano lyake na kuwatendela wende ka pfayelahile kwa iwahenga wenu. <verse eid="DEU 7:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="DEU 7:13" />Katsowakunda, na kuwamotetsa namwe mtsakongetseka na kuwa na wana wengi, katsomotetsa imighunda yenu, ili mpate pfijo pfingi, dipfai na mapfuta, na kuweng'ani iwanyama wengi, wang'ombe na ng'olo wengi. Katsowamotetsa kwa kumwing'ani ghano ghose mna isi iyelahile kwa iwahenga wenu ka katsoweng'ani mwemwe. <verse eid="DEU 7:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="DEU 7:14" />Mtsomotetsighwa kubita wanu wangi, kutsakuwa kuduhu immale wala ipinga mna mwemwe iyalihela mwana wala iwanyama wenu nawo ng'awatsokala baye bila wana. <verse eid="DEU 7:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="DEU 7:15" />IMNDEWA wenu katsoghalapfa ghamatamu ghose mna mwemwe, na kuduhu utamu wihile utsowapatani mwemwe ka aula uwapatile akula Misiri, lekeni utamu awo katsoweng'a awala iwowehila mwemwe. <verse eid="DEU 7:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="DEU 7:16" />Namwe wakomeni iwanu wose iyowaghalila IMNDEWA, Imulungu wenu mna ghamoko ghenu, mleke kuwonela libatsi ghendo, mleke kuitumikila milungu yawo, kwaapfila alyo litsakuwa mtegho kuna mwemwe.”<verse eid="DEU 7:16" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="DEU 7:17" />“Mwodaha kwilongela wenyegho, ‘Iwanu awano wana ngupfu na wa wengi kubita twetwe, tutsodahatse kuwawinga mna isi yawo?’ <verse eid="DEU 7:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="DEU 7:18" />Lekeni mleke kuwapfuka, mkumbuke achila IMNDEWA, Imulungu wenu chayamtendile Farao na wanu wake wose wa Misiri. <verse eid="DEU 7:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="DEU 7:19" />Mkumbuke utamu wihile, ipfihulo, na ipfinzonza, na ghumoko ghune ingupfu, na ighugholoke pfamwonile kwa nenge tsenu wenyegho IMNDEWA, Imulungu wenu pfayatumile kuwakombola, apfi pfipfo pfamtsowatendela iwanu wala wamuwapfuka. <verse eid="DEU 7:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="DEU 7:20" />Kuya IMNDEWA, Imulungu wenu katsowaghalila wanzukwi wawakome iwanu awala iwepfisa mleke kuwona. <verse eid="DEU 7:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="DEU 7:21" />Mleke kuwapfuka, kwaapfila IMNDEWA, Imulungu wenu, iyokala mghati mwenu, yeye kamkulu na kopfukighwa. <verse eid="DEU 7:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="DEU 7:22" />Yeye katsowawinga iwanu wano chidoghochidogho aku mwolola kwa tsinenge tsenu. Ng'ambamighwa baye kuwawinga mala lumwe, mng'atenda apfo wanyama wa kwibagho watsakongetseka kuna mwemwe. <verse eid="DEU 7:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="DEU 7:23" />Lekeni IMNDEWA, Imulungu wenu katsowaghela mna ghamoko ghenu na katsowatenda wawelukeweluke, mbaka wamale kukomighwa. <verse eid="DEU 7:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="DEU 7:24" />Naye katsowaghela iwafalume wawo mna ghamoko ghenu, mtsowakoma na mtsowasemwa ghendo hasi ha kulanga, kuduhu munu iyodaha kwima hambele henu, kuwaghoma mbaka mmalitse kuwakoma. <verse eid="DEU 7:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="DEU 7:25" />Mpfihinye pfinyagho pfawo na mpfilakatse mmoto, mleke kusulukila nzahabu wala fetsa, na mleke kusola pfiwe pfenu, agho ghatsakuwa mtegho kuna mwemwe, kwaapfila IMNDEWA, Imulungu wenu kopfihila. <verse eid="DEU 7:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="DEU 7:26" />Mleke kughala pfinyagho mmakaye mwenu, hela mtsolighitighwa ka pfinyagho apfo, mpfihile na kupfilema ghendo, kwaapfila pfilighitighwa na Imulungu.”<verse eid="DEU 7:26" /></para>
  <chapter eid="DEU 7" />
  <chapter number="8" style="c" sid="DEU 8" />
  <para style="s1">Isi inoghile yamtsosola</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="DEU 8:1" />“Mwalangitse kughakinda malaghitso ghose ghanimlaghitsani leloli, ili muwe waghima na mwongetseke na mwingile mkaisole isi ila iwe yenu IMNDEWA, Imulungu wenu iyelahile kuweng'a iwahenga wenu. <verse eid="DEU 8:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="DEU 8:2" />Mkumbuke IMNDEWA, Imulungu wenu pfayawalongotse mna ghumwanza ghwenu mna nyika kwa miyaka ino alubaini, na kuwaghetsa ili yamanye ighali mmoyo mwenu, ka mtsokinda malaghitso ghake au ng'amtsokinda baye. <verse eid="DEU 8:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="DEU 8:3" />Kawadununza, kawaleka mkale na nzala, hambele kaweng'ani imana mje, ichijo acho ng'amchimanyile baye wala iwahenga wenu, katenda apfo ili yawalangulitse ka imunu ng'okala mghima kwa chighate chiliyeka baye, lekeni kwa chila chinu chayolonga IMNDEWA. <verse eid="DEU 8:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="DEU 8:4" />Maghwanda ghenu ng'aghalalile baye wala mighulu yenu ng'aipfimbile baye mna imiyaka ayo alubaini. <verse eid="DEU 8:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="DEU 8:5" />Pfipfila mmanye ghendo mna mimoyo yenu imunu pfayomfunda imwanaghe, pfipfo IMNDEWA pfayomfundani. <verse eid="DEU 8:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="DEU 8:6" />Lelo mghakinde ghamalaghitso ghe IMNDEWA, Imulungu wenu, muwinze nzila tsake na kumpfuka yeye. <verse eid="DEU 8:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="DEU 8:7" />Kwaapfila IMNDEWA, Imulungu wenu katsowaghala mna isi inoghile, isi ina ipfikolongo pfa ghamatsi, tsimbwibwi, na pfisima pfe ghamatsi igholawa mlwanda na mpfidunda. <verse eid="DEU 8:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="DEU 8:8" />Isi ine ngano na shayili, minzabibu, mitini na mikomamanga, isi ine mapfuta gha mitseituni na uki. <verse eid="DEU 8:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="DEU 8:9" />Isi ayo ina pfijo bwelele, na ng'amtsohungikighwa na chinu chochose baye, isi ayo ina mabwe gha chuma na mna pfidunda pfake mwodaha kihimba shaba. <verse eid="DEU 8:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="DEU 8:10" />Mtsakuja na kwighuta, mtsolonga mighede kwa IMNDEWA, Imulungu wenu kwa isi inoghile iyaweng'ile.”<verse eid="DEU 8:10" /></para>
  <para style="s">Wokanyighwa waleke kumsemwa IMNDEWA</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="DEU 8:11" />“Mwalangitse mleke kumsemwa IMNDEWA, Imulungu wenu, kwa kuleka kughakinda ghamalaghitso ghake, imiko yake, na malamtsi ghake ghanimlaghitsani leloli. <verse eid="DEU 8:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="DEU 8:12" />Hamtsakuja na kwighuta, na hamtsotsenga ing'anda inoghile na kukala mumo, <verse eid="DEU 8:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="DEU 8:13" />na ng'ombe wenu na ng'olo wenu hawakongetseka, nzahabu, na fetsa tsenu na pfose pfamli napfo hapfitsakongetseka, <verse eid="DEU 8:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="DEU 8:14" />ghumoyo ghwenu ghuleke kwighoda na kumsemwa IMNDEWA, Imulungu wenu iyawalapfile Misiri, mna isi ya utumwa. <verse eid="DEU 8:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="DEU 8:15" />Kawalongotsani mna inyika ila ng'ulu ighela wogha, ine wanzoka na inge, inyika isakale na ilihela matsi, kawalapfila ghamatsi kulawa mbambalawe. <verse eid="DEU 8:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="DEU 8:16" />Kaweng'ani imana ako kunyika, ichijo acho ng'awachimanyile baye iwahenga wenu. Katenda apfo yawadununze na yawaghetse, ili hambele mbwede. <verse eid="DEU 8:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="DEU 8:17" />Mleke kwilongela mna mimoyo yenu, ‘Ingupfu yangu na ukudaha kwangu kungaya tsimali tsino tsose.’ <verse eid="DEU 8:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="DEU 8:18" />Lekeni mkumbuke ghendo ka IMNDEWA, Imulungu wenu yuyo iyoweng'a tsimali atso, ili yaghendelele kulikinda laghano lyayekile ne iwahenga wenu, ka pfaili leloli ino. <verse eid="DEU 8:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="DEU 8:19" />Lekeni mng'amsemwa IMNDEWA, Imulungu wenu na kutegheletsa milungu ingi na kuitambikila, leloli ino nowakanya mtsokomighwa ghendo. <verse eid="DEU 8:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="DEU 8:20" />Ka iwanu wa isi tsila pfawakomighwe na IMNDEWA hambele yenu, namwe pfipfila mtsokomighwa ka wawo kwa kuleka kumtegheletsa IMNDEWA, Imulungu wenu.”<verse eid="DEU 8:20" /></para>
  <chapter eid="DEU 8" />
  <chapter number="9" style="c" sid="DEU 9" />
  <para style="s1">Si kwa ukunogha kwawo Waisiraeli</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="DEU 9:1" />“Tegheletseni mwemwe Waisiraeli! Leloli mwa habehi kuloka ghumto Yoridani kughenda kusola isi ng'ulu na iwokala iwanu wengi na wene ngupfu kubita mwemwe, na miji ye iwanu awo mikulu na itsungulutsighwa ubanda iupfika kulanga. <verse eid="DEU 9:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="DEU 9:2" />Wanu wenyegho Waanaki, awo wana ngupfu, na watali, ka apfila pfamuwamanyile na pfamuhulike iwanu wowalonga, ‘Yuhi yodaha kwima hambele ya Waanaki?’ <verse eid="DEU 9:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="DEU 9:3" />Lekeni mmanye ghendo ka IMNDEWA, Imulungu wenu yuyo iyowalongolela ka ghumoto ighulakatsa, ng'atsokawa baye kuwakoma na kuwahuma hambele yenu, mtsowawinga na kuwatenda wahupe ghendo ka Imulungu pfayawalongele.”<verse eid="DEU 9:3" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="DEU 9:4" />“IMNDEWA, Imulungu wenu hayomalitsa kuwawinga hambele yenu, mleke kwilongela wenyegho pfino ‘Imulungu kangala ahano kusola isi aino kwa ukutogholighwa kwangu.’ Ila Imulungu kawawinga iwanu wano kwaapfila wawo weha. <verse eid="DEU 9:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="DEU 9:5" />Mtsoisola isi yawo si ka mwemwe mnogha au mwotogholighwa, ila mwoisola kwaapfila wanu awo weha. IMNDEWA, Imulungu wenu kowawinga wanu wano hambele yenu, kobama yachike achila chayelahile na iwahenga wenu, kwa Aburahamu, Isaka, na Yakobu. <verse eid="DEU 9:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="DEU 9:6" />Apfo mmanye ghendo ka IMNDEWA, Imulungu wenu komwing'ani isi ino inoghile si ka mwemwe mnogha, ila mwemwe mwa wasughu. <verse eid="DEU 9:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="DEU 9:7" />Mleke kwisemwa pfamumtendile IMNDEWA, Imulungu wenu yone maya akula kunyika. Tangiya hamlawile mna isi ya Misiri mbaka hampfikile hano, mwemwe mghendelela kumlemela IMNDEWA. <verse eid="DEU 9:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="DEU 9:8" />Namwe mumtenda IMNDEWA yone maya hane chidunda cha Horebu, naye tsakona maya na kabama yawakome. <verse eid="DEU 9:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="DEU 9:9" />Hangeluke kuchidunda kubokela mabamba ghe ghamabwe ghandikighwe lilaghano lyayekile Imulungu na mwemwe, ng'ala kuchidunda matsuwa alubaini chilo na misi. Sijile chijo chochose baye wala kunwa matsi.”<verse eid="DEU 9:9" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="DEU 9:10" />“Kuya IMNDEWA kangaya mabamba meli ghe ghamabwe ghandikighwe na ichidole cha Imulungu. Mchanya mwa ghamabwe agho tsa mna ghamalaghitso ghose gha IMNDEWA ghayawalongele akula kuchidunda kulawa hane ghumoto, mna litsuwa lya mtingano. <verse eid="DEU 9:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="DEU 9:11" />Matsuwa alubaini haghamalile, ghanikalile chilo na misi, IMNDEWA kangaya mabamba meli ghe ghamabwe ighandikighwe lilaghano.”<verse eid="DEU 9:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="DEU 9:12" />“Kuya Imulungu kanongela, ‘Uhulumke sambi baha, kwaapfila wanu wako wauwalapfile kulawa Misiri wagha. Waghaleka aghala ghaniwaghitse na wetendela wenyegho chinyagho cha kulubula.’ ”<verse eid="DEU 9:12" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="DEU 9:13" />“Na IMNDEWA kanongela, ‘Niwona wanu wano, na ulole awano wasughu ghendo. <verse eid="DEU 9:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="DEU 9:14" />Undeke niwakome na nilibaghuse taghwa lyao ahano muisi. Na nitsokutenda ghweghwe uwe na wanu wengi, na wane ngupfu kubita wawo.’ ”<verse eid="DEU 9:14" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="DEU 9:15" />“Apfo nihunduka na kuhulumka kulawa kuchidunda aku nikinda ghamabamba meli ighandikighwe lilaghano mna ghamoko ghangu. Na ghumoto ghung'ali ghukwaka mna chidunda. <verse eid="DEU 9:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="DEU 9:16" />Handolile, nikangawala ghendo hambonile mwemwe ma mumtendela nzambi IMNDEWA, Imulungu wenu, mwitendela wenyegho chinyagho che imwana we ng'ombe. Msumka kughaleka aghala ghose ghayawalaghitse IMNDEWA. <verse eid="DEU 9:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="DEU 9:17" />Apfo nikinda ghamabamba meli gha ghamabwe, nighasa kulawa mna ghamoko ghangu, nighabena aku mwemwe mwolola. <verse eid="DEU 9:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="DEU 9:18" />Kuya nifunama keli hambele ha IMNDEWA Imulungu matsuwa alubaini, chilo na misi, ka pfanongole kutenda. Sijile baye chijo chochose wala kunwa matsi. Nenda apfo kwaapfila mwemwe mumtendela ghehile IMNDEWA, na mumghobola yeye yone maya. <verse eid="DEU 9:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="DEU 9:19" />Tsaniipfuka imaya ye IMNDEWA, kwaapfila yeye tsakona maya ng'ani na kabama kuwakomani, lekeni IMNDEWA kanitegheletsa keli. <verse eid="DEU 9:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="DEU 9:20" />Na IMNDEWA tsakamghudubukila Aruni, kabama yamkome, na baho nimlomba yaleke kumkoma. <verse eid="DEU 9:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="DEU 9:21" />Kuya nichisola ichinu chila chihile, imwana yula we ng'ombe yamumtendile, na nimlakatsa mna ghumoto. Kuya nimhondahonda na nimsagha, kawa ka timbwisi, kuya nilyasa litimbwisi alyo mna chikolongo ichihulumka kulawa kuchidunda. <verse eid="DEU 9:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="DEU 9:22" />Pfipfila mwemwe mumtenda IMNDEWA yone maya akula Tabera, Masa na Kibroti Hataava. <verse eid="DEU 9:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="DEU 9:23" />Na IMNDEWA hayawatumile kulawa Kadeshi Barinea, kalonga, ‘Mgheluke na mkaisole isi yanimwing'eni iwe yenu.’ Lekeni mwemwe mlema laghitso lye IMNDEWA Imulungu wenu. Ng'amumtoghole baye wala ng'amumtegheletse baye. <verse eid="DEU 9:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="DEU 9:24" />Muwa wanu wa kumlema IMNDEWA, tangiya haniwamanyile mwemwe.”<verse eid="DEU 9:24" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="DEU 9:25" />“Nifunama hambele ye IMNDEWA matsuwa agho alubaini chilo na misi kwaapfila IMNDEWA tsakalonga yang'awakomile. <verse eid="DEU 9:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="DEU 9:26" />Nimlomba IMNDEWA nilonga, ‘Ghwee IMNDEWA Imulungu uleke kuwakoma iwanu wano. Iwanu wano wa kwako ghweghwe mwenyegho, wauwakombole kwa ngupfu yako na wauwalapfile ako Misiri kwa ghumoko ghwako ghune ngupfu.’ <verse eid="DEU 9:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="DEU 9:27" />Uwakumbuke watumighwa wako, Aburahamu, Isaka na Yakobu, wala uleke kulola usughu wawo, wala ukwiha kwawo, wala inzambi yawo. <verse eid="DEU 9:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="DEU 9:28" />Hela iwanu wa isi ya Misiri, isi yautulapfile watsolonga, ‘Kwaapfila IMNDEWA ng'adahile baye kuwasola na kuwaghala mna isi iyelaghane nawo.’ Au wodaha kulonga, ‘Tsakawasola na kawaghala kunyika yawakomele kuko kwaapfila tsakawahila. <verse eid="DEU 9:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="DEU 9:29" />Lekeni wawo wa iwanu wako, iwanu wauwalapfile kwa tsingupfu tsako na kwa ghumoko ghwako ighugholoke.’ ”<verse eid="DEU 9:29" /></para>
  <chapter eid="DEU 9" />
  <chapter number="10" style="c" sid="DEU 10" />
  <para style="s">Musa kobokela keli ghamalaghitso kumi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="DEU 10:1" />“Haghamalile matsuwa aghala IMNDEWA kanongela, ‘Usongole mabamba meli gha ghamabwe ka aghala ghanongole kusongola, na lisanduku lya mbau, kuya utse kuna nene aku kuchidunda. <verse eid="DEU 10:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="DEU 10:2" />Na nene nitsakwandika mna ghamabamba agho ghamalonga aghala ghanongole ukwandika mna ghamabamba aghala ighalongole, ghaughabenile. Kuya mgheke mna lisanduku alyo.’ ”<verse eid="DEU 10:2" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="DEU 10:3" />“Apfo nitengenetsa lisanduku lya mbiki ghwa mshita, nisongola ghamabamba meli ghe ghamabwe ka aghala gha mwanduso, na nigheluka kuchidunda aku ng'inda ghamabamba agho mmoko mwangu. <verse eid="DEU 10:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="DEU 10:4" />Kuya IMNDEWA kandika mna ghamabamba agho meli ghamalonga ka aghala ghayalongole ukwandika, malaghitso aghala kumi ghayawalongele akula kuchidunda, kulawa mmoto, mna litsuwa lya ghumtingano, kuya IMNDEWA kangaya nene ghamabamba agho. <verse eid="DEU 10:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="DEU 10:5" />Nihunduka, nihulumka kuchidunda, nyika ghamabamba agho meli mna lisanduku lyanitengenetse, ka IMNDEWA pfayanongele, na mbaka sambi ghamumo mna lisanduku alyo ka IMNDEWA pfayanilaghitse.”<verse eid="DEU 10:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="DEU 10:6" />“(Waisiraeli tsawanga kulawa mna pfisima pfa Wayakani mbaka Mosera. Kuko Aruni tsakafa na katsikighwa kuko, Eliazali imwanaghe, kasola ing'onde yake na kawa mtambika. <verse eid="DEU 10:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="DEU 10:7" />Kulawa kuko, waghenda mbaka wapfika Gudigoda, walawa Gudigoda waghenda Yotibata, isi ayo ina pfikolongo pfingi pfe ghamatsi. <verse eid="DEU 10:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="DEU 10:8" />Matsuwa agho IMNDEWA kawasaghula iwanu wa likabila lya Lawi, wadute lisanduku alyo lye lilaghano lye IMNDEWA, na wakeme hambele ha IMNDEWA, wamsang'anile, na wawabaliki iwanu kwa taghwa lyake, ka pfowotenda leloli. <verse eid="DEU 10:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="DEU 10:9" />Apfo pfipfo pfapfili kwa iwanu wa likabila lya Lawi, wawo ng'awabokele baye isi yoyose ila iwe yawo ka ndughu tsawo pfawabokele, lekeni wawo wabokela ing'onde ya kuwa iwatambika we IMNDEWA, ka apfila IMNDEWA pfayawalongele.)”<verse eid="DEU 10:9" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="DEU 10:10" />“Ng'ala kuchidunda matsuwa alubaini, chilo na misi, ka pfanongole kutenda, naye IMNDEWA kanitegheletsa keli, naye katoghola na ng'abamile baye kuwakoma. <verse eid="DEU 10:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="DEU 10:11" />Kuya kanongela, ‘Uke uwalongotse iwanu mna ghumwanza ghokwingila mna isi yanilahile kuweng'a iwahenga wawo.’ ”<verse eid="DEU 10:11" /></para>
  <para style="s">Chayobama Imulungu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="DEU 10:12" />“Lelo, mwemwe Waisiraeli, angu sambi IMNDEWA, Imulungu wenu yobama choni kuna mwemwe? Yeye kowabama mwemwe mumpfuke, mwange mna tsinzila tsake tsose, mumkunde, mumsang'anile yeye kwa ghumoyo ghwenu ghose, na kwa ghumuhe ghwenu ghwose, <verse eid="DEU 10:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="DEU 10:13" />na mghakinde ghamalaghitso ghake na imiko yake yose yanimwing'ani leloli ili mwemwe mbwede. <verse eid="DEU 10:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="DEU 10:14" />Mlole, lilanga kwose kwa IMNDEWA, Imulungu wenu, na isi na chila chinu ichili mumo pfakwake. <verse eid="DEU 10:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="DEU 10:15" />Kuya IMNDEWA wenu tsakawakunda sideke iwahenga wenu, mbaka kamsaghulani mwemwe, imli watsukulu wawo, muwe wanu wake kubita wanu wangi, ka pfaili leloli. <verse eid="DEU 10:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="DEU 10:16" />Apfo tangiya sambi mumtegheletse IMNDEWA, mleke kuwa wasughu. <verse eid="DEU 10:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="DEU 10:17" />Kwaapfila IMNDEWA, Imulungu wenu ka Imulungu wa milungu, na ka IMNDEWA wa iwandewa. Yeye ka Imulungu mkulu na yane ngupfu, na wa kupfukighwa. Yeye ng'alolagha chihanga cha munu baye wala ng'obokela hongo baye. <verse eid="DEU 10:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="DEU 10:18" />Kowonela libatsi iwachuwa na ipfitsuka, naye kowakunda iwagheni na koweng'a ichijo na ghamaghwanda. <verse eid="DEU 10:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="DEU 10:19" />Apfo namwe muwakunde iwagheni, kwaapfila mwemwe namwe pfipfila tsamkala wagheni akula Misiri. <verse eid="DEU 10:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="DEU 10:20" />Mumpfuke IMNDEWA, Imulungu wenu na mumsang'anile yeye. Mumnanahile yeye na mwilahe kwa litaghwa lyake. <verse eid="DEU 10:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="DEU 10:21" />Yeye yuyo utunitso wenu, na yeye yuyo Imulungu wenu, iyawatendele pfinu pfikulu na pfakukangawatsa pfamonile kwa nenge tsenu wenyegho. <verse eid="DEU 10:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="DEU 10:22" />Iwahenga wenu iwaghendile Misiri tsa wa sabini, na sambi IMNDEWA, Imulungu wenu kawongetsa, na wawa wengi ka tsinondo itsili kulanga.”<verse eid="DEU 10:22" /></para>
  <chapter eid="DEU 10" />
  <chapter number="11" style="c" sid="DEU 11" />
  <para style="s">Ukulu wa IMNDEWA</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="DEU 11:1" />“Apfo lelo mumkunde IMNDEWA, Imulungu wenu na ghakindeni ghose ghayobama na ghamalaghitso ghake, na imiko yake, na ghamalamtsi ghake. <verse eid="DEU 11:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="DEU 11:2" />Leloli mtange ghendo, ka nene nolonga na mwemwe yamwonile na yammanyile ukuhigha kwe IMNDEWA, Imulungu wenu pfakuli, wala silonga na iwana wenu baye, wawo ng'awonile baye ukulu wake, wala ghumoko ghwake ghune ngupfu, na ighugholoke. <verse eid="DEU 11:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="DEU 11:3" />Mwona pfitango na pfinu pfayatendile mna isi ya Misiri, na mwona achila chayamtendile Farao, imfalume wa Misiri na isi yake yose. <verse eid="DEU 11:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="DEU 11:4" />Pfipfia mwona achila chayatendile kwa lijeshi lya Misiri, na iwafalasi na imituka yawo, na mwona pfayaghatendile ghamatsi gha Bahali ya Shamu ghawaghubike ahala hawang'ali wowawinza, na apfila pfayawakomile mbaka leloli ino. <verse eid="DEU 11:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="DEU 11:5" />Na mwona aghala ghayawatendele akula kunyika ng'ana mwemwe mpfike baye hano. <verse eid="DEU 11:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="DEU 11:6" />Pfipfila mwona aghala ghayawatendile Datani, na Abiramu, iwana wa Eliabu, yeye Eliabu tsa mwana wa Rubeni. Lidongo litulika na kuwamesta wose na wanu wa kaye tsawo, na tsing'anda tsawo, na iwatumwa wawo, na iwanyama wawo. <verse eid="DEU 11:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="DEU 11:7" />Kwa tsinenge tsenu wenyegho mwona ghendo pfinu pfikulu IMNDEWA pfayatendile.”<verse eid="DEU 11:7" /></para>
  <para style="s">Tsibalaka tsa ukukinda malaghitso</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="DEU 11:8" />“Apfo mghakinde malaghitso ghose ghanimlaghitsani leloli, ili muwe na ngupfu yo kughenda na kuisola isi ayo yambama kuilokela ghumto, <verse eid="DEU 11:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="DEU 11:9" />ili mkakale matsuwa mengi mna isi ine lidongo linoghile kwa ukulima na ukufughila iyawalongele iwahenga wenu, iyatsoweng'a wawo na watsukulu wawo. <verse eid="DEU 11:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="DEU 11:10" />Isi yamghenda kuisola si ka isi ya Misiri baye, iyamlawile. Ako mhanda mbeghu tsenu, na mtsighelela ghamatsi ka mghunda ghwa mbogha. <verse eid="DEU 11:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="DEU 11:11" />Lekeni isi yamghendela kuisola ina pfidunda na pfiwala, na ghamatsi ghake gha mvula, igholawa mlanga. <verse eid="DEU 11:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="DEU 11:12" />IMNDEWA, Imulungu wenu yuyo iyoibetetsa isi ayo, na tsinenge tsa IMNDEWA wenu tsoilolesa bila kwipfa kulawa haghukwanza ghumwaka mbaka haghumala.”<verse eid="DEU 11:12" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="DEU 11:13" />“Apfo ka mwoghakinda ghamalaghitso ghanimwing'ani leloli, mwomkunda IMNDEWA, Imulungu wenu na kumtumikila yeye kwa ghumoyo ghwenu ghwose, <verse eid="DEU 11:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="DEU 11:14" />yeye katsowaghalila imvula ya chila msimu mna isi yenu, imvula ya masika na mvula ya minga ili mpfune pfijo pfingi na dipfai ya sambi, na ghamapfuta. <verse eid="DEU 11:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="DEU 11:15" />Katsoyotetsa imitsani ya ukuja iwanyama wenu mna mighunda yenu, namwe mtsakuja na kwighuta. <verse eid="DEU 11:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="DEU 11:16" />Mwalangitse, imimoyo yenu ileke kubughighwa na kuitegheletsa milungu ingi na kuitambikila. <verse eid="DEU 11:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="DEU 11:17" />Mng'atenda apfo, IMNDEWA, Imulungu wenu katsowonela maya, katsodiwa kulanga imvula ileke kutowa, na lidongo lyenu ng'alitsomela ipfijo baye, na baho ng'amtsokawa kuhupa mna isi inoghile iyomwing'ani IMNDEWA. <verse eid="DEU 11:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="DEU 11:18" />Aghano ghanilonga ghekeni mmoyo mwenu na mwitwi mwenu, ghoweni mmoko mwenu ka chitango, na mghabandike mchihanga. <verse eid="DEU 11:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="DEU 11:19" />Muwafunde iwana wenu aghano ghanilonga, muwalongele hamkala akaye na hamkwanga mnzila, hamuwasa na hamlamka. <verse eid="DEU 11:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="DEU 11:20" />Mghandike mna imilango ya tsing'anda tsenu na mna ghamalango gha imiji yenu, <verse eid="DEU 11:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="DEU 11:21" />ili matsuwa ghenu na ghamatsuwa ghe iwana wenu ghongetseke mna isi iyelahile IMNDEWA kuweng'a iwahenga wenu, ka pfapfili kwa lilanga pfalikala matsuwa mengi mchanya mwa isi.”<verse eid="DEU 11:21" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="DEU 11:22" />“Mng'aghakinda ghamalaghitso ghose ghanimwing'ani, ka mwomkunda IMNDEWA, Imulungu wenu, mwakwanga mna tsinzila tsake, na mwomnanahila yeye, <verse eid="DEU 11:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="DEU 11:23" />naye IMNDEWA katsowawinga iwanu wa isi atso hambele yenu, namwe mtsotsiboka isi tse wanu isi tsine wanu wakulu, na wane ngupfu kubita mwemwe. <verse eid="DEU 11:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="DEU 11:24" />Chila hanu hamkanyagha hatsakuwa henu, ukulu wa isi yenu utsakwanzila inyika ihili ubali wa kusini mbaka mna pfidunda pfa Lebanoni, ubali wa kasikazini, na kulawa ghumto ghwa Efulati mbaka kune ibahali ya Mediterania ubali wa maghalibi. <verse eid="DEU 11:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="DEU 11:25" />Kutsakuwa kuduhu munu iyodaha kuwatowa, kwokwose kula kwamghenda IMNDEWA, Imulungu wenu katsowatenda iwanu wone wogha, nawo watsowapfuka ka pfayalongile.”<verse eid="DEU 11:25" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="DEU 11:26" />“Mlole, leloli nowabama msaghule chinu chimwe, ukubalikighwa au ukulighitighwa. <verse eid="DEU 11:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="DEU 11:27" />Mtsobalikighwa ka mng'aghakinda ghamalaghitso ghe IMNDEWA, Imulungu wenu, aghala ghanimwing'ani leloli. <verse eid="DEU 11:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="DEU 11:28" />Lekeni mtsolighitighwa mng'alema kughakinda ghamalaghitso ghano, na kughaleka aghala ghaniwalaghitse, na kuitambikila milungu ingi aila ng'ana muimanye baye. <verse eid="DEU 11:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="DEU 11:29" />IMNDEWA, Imulungu wenu hayatsowaghala mna isi yamghenda kuisola iwe yenu, mkeme mna chidunda cha Gerizimu mkemelele tsibalaka, na mkeme mna chidunda cha Ebali mkemelele malighito. <verse eid="DEU 11:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="DEU 11:30" />Ka pfammanya pfidunda pfino pfibili pfa kumwambu mwa ghumto ghwa Yoridani, pfelolesa na ubali wa kwalikuswela litsuwa, mna isi ya Wakanani iwokala Arabu, isi iilolesa na ghumji ghwa Giligali. <verse eid="DEU 11:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="DEU 11:31" />Mwobamighwa mloke ghumto ghwa Yoridani, kuisola isi iyomwing'ani IMNDEWA, Imulungu wenu. Hamtsoisola na kukala mumo, <verse eid="DEU 11:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="DEU 11:32" />mwalangitse kughakinda ghamalaghitso ghose ghanimwing'ani leloli.”<verse eid="DEU 11:32" /></para>
  <chapter eid="DEU 11" />
  <chapter number="12" style="c" sid="DEU 12" />
  <para style="s">Hanu hamwe ha ukutambikila</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="DEU 12:1" />“Aino iyo imiko, na malaghitso ghambamighwa kughakinda matsuwa ghose ghamkala mna isi iyomwing'ani IMNDEWA, Imulungu we iwahenga wenu, iwe yenu. <verse eid="DEU 12:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="DEU 12:2" />Muhinye ghendo hanu hohose ahala iwanu hawotambikila milungu yawo, mna pfidunda pfikulu na pfidunda pfidodo, na hasi ha chila mbiki ghune mitsani mibisi. <verse eid="DEU 12:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="DEU 12:3" />Namwe mtsibene ghendo matsabahu tsawo, na tsingutso tsawo, na mpfilakatse ipfinyagho pfa imilungu yawo ya Ashera mna ghumoto, na mghabaghuse ghendo mataghwa gha milungu yawo hanu aho.”<verse eid="DEU 12:3" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="DEU 12:4" />“Wala mleke kumtambikila IMNDEWA, Imulungu wenu ka wawo pfawotambikila milungu yawo. <verse eid="DEU 12:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="DEU 12:5" />Lekeni mtsoghenda hanu hohose ahala IMNDEWA, Imulungu wenu hayatsohasaghula mna makabila ghose, ili yeke taghwa lyake na hawe hanu hake ha ukukala, ako kuko kwamtsoghenda. <verse eid="DEU 12:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="DEU 12:6" />Ako mghale nambiko tsenu tsa kulakatsighwa, na tsinambiko tsingi, na tsaka tsenu, nambiko tsenu tsa kwinulighwa, na nambiko tsenu tsamlapfa kwa kubama wenyegho, na tsinambiko tsamwilahile kulapfa, na chila mnyama yanduse kwelekighwa wa wang'olo, wamene na wang'ombe. <verse eid="DEU 12:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="DEU 12:7" />Ako mtsakuja hambele ya IMNDEWA, Imulungu wenu, na mtsodeng'elela hamwe na wanu wo kaye yenu kwa ghose ghamtenda kwa ghamoko ghenu kwaapfila IMNDEWA, Imulungu wa iwahenga wenu kawabaliki.”<verse eid="DEU 12:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="DEU 12:8" />“Ghamatsuwa agho haghatsopfika mleke kutenda ka pfatutenda leloli ahano, chila munu kotenda ka pfayobama imwenyegho, <verse eid="DEU 12:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="DEU 12:9" />kwaapfila ng'ana mpfike baye hanu ha ukubwihila mna isi IMNDEWA, Imulungu wenu iyomwing'ani iwe yenu. <verse eid="DEU 12:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="DEU 12:10" />Lekeni mtsoloka ghumto Yoridani na kukala mna isi iyomwing'ani IMNDEWA, Imulungu wenu iwe yenu, naye katsowatenda mbwihile kulawa kwe wanu wose iwowahila, namwe mtsokala tseghamba. <verse eid="DEU 12:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="DEU 12:11" />Apfo hanu aho IMNDEWA, Imulungu wenu hayatsohasaghula hatsakuwa hanu ha ukukala litaghwa lyake, aho mtsoghala chila chinu chaniwalaghitse, nambiko tsenu tsa kulakatsighwa, na tsinambiko tsingi, na tsaka tsenu, na nambiko tsenu tsa kwinulighwa, na tsinambiko tsamwilahile kulapfa. <verse eid="DEU 12:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="DEU 12:12" />Baho mdeng'elele hambele ha IMNDEWA, Imulungu wenu, hamwe na iwanenu wamale na wapinga, iwatumwa iwamale na wapinga na Walawi iwokala mna imiji yenu, kwaapfila wawo wahela isi ili yawo wenyegho. <verse eid="DEU 12:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="DEU 12:13" />Mwalangitse mleke kulapfa nambiko tsenu tsa kulakatsighwa hanu hohose hala hambama, <verse eid="DEU 12:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="DEU 12:14" />lekeni mtsilapfe hanu hala IMNDEWA, Imulungu wenu hayahasaghule mna isi ya likabila lyenu limwe, na aho mtende chila chinu chanimlaghitsani.”<verse eid="DEU 12:14" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="DEU 12:15" />“Lekeni mwodaha kumsubutula imnyama na mje inyama yake mmakaye mwenu ka pfambama, ka IMNDEWA, Imulungu wenu pfayawabaliki. Iwanu wose iwelile na iwehile wodaha kuja ka pfamkuja inyama ya mbala na ya idondolo. <verse eid="DEU 12:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="DEU 12:16" />Lekeni mleke kuja idamu, muikutule hasi ka matsi. <verse eid="DEU 12:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="DEU 12:17" />Tsinambiko itsilapfighwa kwe IMNDEWA, mleke kutsija mmakaye mwenu, iwe itsaka ye pfijo pfenu, ya idipfai, ya ghamapfuta, wala ing'ombe au ing'olo yanduse kwelekighwa, wala chochose chawilahile kulapfa, wala nambiko yambama wenyegho kulapfa wala tsinambiko tsingi. <verse eid="DEU 12:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="DEU 12:18" />Lekeni apfo mtsakuja hambele ha IMNDEWA, Imulungu wenu hamwe na wanenu wamale na wapinga na watumwa wenu wamale na wapinga, na Walawi iwokala mna imji yenu, namwe mdeng'elele hambele he IMNDEWA, Imulungu wenu kwa chila chinu chamtenda kwa ghamoko ghenu. <verse eid="DEU 12:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="DEU 12:19" />Mwalangitse, mleke kuwasemwa Walawi matsuwa ghose ghamkala mna isi yenu.”<verse eid="DEU 12:19" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="DEU 12:20" />“IMNDEWA, Imulungu wenu hayatsakongetsa isi yenu ka pfayalongile, namwe mwolonga ‘Twobama kuja nyama,’ kwaapfila mna batsu lya ukuja injama, mwodaha kuja inyama ka pfambama. <verse eid="DEU 12:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="DEU 12:21" />Lelo, hanu hayosaghula IMNDEWA, Imulungu wenu kwika litaghwa lyake hang'awa kutali namwe, mwodaha kumsubutula imene au ing'olo iyaweng'ile IMNDEWA, ka pfayawalaghitse, na mmkaye mwenu mwodaha kuja inyama ayo ka pfambama. <verse eid="DEU 12:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="DEU 12:22" />Imunu wowose yawe kela au keha kodaha kuja inyama ayo, yaje ka apfila pfamkuja inyama ya mbala au ya dondolo. <verse eid="DEU 12:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="DEU 12:23" />Lekeni mwalangitse mleke kuja idamu, kwaapfila idamu wuwo ughima, apfo mleke kuja ughima hamwenga na inyama. <verse eid="DEU 12:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="DEU 12:24" />Mleke kuja idamu, muikutule hasi ka matsi. <verse eid="DEU 12:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="DEU 12:25" />Mleke kuja idamu, ili mkebwede mwemwe na iwanenu na iwatsukulu wenu, kwaapfila mtsotenda ghanoghile hambele ha IMNDEWA.”<verse eid="DEU 12:25" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="DEU 12:26" />“Ipfinu pfenu ipfenzeluke na apfila pfamwilahile kumlapfila IMNDEWA, mghende napfo hanu hayohasaghula IMNDEWA. <verse eid="DEU 12:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="DEU 12:27" />Mlapfe nambiko tsenu tsa kulakatsighwa, inyama na idamu hane matsabahu ye IMNDEWA, idamu ya tsinambiko tsenu muikutule hambele ha imatsabahu ya IMNDEWA, Imulungu wenu. Lekeni mwodaha kuja inyama. <verse eid="DEU 12:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="DEU 12:28" />Mwalangitse kukinda chila chinu chaniwalaghitse ili mkebwede mwemwe na watsukulu wenu, kwaapfila mtsotenda ighanoghile na ighomnoghela IMNDEWA, Imulungu wenu.”<verse eid="DEU 12:28" /></para>
  <para style="s">Woghomighwa ukutambikila ipfinyagho</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="DEU 12:29" />“IMNDEWA, Imulungu wenu hayatsowakoma iwanu wa isi yamghenda kuisola, namwe mng'awawinga na kukala mna isi yawo, <verse eid="DEU 12:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="DEU 12:30" />hawatsokomighwa hambele yenu, mwalangitse mleke kughutsa mbuli tsa milungu yawo, wala mleke kughutsa na ukulonga, ‘Iwanu awano woisang'anila pfii milingu yawo, ili na twetwe tutende pfipfo.’ <verse eid="DEU 12:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="DEU 12:31" />Mleke kumtambikila apfo IMNDEWA, Imulungu wenu, kwaapfila hawoitambikila imulungu yawo apfo, wotenda aghala ghayolema na ighomwihila IMNDEWA, mbaka wowalakatsa iwana wawo wamale na wapinga mna ghumoto ka nambiko kwa imilungu yawo.”<verse eid="DEU 12:31" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="DEU 12:32" />Mwalangitse ghose ghaniwalongela mkinde, mleke kwongetsa wala kuhungutsa mna agho ghose ghaniwalaghitse.<verse eid="DEU 12:32" /></para>
  <chapter eid="DEU 12" />
  <chapter number="13" style="c" sid="DEU 13" />
  <para style="s">Kuitambikila milungu ingi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="DEU 13:1" />“Ka kolawila nabii au munu iyolota tsindoto mna mwemwe, na kuwalapfila pfitango au pfihulo, <verse eid="DEU 13:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="DEU 13:2" />kuya ipfitango na ipfihulo apfo pfing'alawila, naye kolonga, ‘Tuiwinze milungu ingi na kuitambikila, milungu ing'amuimanyile baye,’ <verse eid="DEU 13:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="DEU 13:3" />mleke kughategheletsa aghala ghayolonga inabii ayula, au imunu ayula iyolota tsindoto. Kwaapfila IMNDEWA, Imulungu wenu komghetsani ili yone ka mwomkunda yeye kwa ghumoyo ghwenu ghwose na ghumuhe ghwenu ghwose. <verse eid="DEU 13:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="DEU 13:4" />Mwemwe mumuwinze na mumpfuke IMNDEWA, Imulungu wenu, mghakinde malaghitso ghake, na aghala ghayolonga, mumtumikile na mumnanahile yeye. <verse eid="DEU 13:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="DEU 13:5" />Inabii au imunu ayo iyolota tsindoto kobamighwa yakomighwe, kwaapfila kawalongela mleke kumtegheletsa IMNDEWA, Imulungu wenu, iyawalapfile Misiri na iyawakombole mna isi ya utumwa. Imunu ayo kobama yawaghise na kuwatenda mleke kuwinza aghala ghayawalaghitse IMNDEWA. Apfi pfipfo pfamtsotenda ighehile ghamale mna mwemwe.”<verse eid="DEU 13:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="DEU 13:6" />“Ka ndughu yako wa tombo limwe, au lumbu wako, au mwanagho, au mwehe wako yumkunda sideke, au sale yako mkulu yang'akulongela chinyelenyele, ‘Tuke takaitambikile milungu ingi.’ Mwemwe wala wahenga wenu ng'ana waimanye baye milungu ayo, <verse eid="DEU 13:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="DEU 13:7" />milungu ya iwanu iwali habehi na mwemwe au iwali kutali, kulawa utsigho auno mbaka ungi. <verse eid="DEU 13:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="DEU 13:8" />Lekeni uleke kutoghola, wala kumtegheletsa, uleke kumwonela libatsi, wala uleke kumleka, wala uleke kumpfisa, <verse eid="DEU 13:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="DEU 13:9" />umkome ghendo, ghweghwe wanduse kumtowa kuya wanu wangi nawo wamtowe. <verse eid="DEU 13:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="DEU 13:10" />Mtoweni na ghamabwe mbaka yafe, kwaapfila tsakabama yakutende uleke kumtegheletsa IMNDEWA, Imulungu wako, iyakukombole kulawa Misiri, mna isi ya utumwa. <verse eid="DEU 13:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="DEU 13:11" />Hamtenda apfo, Waisiraeli wose watsohulika na kupfuka, na haduhu munu wowose iyatsotenda keli chinu chihile ka acho.”<verse eid="DEU 13:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="DEU 13:12" />“Mng'ahulika mna ghumji ghumwe mna imiji iyomwing'ani IMNDEWA, Imulungu wenu, <verse eid="DEU 13:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="DEU 13:13" />ka wanu wehile wolawila mna mwemwe, wowaghisa iwanu wa imiji ayo, wolonga, ‘Tuke tukaitambikile milungu ingi,’ namwe ng'amuimanyile baye, <verse eid="DEU 13:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="DEU 13:14" />Hamtsohulika imbuli ayo, muipelembe na mghutseghutse, ka ghatendeka ghehile mna mwemwe, <verse eid="DEU 13:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="DEU 13:15" />wakomeni kwa imimaghe iwanu wose iwokala mna ghumji aghwo na iwanyama wawo. Na ghumji ghwawo mghuhinye ghendo. <verse eid="DEU 13:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="DEU 13:16" />Mkunge pfinu pfose pfa iwanu iwokala mna imiji ayo na mpfike hamwe mna ichibwalu na mpfilakatse pfiwe nambiko kwa IMNDEWA, Imulungu wenu, na ghumji aghwo ghutsohinyika matsuwa ghose na ng'aghutsotsengighwa keli baye. <verse eid="DEU 13:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="DEU 13:17" />Chinu chochose ichilighitighwe mleke kuchisola chiwe chenu, ili IMNDEWA wenu yaleke kwona maya, ila yawonele libatsi, na kuwatenda mwemwe mwongetseke ka pfayelaghane na iwahenga wenu, <verse eid="DEU 13:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="DEU 13:18" />ka mwomtegheletsa IMNDEWA, Imulungu wenu, kwa kukinda malaghitso ghake ghanimwing'ani leloli ino, na kutenda aghala ghanoghile hambele hake.”<verse eid="DEU 13:18" /></para>
  <chapter eid="DEU 13" />
  <chapter number="14" style="c" sid="DEU 14" />
  <para style="s">Ipfihendo ipfighomighwe pfa ukudomboketsa</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="DEU 14:1" />“Mwemwe mwa wana wa IMNDEWA, Imulungu wenu, mleke kwisanza, wala kubeya chipala kwa imunu yafile. <verse eid="DEU 14:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="DEU 14:2" />Kwaapfila mwemwe mwa wanu iwenzeluke wa IMNDEWA, Imulungu wenu. Yeye kawasaghulani muwe wanu wake ghendo kulawa kwe wanu wose iwokala muisi.”<verse eid="DEU 14:2" /></para>
  <para style="s">Wanyama iwelile na iwehile</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="DEU 14:3" />“Mleke kuja chinu chochose ichimwihila Imulungu. <verse eid="DEU 14:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="DEU 14:4" />Wanyama wambamighwa ukuja awano hano, mje ing'ombe, ing'olo, imene, <verse eid="DEU 14:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="DEU 14:5" />funo, mbala, kongoni, mene wa kwibagho, pofu, na mene wa kuchidunda, <verse eid="DEU 14:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="DEU 14:6" />na mwodaha kuja imnyama wowose yane ng'watwo mbili na iyoselula. <verse eid="DEU 14:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="DEU 14:7" />Lekeni mleke kuja imnyama yane tsing'wato mbili itsigholeke na ng'oselula baye, mleke kuja ngamiya, isungula na mimbi, woselula lekeni tsing'wato tsawo ng'atsigholeke baye mala mbili, awo weha kuna mwemwe, <verse eid="DEU 14:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="DEU 14:8" />ingubi naye keha, hata ka kana ng'wato mbili itsigholeke, na ng'oselula baye, mleke kuja inyama yawo wala kukinda mitsogha yawo.”<verse eid="DEU 14:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="DEU 14:9" />“Pfiumbe pfose ipfili mmatsi mwodaha kuja, lekeni pfiwe na mapepe na maghamba. <verse eid="DEU 14:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="DEU 14:10" />Lekeni chochose achila chilihela mapepe na maghamba, mleke kuja, acho chiha kuna mwemwe.”<verse eid="DEU 14:10" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="DEU 14:11" />“Mwodaha ukuja pfideghe wose iwelile. <verse eid="DEU 14:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="DEU 14:12" />Lekeni awano hano mleke ukuja, maghengele, furukombe na chipungu, <verse eid="DEU 14:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="DEU 14:13" />kengewa, chotsi, na pfitema wose, <verse eid="DEU 14:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="DEU 14:14" />wabondwa wose, <verse eid="DEU 14:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="DEU 14:15" />mbuni, dudumitsi, pfimanga wose, <verse eid="DEU 14:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="DEU 14:16" />chimulu mdodo, chimulu mkulu, na chimulu mtselu, <verse eid="DEU 14:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="DEU 14:17" />Imwari, inderi, mnandi, <verse eid="DEU 14:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="DEU 14:18" />imembe, koikoi wose, hudihudi, na popo.”<verse eid="DEU 14:18" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="DEU 14:19" />“Na wang'onyo wose wane mabawa iwotambala weha kuna mwemwe, mleke kuwaja. <verse eid="DEU 14:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="DEU 14:20" />Lekeni pfiumbe wose wane mabawa iwelille mwodaha kuja.”<verse eid="DEU 14:20" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="DEU 14:21" />“Mleke kuja mitsogha, ayo mwodaha kuweng'a iwagheni iwokala mmakaye mwenu, wawo wodaha kuja au muwautsile wanu wa isi ingi. Lekeni mwemwe mwa wanu welile we IMNDEWA. Mleke kumtoghosa mwana mene mna matombo gha mai wake.”<verse eid="DEU 14:21" /></para>
  <para style="s">Ghamalaghitso gha izaka</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="DEU 14:22" />“Mwike izaka ya ipfijo pfenu pfampfuna kulawa mna imighunda yenu chila mwaka. <verse eid="DEU 14:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="DEU 14:23" />Namwe mtsakuja izaka yenu, dipfai yenu, mapfuta, na mnyama wenu wa mwanduso wa mifugho yenu hambele ha IMNDEWA, Imulungu wenu hanu hayohasaghula hawe ha ukukala litaghwa lyake. Mtende pfino ili mwifunde kumpfuka IMNDEWA, Imulungu wenu matsuwa ghose. <verse eid="DEU 14:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="DEU 14:24" />Ka ihanu aho hayahasaghule IMNDEWA, Imulungu wenu kwika litaghwa lyake hatali kulawa mmakaye mwenu, namwe ng'amdaha baye kutsiduta tsizaka atso tse pfijo pfayaweng'ile IMNDEWA, lelo mtende apfi, <verse eid="DEU 14:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="DEU 14:25" />muutse itsizaka atso na litobole mlighale kwa ghamoko ghenu hanu hayosaghula IMNDEWA, Imulungu wenu. <verse eid="DEU 14:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="DEU 14:26" />Litobole lyenu mghulile chochose chambama, inyama ye wang'ombe, au wang'olo, dipfai, na imbwali. Mwemwe na iwanu wa tsikaye tsenu mje na mdeng'elele hambele ha IMNDEWA, Imulungu wenu.”<verse eid="DEU 14:26" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="DEU 14:27" />“Mleke kuwasemwa Walawi iwokala mmakaye mwenu, kwaapfila wahela fungu wala wahela isi iyaweng'ighwe iwe yawo. <verse eid="DEU 14:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="DEU 14:28" />Chila haghumala ghumwaka ghwa kadatu, mlapfe izaka ya pfijo pfenu pfose, na mwike mna tsikano itsili mmakaye mwenu, <verse eid="DEU 14:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="DEU 14:29" />ili Walawi iwalihela pfinu, iwagheni, ipfitsuka na iwachuwa iwokala mmakaye mwenu watse waje na kwighuta, naye IMNDEWA, Imulungu wenu katsowatenda mbalikiighwe kwa chila chinu chamsang'ana kwa ghamoko ghenu.”<verse eid="DEU 14:29" /></para>
  <chapter eid="DEU 14" />
  <chapter number="15" style="c" sid="DEU 15" />
  <para style="s">Ghumwaka ghwa ukuleka ukudai</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="DEU 15:1" />“Chila haghumala ghumwaka ghwa saba, mwobamighwa mleke kuwadai keli wayenu. <verse eid="DEU 15:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="DEU 15:2" />Mtende apfi, chila munu iyamwatsime Muisiraeli miyaghe, yaleke kumdai, wala yaleke kumkomangitsa yoitse, kwaapfila ghumwaka saba ghwa IMNDEWA ghwa ukuwalekelela iwanu iwodaighwa ma ghupfika. <verse eid="DEU 15:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="DEU 15:3" />Mwodaha kumdai imgheni yawalihe, lekeni achila chayatsime ndughu yako uleke kumdai.”<verse eid="DEU 15:3" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="DEU 15:4" />“IMNDEWA, Imulungu wenu katsowabaliki mna isi iyoweng'a iwe yenu, na mna mwemwe ng'akutsakuwa na munu wowose iyali muhingwa, <verse eid="DEU 15:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="DEU 15:5" />mtsobokela agho ka mwomtegheletsa IMNDEWA Imulungu wenu na kughakinda pfinoghile ghamalaghitso ghake ghanimwing'ani leloli. <verse eid="DEU 15:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="DEU 15:6" />Agho ghatsolawila kwaapfila IMNDEWA Imulungu wenu katsowabaliki, ka pfayalongile. Namwe mtsowakopesha wanu wa isi tsingi, lekeni ng'amtsokopa baye, mtsotawala wanu wa isi tsingi, lekeni ng'amtsotawalighwa baye.”<verse eid="DEU 15:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="DEU 15:7" />“Ka mwokala na Muisiraeli muhingwa mna tsikaye tsenu mna isi iyomwing'ani IMNDEWA, Imulungu wenu, mleke kuwa na misi kwe munu ayo wala kulema kumwapfila. <verse eid="DEU 15:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="DEU 15:8" />Lekeni muwe na ghamoko gha uluso kwe munu ayo, mumkopeshe chochose chayobama. <verse eid="DEU 15:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="DEU 15:9" />Walangitse uleke kwalangula pfihile mmoyo mwako, kolonga, ‘Ghumwaka ghwa saba ghwa ukuleka kudai ghwa habehi,’ Naghwe komlola Muisiraeli miyagho kwa nenge ihile na kolema kumwing'a chochose, yeye kodaha kumlilila IMNDEWA, naghwe kutsakwoneka ka kuna nzambi. <verse eid="DEU 15:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="DEU 15:10" />Umwing'e miyagho kwa uluso na uleke kulongeleka mmoyo kwaapfila IMNDEWA Imulungu wako katsokubaliki mna tsing'onde tsako tsose na mna chila chinu chautenda. <verse eid="DEU 15:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="DEU 15:11" />Kwaapfila iwahingwa mtsokala nawo matsuwa ghose mna isi yenu. Apfo nowalaghitsa muwe waluso kwa ndughu tsenu iwolomba na iwahingwa iwokala muisi mwenu.”<verse eid="DEU 15:11" /></para>
  <para style="s">Muwatendele uluso iwatumwa</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="DEU 15:12" />“Ka ndughu yako Muebrania, yawe ipinga au mmale, yang'autsighwa kuna ghweghwe naye yang'akusang'anila kwa miyaka sita, mna ghumwaka ghwa saba umlekelele yoke. <verse eid="DEU 15:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="DEU 15:13" />Hautsomlekelela yoke, uleke kumleka yoke ghamoko ghaliyeka. <verse eid="DEU 15:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="DEU 15:14" />Umwing'e kwa uluso kulawa mna ipfinu pfayakwing'ile IMNDEWA Imulungu wako. Kodaha kumwinga ing'olo, ipfijo, na dipfai <verse eid="DEU 15:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="DEU 15:15" />Mkumbuke ka mwemwe tsa mwawatumwa mna isi ya Misiri, na IMNDEWA Imulungu wenu kawakombola, apfo leloli nomwing'ani laghitso lino.”<verse eid="DEU 15:15" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="DEU 15:16" />“Lekeni imtumwa wako yang'akulongela, ‘Nene sibama kuka baye,’ kwaapfila yeye kokukunda ghweghwe na iwanu iwali hakaye yako, naye kokala naghwe pfinoghile, <verse eid="DEU 15:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="DEU 15:17" />usole sanzia na utobole lighutwi lyake mbaka lingile mna ghumlango ghwako naye kakuwa mtumighwa wako wa matsuwa ghose, na mtendele pfipfo mtumwa wako pinga. <verse eid="DEU 15:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="DEU 15:18" />Mleke kona usungu haumlekelela imtumwa wako yoke. Kwaapfila tsing'onde tsayakusang'anile kwa miyaka sita tsongetseka mala mbili kubita tsisang'ano tsa imtumwa iyakutsa na kuka, na IMNDEWA Imulungu wako katsokumotetsa kwa ghose ghoutenda.”<verse eid="DEU 15:18" /></para>
  <para style="s">Iwelekighwa wa mwanduso we wang'ombe, wamene na wang'olo</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="DEU 15:19" />“Mlapfileni IMNDEWA Imulungu wenu iwana wose wamale we iwanyama wenu iwanzile koneka kulawa kune wang'ombe wenu, wamene na iwang'olo wenu. Mleke kuwaleka iwana awo we ng'ombe wawasang'anile ng'onde tsenu, wala mleke kuwagheta imighala wang'olo. <verse eid="DEU 15:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="DEU 15:20" />Chila mwaka, ghweghwe ne wanu wali akaye yako, muwaje iwanyama awo hambele he IMNDEWA, Imulungu wenu, hanu hayosaghula IMNDEWA. <verse eid="DEU 15:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="DEU 15:21" />Lekeni imnyama ayo yang'awa na chilema, chiwe cha kudeng'uka, cha nenge au chilema chochose chikulu, uleke kumlapfa yawe nambiko kwa IMNDEWA Imulungu wako. <verse eid="DEU 15:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="DEU 15:22" />Iwanyama awo muwaje mmakaye mwenu, iwanu wose iwelile na iwehile, mwodaha kuwaja ka pfamuwaja idondolo na indetsi. <verse eid="DEU 15:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="DEU 15:23" />Lekeni mleke kuja idamu, muimwaghe hasi ka ghamatsi.”<verse eid="DEU 15:23" /></para>
  <chapter eid="DEU 15" />
  <chapter number="16" style="c" sid="DEU 16" />
  <para style="s">Chihungo cha Pasaka</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="DEU 16:1" />“Mghukumbukeghe ghumwetsi ghwa Abibu kwa kudeng'elela ichihungo cha Ipasaka kwe IMNDEWA, Imulungu wenu, kwaapfila mna ghumwetsi ghugho ghwa Abibu, IMNDEWA Imulungu wenu tsakalawapfa Misiri nechilo. <verse eid="DEU 16:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="DEU 16:2" />Mumsubutulile IMNDEWA, Imulungu wenu imnyama yumwe yawe nambiko ya Pasaka kulawa mna wang'olo au wang'ombe wenu, hanu hayosaghula IMNDEWA hawe ha ukukala litaghwa lyake. <verse eid="DEU 16:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="DEU 16:3" />Mleke kumja hamwe na pfighate pfikighwe ihamila, kwa matsuwa saba mtsakuja pfighate ipfilihela ihamila, pfighate pfa maghayo, kwaapfila tsamsumka kuka kulawa Misiri, ili mkumbuke litsuwa lyamlawile Misiri, mna ghamaghayo gha utumwa, mna ghamatsuwa ghenu ghose ghamkala. <verse eid="DEU 16:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="DEU 16:4" />Mleke kukala na ihamila mmakaye mwenu kwa ghamatsuwa saba, na nyama ye imnyama iyochinjighwa nemihe mna litsuwa lya mwanduso lye ipasaka, ijighwe chilo chicho, mleke kuileka ikale mbaka nemitondo.”<verse eid="DEU 16:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="DEU 16:5" />“Mleke kumchinja imnyama wa pasaka mna tsikaye tsenu tsayomwing'ani IMNDEWA Imulungu wenu, <verse eid="DEU 16:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="DEU 16:6" />lekeni mwodaha kumchinja hanu hala IMNDEWA Imulungu wenu hayowasaghulila likale taghwa lyake. Mumchinje ahala litsuwa halikuswa, kwaapfila litsuwa haliswele, iwahenga wenu tsawanza ukulawa Misiri. <verse eid="DEU 16:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="DEU 16:7" />Muitoghose inyama ayo na muije hanu hala IMNDEWA, Imulungu wenu hayohasaghula, kuya nemitondo muye mmakaye mwenu. <verse eid="DEU 16:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="DEU 16:8" />Matsuwa sita mtsakuja pfighate pfilihela ihamila na mna tsuwa lya saba ghuwe mtingano ghwo kumtambikila IMNDEWA, Imulungu wenu na mleke kusang'ana ng'onde yoyose ila.”<verse eid="DEU 16:8" /></para>
  <para style="s">Chihungo cha ukupfuna</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="DEU 16:9" />“Mtsopeta majuma saba kulawa hamkwanza ukupfuna ipfijo pfenu, <verse eid="DEU 16:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="DEU 16:10" />namwe mumtendele chihungo cha majuma IMNDEWA, Imulungu wenu kwa kulapfa nambiko ya hiyali kulawa mna ghose ghayamwing'ileni IMNDEWA, Imulungu wenu. <verse eid="DEU 16:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="DEU 16:11" />Namwe mtsodeng'alela hambele ha IMNDEWA hamwe ne iwana wenu, ne iwatumwa wenu wamale ne wapinga, ne walawi iwokala mmakaye mwenu, ne iwagheni, ne wachuwa ne pfitsuka wamkala nawo, mtende apfi hanu hala IMNDEWA, Imulungu wenu hayohasaghula likale taghwa lyake. <verse eid="DEU 16:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="DEU 16:12" />Mkumbuke mwemwe tsamkala watumwa akula Misiri na muikinde imiko ino pfinoghile.”<verse eid="DEU 16:12" /></para>
  <para style="s">Chihungo cha Pfibumbulika</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="DEU 16:13" />“Mtende chihungo cha pfibumbulika kwa ghamatsuwa saba ahala hammalitsa ukubeta ipfijo pfenu kulawa hane ichibwalu cha ukubetela na hammalitsa ukukama tsinzabibu tsenu. <verse eid="DEU 16:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="DEU 16:14" />Namwe mtsodeng'elela mna ichihungo hamwe ne iwana wenu, ne iwatumwa wenu wamale ne wapinga, ne walawi, ne iwagheni, ne wachuwa ne pfitsuka wamkala nawo. <verse eid="DEU 16:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="DEU 16:15" />Kwa matsuwa saba, mumtendele chihungo IMNDEWA, Imulungu wenu, hanu hala IMNDEWA hayohasaghula, kwaapfila IMNDEWA, Imulungu wenu katsowabaliki mna mapfuno ghenu ghose na mna tsisang'ano tsa ghamoko ghenu namwe mtsodeng'elela.”<verse eid="DEU 16:15" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="DEU 16:16" />“Iwamale wose iwali muisi mwenu watse hambele ha IMNDEWA, Imulungu wenu mala ndatu chila mwaka, hanu hayohasaghula, watse mna ichihungo cha Pasaka, na mna ichihungo cha majuma, na mna ichihungo cha pfibumbulika. Chila mmale wa Isiraeli yakinde chinu hayoghenda hambele ha Imulungu. <verse eid="DEU 16:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="DEU 16:17" />Chila mmale yalapfe ka pfayodaha, kwa kulola chayamwing'ile IMNDEWA, Imulungu wenu.”<verse eid="DEU 16:17" /></para>
  <para style="s">Ukulamla ghoya</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="DEU 16:18" />“Muwasaghule walamtsi na wanu wakulu kulawa mna ghmakabila ghenu mna imiji yenu iyomwing'ani IMNDEWA, Imulungu wenu, nawo watsowahigha iwanu ka pfaibamighwa. <verse eid="DEU 16:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="DEU 16:19" />Mleke kuhigha pfihile wala mleke kulolesa chihanga cha munu hamuhigha, wala mleke kubokela hongo, kwaapfila hongo yopofula tsinenge tsa iwanu iwakengele, na yowatenda iwalamtsi walamule pfihile. <verse eid="DEU 16:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="DEU 16:20" />Mkindilitse ihaki iliyeka ghendo, ili mdahe kukala na kuisola isi iyomwing'ani IMNDEWA, Imulungu wenu.”<verse eid="DEU 16:20" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="DEU 16:21" />Mleke kwika mbiki ghwoghwose ghuwe ngutso ya Ashera, habehi na hanu ha ukulapfila nambiko hamtsomtsengela IMNDEWA, Imulungu wenu. <verse eid="DEU 16:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="DEU 16:22" />Wala mleke kwimitsa ingutso ye ghamabwe iwe chinyagho mchitambikile, kwaapfila IMNDEWA, Imulungu wenu agho koghahila.<verse eid="DEU 16:22" /></para>
  <chapter eid="DEU 16" />
  <chapter number="17" style="c" sid="DEU 17" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="DEU 17:1" />Mleke kumlapfila IMNDEWA, Imulungu wenu, ing'ombe au ing'olo yane chilema yawe nambiko, kwaapfila alyo lyomwihila IMNDEWA, Imulungu wenu. <verse eid="DEU 17:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="DEU 17:2" />Mwodaha kuhulika ka mmale au ipinga iyokala mna ghumji ghwenu ghumwe kotenda ghehile hambele ha IMNDEWA, Imulungu wenu na kolema kukinda lilaghano lyake, <verse eid="DEU 17:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="DEU 17:3" />kwa kuitambikila milungu ingi, na kutambikila litsuwa, au ghumwetsi, au tsinondo itsili kulanga, apfila nene siwalaghitse baye. <verse eid="DEU 17:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="DEU 17:4" />Namwe mng'ahulika apfo, muipelembe imbuli ayo pfinoghile ka chinu acho chihile chitendeka mna isi ya Isiraeli, <verse eid="DEU 17:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="DEU 17:5" />kuya mumghale immale ayo au pinga ayo kunze kwa ghumji namwe mumtowe na ghamabwe mbaka yafe. <verse eid="DEU 17:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="DEU 17:6" />Lekeni kokomighwa ka wanu weli au wadatu wolonga ka imunu ayo katenda ghehile. Mleke kumkoma munu wowose kwa kumuhulikitsa munu yumwe yaliyeka. <verse eid="DEU 17:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="DEU 17:7" />Awala iwonile kotenda walongole kumtowa na ghamabwe, kuya iwanu wangi nawo wamtowe. Apfi pfipfo pfamtsotenda ighehile agho ghamale mna mwemwe. <verse eid="DEU 17:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="DEU 17:8" />Kung'alawila ghomba mmakaye mwenu nalyo komu kulilamla, ka apfila ukwilagha kwe wanu, ukumkoma miyaghe ghila, au si kwa kubama baye, au ghomba lyolyose ilighala na agho, ghang'alawila agho, mghende hanu hayohasaghula IMNDEWA, Imulungu wenu. <verse eid="DEU 17:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="DEU 17:9" />Waghendeleni Walawi iwali watambika, na walamtsi iwosang'ana mna ghamatsuwa agho, na muwaleke wawalamle. <verse eid="DEU 17:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="DEU 17:10" />Kuya mtsotenda ka apfila pfawatsowalongela ihanu aho hayahasaghule IMNDEWA. Namwe mwalangitse kutenda ghose ghala ghawowalaghitsani. <verse eid="DEU 17:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="DEU 17:11" />Mtende kwa kuwinza malaghitso ghawowalangulitsa na aghala ghawolamla, mleke kuhunduka aku wala akula mna ghose ghawowalongela. <verse eid="DEU 17:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="DEU 17:12" />Imunu wowose yane chidandali, iyolema kumtegheletsa imtambika au imlamtsi, iyakwima hanu he IMNDEWA, Imulungu wenu, ayo yakomighwe. Apfi pfipfo pfamtsotenda ighehile agho ghamale mna Isiraeli. <verse eid="DEU 17:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="DEU 17:13" />Iwanu wose watsohulika na kupfuka, nawo watsoleka ichidandali.<verse eid="DEU 17:13" /></para>
  <para style="s">Ghamalaghitso gha iwafalume</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="DEU 17:14" />“Hamkwingila mna isi iyomwing'ani IMNDEWA, Imulungu wenu iwe yenu na kukala mumo, namwe mng'alonga, ‘Tumwike mfalume yatulongotse, ka pfatsili isi tsingi itsitutsunguluka,’ <verse eid="DEU 17:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="DEU 17:15" />mwalangitse mmwike imfalume iyosaghulighwa na IMNDEWA, Imulungu wenu, yawe imfalume wenu, naye yawe Muisiraeli miyenu. Mleke kumsaghula imgheni yawe mfalume wenu. <verse eid="DEU 17:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="DEU 17:16" />Imfalume yaleke kuwa na falasi wengi, wala yaleke kuwatuma iwanu waghende Misiri wakamghulile wafalasi, kwaapfila IMNDEWA tsakawalongela, ‘Mleke kuiwinza keli inzila ayo.’ <verse eid="DEU 17:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="DEU 17:17" />Imfalume yaleke kuwa na wehe wengi, yang'awa nawo ghumoyo ghwake ghutsakuwa kutali na IMNDEWA, wala yaleke kwiyongetsela fetsa na nzahabu. <verse eid="DEU 17:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="DEU 17:18" />Hayosaghulighwa yawe imfalume, yaghandike keli ghamalaghitso. Yeyandikile chitabu chingi ka achino cha ghamalaghitso gha IMNDEWA chawalinacho iwatambika Walawi. <verse eid="DEU 17:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="DEU 17:19" />Na yawe nacho, na yachisome mna matsuwa ghake ghose, ili yadahe kumpfuka IMNDEWA, Imulungu wake na kukinda chila chinu ichili mna ghamalaghitso. <verse eid="DEU 17:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="DEU 17:20" />Naye hayatsochisoma ng'odaha kwibona ka yeye kanogha kubita Waisiraeli wayaghe, na yaleke kuhunduka akuno wala akula mna ghamalaghitso. Yang'atenda apfo, yeye na watsukulu wake watsotawala kwa matsuwa mengi mna isi ya Isiraeli.”<verse eid="DEU 17:20" /></para>
  <chapter eid="DEU 17" />
  <chapter number="18" style="c" sid="DEU 18" />
  <para style="s">Tsinambiko tsa Watambika na Walawi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="DEU 18:1" />“Iwatambika Walawi, awala wose wa likabila lya Lawi, waleke kubokela isi yoyose iwe yawo mna Isiraeli, wawo watsokala kwa ukuja ipfinu ipfilapfighwa kwa IMNDEWA na awo uwo ulisi wawo. <verse eid="DEU 18:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="DEU 18:2" />Wawo waleke kubokela isi yoyose iwe yawo ka pfaghobokela ghamakabila ghangi gha Isiraeli. Wawo watsobokela ipfinu apfila pfayakwing'ighwa IMNDEWA, ka apfila yeye pfayalongile. <verse eid="DEU 18:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="DEU 18:3" />Ing'ombe au ing'olo yang'achinjighwa yawe nambiko, iwatambika weng'ighwe chidali, na makanza meli na pfinu pfili munda. <verse eid="DEU 18:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="DEU 18:4" />Muweng'e pfijo pfenu pfamlimbula, idipfai yenu na mapfuta, na mighala ikwandusa kughanighwa ye wang'olo wenu. <verse eid="DEU 18:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="DEU 18:5" />Kwaapfila mna ghamakabila ghenu ghose, IMNDEWA, Imulungu wenu kawasaghula Walawi ne wana wawo wamale weme na walisang'anile litaghwa lye IMNDEWA Imulungu.”<verse eid="DEU 18:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="DEU 18:6" />“Mlawi wowose yang'abama mwenyegho kutsa kulawa mna ghumji ghwoghwose ghwa Isiraeli ghwayokala na kughenda hanu hayosaghula IMNDEWA, Imulungu wenu, <verse eid="DEU 18:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="DEU 18:7" />aho kodaha kusang'anila IMNDEWA, Imulungu wake ka Walawi wayaghe pfawosang'ana hambele ha IMNDEWA. <verse eid="DEU 18:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="DEU 18:8" />Naye katsakwing'ighwa ipfinu ka pfawakwing'ighwa wayaghe, ipfilapfighwa pfiwe nambiko hata ka katsobokela pfinu ipfilawa mna tsimali tsawoutsa ndughu tsake.”<verse eid="DEU 18:8" /></para>
  <para style="s">Ipfihendo ipfimwihila IMNDEWA</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="DEU 18:9" />“Hamkwingila mna isi iyomwing'ani IMNDEWA Imulungu, mleke kwigha ipfihendo ipfimwihila IMNDEWA pfe wanu iwokala ako. <verse eid="DEU 18:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="DEU 18:10" />Kuleke kulawila munu wowose mna mwemwe iyombititsa mwanaghe ipinga au mmale mmoto yawe nambiko ya kulakatsighwa, wala kuleke kulawila mtowa lamli, iyotambula ighatsolawila, iyolaghula wala imuhawi, <verse eid="DEU 18:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="DEU 18:11" />wala mlogha wayaghe, wala yana ipfinyamkela, wala iyolonga na imitsimu, wala munu iyowalomba iwafile. <verse eid="DEU 18:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="DEU 18:12" />Kwaapfila imunu iyotenda ipfinu apfino komwihila IMNDEWA Imulungu, na kwa ukutenda agho IMNDEWA, Imulungu wenu kowawinga iwanu awo hambele henu. <verse eid="DEU 18:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="DEU 18:13" />Lekeni mwemwe mleke kwoneka mna matotso hambele ha IMNDEWA, Imulungu wenu.”<verse eid="DEU 18:13" /></para>
  <para style="s">IMNDEWA katsomtuma inabii</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="DEU 18:14" />Iwanu iwokala mna isi yamghenda kuisola wowinza aghala ghawolonga watowa lamli na walaghutsi. Lekeni mwemwe, IMNDEWA, Imulungu wenu kowaghoma kutenda apfo. <verse eid="DEU 18:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="DEU 18:15" />IMNDEWA, Imulungu wenu katsomwing'ani nabili iyali ka nene kulawa mna mwemwe, namwe mumtegheletse yeye.<verse eid="DEU 18:15" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="DEU 18:16" />“Achi chicho chamumlombile IMNDEWA, Imulungu wenu akula Horebu (Chidunda Sinai) hamtingane hamwe na hamlongile, ‘Tuleke kuhulika keli litsi lye IMNDEWA, Imulungu wetu wala kwona keli ghumoto mkulu ka ghuno, hela tutsakufa.’ <verse eid="DEU 18:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="DEU 18:17" />Naye IMNDEWA tsakanongela, ‘Chawalongile walongesa.’ <verse eid="DEU 18:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="DEU 18:18" />Nitsowasaghulila inabii kulawa mna ndughu tsawo ka ghweghwe, na nitsomwing'a cha ukulonga mna mlomo ghwake, naye katsowalongela ghose ghanitsomlaghitsa. <verse eid="DEU 18:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="DEU 18:19" />Munu wowose iyolema kutegheletsa achila chayolonga yeye kwa taghwa lyangu, nene mwenyegho nitsomhigha. <verse eid="DEU 18:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="DEU 18:20" />Lekeni inabii iyolonga kwa taghwa lya milungu ingi, au iyolonga kwa litaghwa lyangu ichinu chila nene simlongele yalonge baye, inabii ayo yakomighwe.”<verse eid="DEU 18:20" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="DEU 18:21" />“Lekeni mwemwe mwodaha kulonga, ‘Tudahatse kumanya imbuli ila ng'ailongile baye IMNDEWA?’ <verse eid="DEU 18:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="DEU 18:22" />Inabii yang'alonga kwa litaghwa lya IMNDEWA, na chayalongile ng'achitendeka baye, wala ng'achilawila baye, acho chicho ing'achilongighwe baye na IMNDEWA. Inabii ayo kalonga kwa ichidandali. Apfo mleke kumpfuka.”<verse eid="DEU 18:22" /></para>
  <chapter eid="DEU 18" />
  <chapter number="19" style="c" sid="DEU 19" />
  <para style="s">Imiji ya ukutsumila</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="DEU 19:1" />“IMNDEWA, Imulungu wenu hayatsowakoma iwanu iwokala mna isi iyomwing'ani, namwe hamtsowaboka na kukala mna imiji yawo na mna tsing'anda tsawo, <verse eid="DEU 19:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="DEU 19:2" />mbaghule miji midatu ikale haghati ghati mwe isi iyomwing'ani IMNDEWA, Imulungu wenu iwe yenu. <verse eid="DEU 19:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="DEU 19:3" />Mlime tsinzila itsipfika ako, muighole mala ndatu isi iyomwing'ani IMNDEWA, Imulungu wenu iwe yenu, ili munu wowose iyomkoma imunu ghila yadahe kutsumila mna mji ghumwe mna imiji ayo midatu. <verse eid="DEU 19:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="DEU 19:4" />Imunu yang'amkoma miyaghe ghila, naye tsa ng'amwihile baye, ayo kobamighwa yatsumile ako ili yahone. <verse eid="DEU 19:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="DEU 19:5" />Tulonge, imunu yang'aghenda na miyaghe kumuhulo kughana tsingodi, na hayoghana lughodi ihoya isomoka na imlagha miyaghe na kumkoma, imunu ayo kobamighwa yatsumile mna imiji ino, ili yahone, yawe mghima. <verse eid="DEU 19:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="DEU 19:6" />Ka kuna ghumji ghumwe ighuli na utali mkulu kulawa kumuhulo mbaka ako, na indughu we munu iyakomighwe kona maya, na komuwinza yamkome ka ng'obamighwa baye yafe, kwaapfila ng'awang'ali wehila baye. <verse eid="DEU 19:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="DEU 19:7" />Apfo lelo nowalaghitsa muibaghule imiji midatu.”<verse eid="DEU 19:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="DEU 19:8" />“Ka IMNDEWA, Imulungu wenu kakongetsa ukulu we isi yenu, ka pfayelahile kwe iwahenga wenu, naye kaweng'a isi yose iyalongile koweng'a iwahenga wenu, <verse eid="DEU 19:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="DEU 19:9" />namwe mng'aghakinda ghamalaghitso ghose ghaniwalaghitsa leloli, na kumkunda IMNDEWA, Imulungu wenu, na kutenda ghose ghayobama, aho mbaghule keli miji midatu ingi. <verse eid="DEU 19:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="DEU 19:10" />Mbaghule imiji ayo midatu ili iwanu iwakomile ghila waleke kukomighwa mna isi yenu iyomwing'ani IMNDEWA, Imulungu wenu iwe yenu, hela mtsakwoneka mmwagha idamu hela kwa ukukomighwa kwe wanu awo.”<verse eid="DEU 19:10" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="DEU 19:11" />“Lekeni ka imunu komwihila miyaghe, komwembela na kumkoma, kuya kotsumila mna imiji ino, <verse eid="DEU 19:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="DEU 19:12" />pfilongotsi wa ghumji ghwe munu ayo watume wanu wakamghoghe na wamuyitse kwa indughu we munu iyakomighwe, iyobama kuliha chisasi, naye yamkome. <verse eid="DEU 19:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="DEU 19:13" />Mleke kumwonela libatsi, ili ukuwakoma iwanu iwalihela matotso kumale mna isi ya Isiraeli, mng'atenda apfo mtsokala tseghamba.”<verse eid="DEU 19:13" /></para>
  <para style="s">Imibaka ya ghumwande</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="DEU 19:14" />“Aho hamtsakwingila mna isi iyomwing'ani IMNDEWA, Imulungu wenu iwe yenu mleke kuseghetsa libwe lya ghumbaka ghwa miyagho ilikighwe tangia ghumwande ne iwahenga wenu.”<verse eid="DEU 19:14" /></para>
  <para style="s">Wakalangama</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="DEU 19:15" />“Mleke kumuhigha imunu yatotsile kwa ukalangama wa imunu yumwe yaliyeka, wanu weli iwonile walonge ka munu katotsa. <verse eid="DEU 19:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="DEU 19:16" />Imunu yang'aghetsa kumlapfila maghomba gha ughutsu miyaghe, <verse eid="DEU 19:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="DEU 19:17" />iwanu weli wesongile watsakwima hambele ha IMNDEWA na hambele ha iwatambika na walamtsi iwali baho, iwosang'ana mna ghamatsuwa agho. <verse eid="DEU 19:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="DEU 19:18" />Walamtsi waghutse ghutse mna lighomba alyo na ka munu yumwe iyonile chilawile kolonga ughutsu, na kombangitsila maghomba miyaghe kwa ughutsu, <verse eid="DEU 19:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="DEU 19:19" />naye mumtendele ka pfayabamile kumtendela ndughu yake. Apfo pfipfo pfamtsotenda ighehile ghamale mna mwemwe. <verse eid="DEU 19:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="DEU 19:20" />Iwanu iwakalile hawatsohulika agho watsopfuka, na agho ighehile ng'aghatsotendeka keli baye mna mwemwe. <verse eid="DEU 19:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="DEU 19:21" />Mleke kuwonela libatsi wanu ka awo, ughima kwa ughima, nenge kwa nenge, tsino kwa tsino, mwoko kwa mwoko na mghulu kwa mghulu.”<verse eid="DEU 19:21" /></para>
  <chapter eid="DEU 19" />
  <chapter number="20" style="c" sid="DEU 20" />
  <para style="s">Ukughenda kwing'ondo</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="DEU 20:1" />Musa kaghendelela kuwalongela, “Hamghenda kwitowa ne wanu iwowehila mwemwe na mwakona wawo wana iwafalasi wengi na mituka ya kukweghighwa na falasi na wanu wengi kubita mwemwe, mleke kuwapfuka kwaapfila IMNDEWA Imulungu wenu iyawalapfile Misiri kahamwe namwe. <verse eid="DEU 20:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="DEU 20:2" />Hamsoghela habehi kwitowa, mtambika yalongole, yawalongotse iwanu. <verse eid="DEU 20:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="DEU 20:3" />Naye yalonge, ‘Tegheletsani mwemwe muwamale wa Isiraeli, leloli mwoghenda kwitowa na iwowehilani, mleke kutenyuka ghomoyo, wala kuwapfuka, wala ukughudema, wala mleke kwingilighwa na wogha, <verse eid="DEU 20:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="DEU 20:4" />kwaapfila IMNDEWA Imulungu wenu katselongotsa namwe kuwatowela, naye katsowatenda muhume.’ <verse eid="DEU 20:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="DEU 20:5" />Kuya iwakulu wa ing'ondo watsowalongela iwanu, ‘Apfi kuna munu yatsengile ing'anda na ng'ana yaitsindule baye? Leka yoke ukaye hela katsakufa hatutsetowa nawo na munu yungi katsoitsindula. <verse eid="DEU 20:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="DEU 20:6" />Angu kuna munu yahandile mitsabibu na ng'ana yaghaje baye ghamatunda ghake? Mlekeni yoke ukaye kwaapfila yang'afa kwing'ondo munu yungi katsakuja ghamatunda ghake. <verse eid="DEU 20:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="DEU 20:7" />Pfihi hana munu kamlapfila tsengele ipinga, na yang'ali kumkwela? Mlekeni yoke ukaye kwaapfila yang'afa ako, pinga ayo katsokwelighwa na mmale yungi.’ ”<verse eid="DEU 20:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="DEU 20:8" />“Iwakulu wa ing'ondo pfipfila watsowalongela iwanu keli, ‘Pfihi hana munu iyopfuka na iyatenyuke ghumoyo? Yoke ukaye hela katsowatenda wayaghe wapfuke na watenyuke ghumoyo.’ <verse eid="DEU 20:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="DEU 20:9" />Iwakulu hawomalitsa kuwalongela iwanu, wawasaghule pfilongotsi wa kulongotsa pfikosi. <verse eid="DEU 20:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="DEU 20:10" />Hamsoghela habehi kuitowa na ghumji ghwe iwanu, muwaghutse ka wotoghola ukuleka kwitowa na mwemwe. <verse eid="DEU 20:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="DEU 20:11" />Wang'atoghola ukuleka ukwitowa namwe, nawo wowapfughulila imilango yawo, apfo iwanu wose wali mumo watsakuwa watumwa wenu, nawo watsowasang'anila tsing'onde tsenu. <verse eid="DEU 20:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="DEU 20:12" />Lekeni wang'alema, nawo wakwanza kwitowa namwe, mghupfingile ghumji aghwo, <verse eid="DEU 20:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="DEU 20:13" />na IMNDEWA, Imulungu wenu hayotsomwing'ani ghumji aghwo mna ghamoko ghenu, mkomeni chila mmale iyali mumo kwa mimaghe yenu. <verse eid="DEU 20:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="DEU 20:14" />Lekeni mwodaha kwisolela wenyegho iwapinga, iwana, imifugho, na chila chinu achila ichili mumo. Na mwodaha kudeng'elela ipfinu pfe wanu iwowehila, apfila IMNDEWA, Imulungu wenu pfayomwing'ani. <verse eid="DEU 20:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="DEU 20:15" />Muitendele pfipfo imiji yose ili kutali na isi yamtsokala.”<verse eid="DEU 20:15" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="DEU 20:16" />“Lekeni mna imiji iyomwing'ani IMNDEWA, Imulungu wenu iwe yenu, mleke kuleka chochose ichihumula. <verse eid="DEU 20:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="DEU 20:17" />Wakomeni wanu wose, Wahiti, Waamori, wakanani, Waperizi, Wahivi na Wayebusi ka IMNDEWA, Imulungu wenu pfayamlaghitseni, <verse eid="DEU 20:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="DEU 20:18" />hela watsowafunda mtende pfinu pfa kumwihila Imulungu, ka pfawoitambikila imilungu yawo namwe mtsomtendela ghehile IMNDEWA, Imulungu wenu. <verse eid="DEU 20:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="DEU 20:19" />Hamghupfingila ghumji na kughusola ghuwe ghwenu, mleke kuihinya imibiki ili mumo kwa kuighana ne hoya, kwaapfila mtsakuja ghamatunda ghe mibiki ayo. Angu imibiki wanu mbaka nayo muipfingile? <verse eid="DEU 20:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="DEU 20:20" />Lekeni mwodaha kughana mibiki ingi ili mtengenetsele tsingatsi, na minala itsomwapfila kuipfingila imiji itowa namwe mbaka ighwe.”<verse eid="DEU 20:20" /></para>
  <chapter eid="DEU 20" />
  <chapter number="21" style="c" sid="DEU 21" />
  <para style="s">Cha ukutenda hayokomighwa imunu bila kumanyika yamkomile</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="DEU 21:1" />“Imunu yang'oneka kakomighwa mna mighunda ya isi iyomwing'ani IMNDEWA Imulungu wenu iwe yenu, namwe ng'ammanyile baye imunu yamkomile, <verse eid="DEU 21:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="DEU 21:2" />iwanzehe na walamulitsi wenu waghende ako kwayakomighwe na walinge utali wa hanu aho mbaka hane imiji ili habehi. <verse eid="DEU 21:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="DEU 21:3" />Kuya iwanzehe wa ghumji agho ighuli habehi na hanu halwoneke ilukuli, wasole imwana we ng'ombe, ayula ng'ana yasang'ane ng'onde yoyose baye wala ng'ana yakweghe chinu chochose baye. <verse eid="DEU 21:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="DEU 21:4" />Wamuhulumse kulwanda, hana ilukolongo ing'alunyalagha ghamatsi baye na kulwanda ako ng'akulimighwagha baye wala kuhandighwa mbeghu baye, ako waibobotole isingo ye mwana ayo we ng'ombe. <verse eid="DEU 21:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="DEU 21:5" />Na iwatambika wa lukolo lwa Lawi nawo wawe baho kwaapfila IMNDEWA Imulungu kawasaghula wamsang'anile yeye, na wamotetse kwa taghwa lyake, na wahighe chila ghomba lya kwisonga na lya kuboka. <verse eid="DEU 21:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="DEU 21:6" />Kuya wanzehe wose wa ghumji ghuli habehi na hanu hayakomighwe imunu, wahopfughe ghamoko ghawo mchanya mwa imwana ayo we ng'ombe iyabobotolighwe isingo. <verse eid="DEU 21:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="DEU 21:7" />Nawo walonge, ‘Ng'atumkomile baye imunu ayuno wala ng'atummanyile baye iyamkomile. <verse eid="DEU 21:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="DEU 21:8" />Ghwee IMNDEWA, walekelele iwanu wako wa Isiraeli yuwakombole kulawa Misiri, wala uleke kuweng'a iwanu wako wa Isiraeli totso lya ukumkoma imunu ayuno, iyalihela totso, naghwe uwaleghusile litotso alyo. <verse eid="DEU 21:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="DEU 21:9" />Mng'atenda apfo mtsakuwa mwahela totso kwa ukukomighwa kwa imunu ayo, kwaapfila mtenda chayobama IMNDEWA.’ ”<verse eid="DEU 21:9" /></para>
  <para style="s">Ukumkwela ipinga iyaghoghighwe kung'ondo</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="DEU 21:10" />“Hamghenda kwitowa na wanu iwowehila, na IMNDEWA, Imulungu wenu yang'amwapfilani kuwatowa, na mng'awaghogha na kuka nawo, <verse eid="DEU 21:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="DEU 21:11" />ka komwona pinga iyanoghile mna iwanu awo wamuwaghoghile, na konoghelwa naye na kobama kumkwela, <verse eid="DEU 21:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="DEU 21:12" />umsole na uke naye ukaye, umghete mvili tsake na umdumle tsinumba tsake. <verse eid="DEU 21:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="DEU 21:13" />Umtsule maghwanda ghake ghayang'ali yopfala hamumghoghile na umpfatse ghangi. Na katsokala ukaye yako kwa mwetsi ghumwe, yawalilile aba wake na mai wake. Hayatsomalitsa apfo, naghwe kodaha kumkwela na kuwa mulume wake, naye kakuwa mwehe wako. <verse eid="DEU 21:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="DEU 21:14" />Ka hambele ng'umkunda keli baye, mleke yoke kwayobama. Uleke kumghutsa wala kumtenda ka mtumwa kwaapfila tsakumkwela kwa kumnanahitsa.”<verse eid="DEU 21:14" /></para>
  <para style="s">Ulisi wa Mwana Chaudele</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="DEU 21:15" />“Ka imunu kakwela wehe weli, na komkunda yumwe kubita yungi, na wose weli wamwelekela wana walume, lekeni imwana iyanzile kwoneka wa ayula ipinga ing'ayokundighwa baye, <verse eid="DEU 21:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="DEU 21:16" />immale ayo hayatsobama kughola ipfinu pfake pfayali napfo kwe wanaghe, yaleke kughola pfinu pfe mwana chaudele kwe mwana yula we pinga iyomnoghela, lekeni yaghole kwe mwana yula we ipinga ing'ayomkunda baye, kwaapfila yeye yuyo mwana chaudele ghendo. <verse eid="DEU 21:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="DEU 21:17" />Kobamighwa yamtoghole imwana we pinga ing'ayomkunda baye na yamwing'e mafungu meli gha pfinu pfake pfose, Kwaapfila imwana chaudele kolangusa tsingipfu tsa mwanduso tsa ubala wa aba wake, ipfinu pfa mwana chaudele pfakwake.”<verse eid="DEU 21:17" /></para>
  <para style="s">Imwana yane chidandali</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="DEU 21:18" />“Ka munu kana mwana mmale msughu na kana chidandali, naye ng'owategheletsa baye aba wake na mai wake hawomkanya, <verse eid="DEU 21:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="DEU 21:19" />aba wake na mai wake wamghale imwana ayo hambele ha iwakulu wa ghumji ghwayokala, hana lilango lya ghumji. <verse eid="DEU 21:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="DEU 21:20" />Wawalongele iwakulu awo, ‘Imwanetu ayuno msughu na kana chidandali, ng'obama baye kututegheletsa, kakwasa hela tsisendi na kopatika.’ <verse eid="DEU 21:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="DEU 21:21" />Kuya iwanu wose iwokala mna ghumji aghwo wamtowe na mabwe mbaka yafe. Mng'atenda apfo mtsoghalapfa ghehile mna mwemwe, na wanu wose wa Isiraeli watsohulika na kupfuka.”<verse eid="DEU 21:21" /></para>
  <para style="s">Malaghitso ghangi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="DEU 21:22" />“Ka munu katenda nzambi ng'ulu imtenda yakomighwe na ilukuli lwake lukondekighwa mna ghumbiki, <verse eid="DEU 21:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="DEU 21:23" />ilukuli lwake luleke kukala mna ghumbiki chilo chose. Mlutsike misi iyo kwaapfila munu wowose iyakondekighwe kalighitighwa na IMNDEWA, hela mtsoitenda isi iyomwing'ani IMNDEWA Imulungu iwe yenu ihe.”<verse eid="DEU 21:23" /></para>
  <chapter eid="DEU 21" />
  <chapter number="22" style="c" sid="DEU 22" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="DEU 22:1" />Ung'amwona ing'ombe au ing'olo wa Mwisiraeli miyagho kakwagha, uleke kumleka yaghe, umuyitse kwa ndughu yako. <verse eid="DEU 22:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="DEU 22:2" />Lekeni ka ukaye kwa ndughu yako kutali au ng'aumanyile baye wa nani, umsole uke naye ukaye yako, na yakale kuko mbaka imwenyegho hayatsakutsa kumbama, naghwe umuyitsile. <verse eid="DEU 22:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="DEU 22:3" />Utende pfipfo ka ndughu yako kaghisa ipunda wake au ghwanda lyake au chinu chochose ichili chake, uleke kuleka kumwapfila.<verse eid="DEU 22:3" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="DEU 22:4" />“Ung'amwona ichihongwe au ing'ombe wa ndughu yako kaghwa mnzila, uleke kwibalaghutsa ka ng'umwonile baye, umwapfile ing'ombe wa miyagho yenuke.”<verse eid="DEU 22:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="DEU 22:5" />“Ipinga yaleke kupfala maghwanda gha iwamale, na immale yaleke kupfala maghwanda ghe wapinga, kwaapfila IMNDEWA, Imulungu wenu komuhila imunu iyotenda apfo.”<verse eid="DEU 22:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="DEU 22:6" />“Ung'achona chibali cha chideghe mna mbiki au hasi mnzila, na ichideghe ayo kawasila iwanaghe au mapfinga ghake, uleke kumsola ichideghe ayo. <verse eid="DEU 22:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="DEU 22:7" />Uwasole iwanaghe lekeni umleke ichideghe ayo yoke. Ung'atenda apfo kutsobweda na kutsokala muisi matsuwa mengi.”<verse eid="DEU 22:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="DEU 22:8" />“Hautsenga ng'anda ingi, wike kingamitsi ahala hauhaghala ili imunu yang'aghwa na ukufa uleke kwoneka ka yumuhonzile ghweghwe.”<verse eid="DEU 22:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="DEU 22:9" />“Uleke kuhanda mbeghu tsiingi mna ghumghunda ghwako ghwa mitsabibu, ung'atenda apfo, tsinzabibu tsako hamwe na ghamatunda gha tsimbeghu tsingi pfitsakuwa pfiha hambele ha IMNDEWA.”<verse eid="DEU 22:9" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="DEU 22:10" />“Uleke kuwaleka ing'ombe na ichihongwe walime aku wokwegha ghembe limwe.”<verse eid="DEU 22:10" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="DEU 22:11" />“Uleke kupfala maghwanda ighafumighwe kwa imighala ya ng'olo hamwe na nyutsi nzelu tsinoghile.”<verse eid="DEU 22:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="DEU 22:12" />“Wohe ipfifundo pfa nyutsi mna tsimembe nne tsa ghamaghwanda ghako.”<verse eid="DEU 22:12" /></para>
  <para style="s">Ghamalaghitso gha ughoni</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="DEU 22:13" />“Mmale yang'akwela ipinga, na kukala naye kuya hambele kobama kumleka, <verse eid="DEU 22:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="DEU 22:14" />na kombangitsila ka katenda pfinu pfa chinyala na kumwing'a taghwa lihile kolonga, ‘Nimkwela ipinga ayuno, lekeni haniwasile naye, nene sonile baye ka tsakana bikila.’ ”<verse eid="DEU 22:14" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="DEU 22:15" />“Kuya aba na mai we pinga ayo wasole ligholole lyayawasile ililangusa ka imwana wawo tsakana bikila, kuya walighale kwe iwabala wa ghumji aghwo. <verse eid="DEU 22:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="DEU 22:16" />Aba wake ipinga ayo yawalongele iwabala awo apfino, ‘Nimwing'a imwanangu munu ayuno yamkwele, lekeni sambi komlema.’ <verse eid="DEU 22:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="DEU 22:17" />Mlole kambangitsila maghomba gha chinyala mwanangu, kalonga, ‘Somwonile baye ka bikila.’ Lekeni ligholole ililangusa ka mwanangu ka bikila alino ahano.”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="DEU 22:17">“Kuya waligholose ligholole alyo hambele ha iwabala awo, <verse eid="DEU 22:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="DEU 22:18" />na iwabala awo wamsole imunu ayo na wamtowe. <verse eid="DEU 22:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="DEU 22:19" />Wamtotse imunu ayo pfihande pfa fetsa miya imwe, na litobole alyo yeng'ighwe aba wa ipinga ayo, kwaapfila immale ayo kamghuma chinyala imwali wa Isiraeli, na katsoghendelela kuwa mwehe wake, naye ng'atsomleka baye matsuwa ghake ghose ghayokala. <verse eid="DEU 22:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="DEU 22:20" />Lekeni ka maghomba ghayalongile gholongesa, na ubikila wake ng'awoneke baye, <verse eid="DEU 22:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="DEU 22:21" />wamsole na wamghale hana ghumlango ghwa ing'anda ya aba wake, na iwamale iwokala mna ghumji aghwo wamtowe na mabwe mbaka yafe. Kwaapfila katenda chinu cha chinyala mna isi ya Isiraeli kwa kuwasa na wamale aku yang'ali yokala ukaye kwa aba wake. Apfi pfipfo pfamtsoghatenda ighehile agho ghamale mna mwemwe.”<verse eid="DEU 22:21" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="DEU 22:22" />“Imunu yang'aghoghighwa ughoni na mwehe wa munu yungi, wose weli immale na ipinga, wobamighwa wakomighwe. Mng'atenda apfo ghehile ghatsomala mna isi ya Isiraeli.”<verse eid="DEU 22:22" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="DEU 22:23" />“Ka Immale ketingana na pinga mna ghumji, ipinga iyalapfighwe tsengele ne munu yungi naye kawasa naye, <verse eid="DEU 22:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="DEU 22:24" />muwasole wose weli mbaka kuna lilango lya ghumji aghwo, muwatowe na mabwe mbaka wafe. Kwaapfila ipinga ayo tsa kambululu na ng'akemelele yapfilighwe baye, na immale ayo kwaapfila kawasa na imwehe wa munu yungi. Mng'atenda apfo ghehile ghatsomala mna mwemwe. <verse eid="DEU 22:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="DEU 22:25" />Lekeni ka immale ketingana na pinga iyalapfighwe tsengele, kamghogha na kuwasa naye kwa ngupfu, immale yaliyeka yeye iyobamighwa kukomighwa. <verse eid="DEU 22:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="DEU 22:26" />Mleke kutenda chinu chochose kwe ipinga ayo, yeye kahela totso ilimtenda yakomighwe. Ghomba lino lyeghala na lighomba alila lye munu iyamtowile miyaghe na kumkoma. <verse eid="DEU 22:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="DEU 22:27" />Immale kamghogha ipinga ayo ako kunyika na kawasa naye, ne pinga ayo kakemelele yapfilighwe, lekeni tsakuduhu munu iyamwapfile. <verse eid="DEU 22:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="DEU 22:28" />Immale yang'etingana na pinga, naye ng'ana yalapfilighwe tsengele baye, na komghogha na kuwasa naye kwa ngupfu, nawo woneka, <verse eid="DEU 22:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="DEU 22:29" />immale ayo yamlihe aba wake ipinga ayo pfihande hamsini pfa fetsa, naye yamkwele kwaapfila kamnanahitsa yawase naye, na ng'odaha baye kumleka matsuwa ghake ghose. <verse eid="DEU 22:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="DEU 22:30" />Mmale wowose yaleke kuwasa na wehe wa aba wake, yang'atenda apfo komghuma chinyala aba wake.”<verse eid="DEU 22:30" /></para>
  <chapter eid="DEU 22" />
  <chapter number="23" style="c" sid="DEU 23" />
  <para style="s">Iwanu iwolemighwa kwingila hanu ha ukutambikila</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="DEU 23:1" />“Mmale wowose iyaswayulighwe au iyaghanighwe ulume wake yaleke kukala hamwe na mtingano ghwa iwanu wa IMNDEWA.”<verse eid="DEU 23:1" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="DEU 23:2" />“Imwana iyelekighwe na mmale wa Isiraeli na pinga wa isi ingi yaleke kwingila mna mtingano ghwe IMNDEWA hata watsukulu wake iwatsakwoneka mbaka mna lweleko lwa kumi. <verse eid="DEU 23:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="DEU 23:3" />Waamori na Wamoabu waleke kwingila mna mtingano ghwa IMNDEWA, hata iwana wawo iwoweleka mbaka mna lweleko lwa kumi. <verse eid="DEU 23:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="DEU 23:4" />Kwaapfila tsawalema kuweng'ani ichijo na ghamatsi hamng'ali mwa mnzila kulawa Misiri, na tsawamkema Baalamu mwana wa Beori kulawa mna ghumji ghwa Petori ighuli mna isi ya Mesopotamia, yawalighiteni mwemwe. <verse eid="DEU 23:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="DEU 23:5" />Lekeni IMNDEWA, Imulungu wenu ng'amtegheletse baye Balaamu, na ukulighita kwake kughalambuka na kuwatenda mwemwe mbalikiighwe, kwaapfila IMNDEWA, Imulungu wenu tsakawakunda mwemwe. <verse eid="DEU 23:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="DEU 23:6" />Hamtsokala nawo, mleke kutenda chinu chochose ichiwapfila wanu wano, au ichiwatenda webwede.”<verse eid="DEU 23:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="DEU 23:7" />“Mleke kuwahila Waedomu, awo ndughu tsenu, mleke kuwahila Wamisiri, kwaapfila tsamkala muisi mwawo ka wagheni. <verse eid="DEU 23:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="DEU 23:8" />Iwana wawo iwatsakwelekighwa mna lweleko lwa kadatu, awo Waedomu na Wamisiri, wodaha kwingila mna ghumtingano ghwa IMNDEWA.”<verse eid="DEU 23:8" /></para>
  <para style="s">Kuyika indalo ya ing'ondo yele itogholighwe na IMNDEWA</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="DEU 23:9" />“Hamghenda kutsenga indalo mwitowe nawo, mwalangitse mleke kuleka chinu chochose chiwatende mleke kutogholighwa hambele ha IMNDEWA. <verse eid="DEU 23:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="DEU 23:10" />Ka kuna mmale mna mwemwe keha kwa kulawa tsimbeghu nechilo, yalawe kunze kwe ndalo na yakale kuko. <verse eid="DEU 23:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="DEU 23:11" />Lekeni haipfika nemihe yoghe, na litsuwa ling'aswa yoye kune indalo.”<verse eid="DEU 23:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="DEU 23:12" />“Mwike hanu kunze kwe indalo yenu, ha ukughendela kucholo. <verse eid="DEU 23:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="DEU 23:13" />Mghale chidugho mna ipfinu pfenu, namwe hambaghuka, mtsohimbila na kusila hasi mipfi tsenu. <verse eid="DEU 23:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="DEU 23:14" />Indalo yenu yele, kwaapfila IMNDEWA Imulungu wenu kakwanga mna indalo yenu ili yawakinge na yawaghele iwanu iwomwihilani mmoko mwenu. Mleke kutenda chinu cha chinyala mghati mwenu ichimtenda IMNDEWA yahunduke na kuwaleka.”<verse eid="DEU 23:14" /></para>
  <para style="s">Malaghitso ghangi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="DEU 23:15" />“Ka imtumwa kotsumila kuna mwemwe, uleke kumuyitsa kwa imtwa wake. <verse eid="DEU 23:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="DEU 23:16" />Mumleke yakale namwe mna ikaye yoyose iyobama na iyoisaghula mna ghumji ghwenu, mleke kumtendela pfihile.”<verse eid="DEU 23:16" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="DEU 23:17" />“Muisiraeli wowose, yawe mmale au pinga, yaleke kuwasa ne pfiweghe wa hanu ha ukutambikila. <verse eid="DEU 23:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="DEU 23:18" />Tobole lyolyose ililawa mna sang'ano tsa uweghe tsa hanu aho, mleke kughala mng'anda mwe IMNDEWA, Imulungu wenu kulihila natsili, kwaapfila ipinga au immale chiweghe we ng'anda ya ukutambikila IMNDEWA kowahila.”<verse eid="DEU 23:18" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="DEU 23:19" />“Haumwatsima Muisiraeli miyagho ilitobole, ichijo au chinu chochose chila, uleke kumbama nyongetsa mna chinu chila chaumwatsime. <verse eid="DEU 23:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="DEU 23:20" />Kodaha kubama nyongetsa haumwatsima imgheni, lekeni si kwa Muisiraeli miyagho baye, naye IMNDEWA, Imulungu wenu katsowabaliki kwa chila chinu chamsang'ana mna isi yamghenda kuisola iwe yenu. <verse eid="DEU 23:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="DEU 23:21" />Hawilaha kumlapfila ichinu Imulungu, uleke kukawa kulapfa, kwaapfila IMNDEWA, Imulungu wako kokubama ghweghwe utende apfo, lekeni ka ng'utenda apfo baye, kutsakuwa kotenda nzambi. <verse eid="DEU 23:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="DEU 23:22" />Ung'aleka kwilaha, ng'utsakuwa na nzambi baye, <verse eid="DEU 23:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="DEU 23:23" />lekeni chochose ichilawa mna imilomo yenu mchitende, kwaapfila mwilaha kwa IMNDEWA, Imulungu wenu kwa milomo yenu wenyegho.”<verse eid="DEU 23:23" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="DEU 23:24" />“Haubita mna mghunda ghwa miyagho ghwa mitsabibu, kodaha kuja nzabibu na kwighuta, lekeni uleke kughondola na kwika mna ichiseghe chako. <verse eid="DEU 23:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="DEU 23:25" />Haubita mna mghunda ghwa miyagho ghwa uhemba, kodaha kukwanyula mikungwi na ukuja, lekeni uleke kusola isengo na kughana uhemba wake.”<verse eid="DEU 23:25" /></para>
  <chapter eid="DEU 23" />
  <chapter number="24" style="c" sid="DEU 24" />
  <para style="s">Ukwileka na ukumuyila miyagho</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="DEU 24:1" />Immale yang'akwela pinga na hambele ng'omkunda baye kwaapfila kona chinu chihile cha chinyala, na yang'amwandikila ibaluwa yo kumleka, na kumwing'a ipinga ayo yoke. <verse eid="DEU 24:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="DEU 24:2" />Na ka ipinga ayo kakwelighwa na mmale yungi, <verse eid="DEU 24:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="DEU 24:3" />naye pfipfila ng'omkunda baye, apfo komwandikila ibaluwa ya ukumleka, yamwing'e na yamleke yoke hakaye yake. Au ka immale wake wa keli yang'afa, <verse eid="DEU 24:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="DEU 24:4" />immale yalongole kumkwela na kumleka ng'obamighwa baye kumkwela keli kwaapfila ipinga ayo keha hambele ha IMNDEWA. Ichinu acho chomwihila IMNDEWA. Mleke kutenda inzambi ka aino mna isi iyomwing'ani IMNDEWA, Imulungu wenu iwe yenu.<verse eid="DEU 24:4" /></para>
  <para style="s">Malaghitso ghangi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="DEU 24:5" />“Imunu iyakwelile sambi yaleke kughenda kwitowa kung'ondo, wala kwing'ighwa ng'onde yoyose, yakale hela kwa mwaka ghumwe ili yebwede hamwe na imwehe wake iyamkwelile.”<verse eid="DEU 24:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="DEU 24:6" />“Ung'amwatsima imunu chinu chako, uleke kumlongela yeke poni libwe lyake lya ukusaghila ipfijo, liwe lya hasi au lya mchanya, ung'atenda apfo kowika poni ughima wake.”<verse eid="DEU 24:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="DEU 24:7" />“Munu wowose yang'amghogha Mwisiraeli miyaghe na kumtenda mtumwa na kumuutsa, ayo iyamghoghile miyaghe yakomighwe. Apfi pfipfo pfamtsotenda ghehile ghamale mna mwemwe.”<verse eid="DEU 24:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="DEU 24:8" />“Imunu yang'awa na utamu wihile wa ngotsi, mwalangitse ghendo kutenda aghala ghawowalongela Walawi iwatambika. Mghakinde ghoya aghala ghose ghaniwalaghitse. <verse eid="DEU 24:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="DEU 24:9" />Mkumbuke achila IMNDEWA Imulungu chayamtendile Miriamu hamng'ali mwa mnzila kulawa Misiri.”<verse eid="DEU 24:9" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="DEU 24:10" />“Ung'amwatsima chinu chochose miyagho, uleke kwingila mng'anda mwake na kusola ghwanda lyake liwe poni, <verse eid="DEU 24:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="DEU 24:11" />ila umbete kunze na umleke yeye mwenyegho yakughalile lighwanda alyo. <verse eid="DEU 24:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="DEU 24:12" />Yang'awa mhingwa uleke kukala na lighwanda lyake chilo chose, <verse eid="DEU 24:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="DEU 24:13" />umuyitsile nemihe ili yeghubike nechilo, naye katsolonga mighede kuna ghweghwe. Na chautendile chitsakoneka chinogha hambele ha IMNDEWA, Imulungu wenu.”<verse eid="DEU 24:13" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="DEU 24:14" />“Mleke kumbunza imunu yamumkema yawasang'anile kwa misi imwe, iyali mhingwa na iyalihela chinu, yawe Muisiraeli miyagho au yawe mgheni iyokala mna imiji yenu. <verse eid="DEU 24:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="DEU 24:15" />Mumlihe litobole lyake chila haipfika nemihe, kwaapfila yeye kamhingwa na ghumoyo ghwake ghohuwila kubokela maliho agho. Lekeni ka ng'amumliha baye, yeye katsomlilila IMNDEWA, naghwe kutsakoneka kuna nzambi. <verse eid="DEU 24:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="DEU 24:16" />Tsina aba waleke kukomighwa kwa nzambi tsawatendile iwana wawo, na iwana pfipfila waleke kukomighwa kwa tsinzambi tsawatendile aba tsawo. Chila munu yakomighwe kwa nzambi iyatendile imwenyegho.”<verse eid="DEU 24:16" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="DEU 24:17" />“Mleke kuwema aghala ghose ghawobamighwa weng'ighwe iwagheni na wana iwachuwa, na ung'amwatsima ichinu ipinga chitsuka, uleke kumlekela yeke poni lighwanda lyake. <verse eid="DEU 24:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="DEU 24:18" />Mkumbuke ghendo ka mwemwe namwe tsa mwa watumwa mna isi ya Misiri na IMNDEWA, Imulungu wenu kawakombola kulawa ako. Apfo nowalaghitsa mwemwe mtende apfo. <verse eid="DEU 24:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="DEU 24:19" />Hampfuna ipfijo pfenu kumghunda namwe mwisemwa makinza ghe pfijo, mleke kuya na kusalalitsa, apfo muwalekele iwagheni, ipfitsuka na iwachuwa, naye IMNDEWA, Imulungu wenu katsowatenda mwemwe mmbalikiighwe mna chila chinu chamtenda. <verse eid="DEU 24:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="DEU 24:20" />Hambawa matunda ghe mitseituni mna mibiki yenu, mleke kuya na kusalalitsa, matunda ghakalile muwalekele iwagheni, iwachuwa na ipfitsuka. <verse eid="DEU 24:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="DEU 24:21" />Hamghondola tsinzabibu mna mighunda yenu mleke kuya na kusalalitsa, agho ighakalile walekeleni iwagheni, ipfitsuka na iwachuwa. <verse eid="DEU 24:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="DEU 24:22" />Mleke kwisemwa ka mwemwe tsamwa watumwa akula Misiri. Apfo nowalaghitsa kutenda aghano.”<verse eid="DEU 24:22" /></para>
  <chapter eid="DEU 24" />
  <chapter number="25" style="c" sid="DEU 25" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="DEU 25:1" />“Musa kaghendelela kulonga, ‘Ka iwanu weli wesonga, waghale ghomba lyawo kune libalatsa wakalamle walamulitsi, ako yumwe yang'oneka kahela totso, na miyaghe yang'ahighighwa, <verse eid="DEU 25:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="DEU 25:2" />ka ayula iyahighighwe kobamighwa yafapulighwe, imlamtsi yamlaghitse yafuname hasi na yamfapule, na ipfiboko apfo pfighale na litotso lyayatendile. <verse eid="DEU 25:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="DEU 25:3" />Lekeni kodaha kumfapula pfiboko alubaini. Yang'atowighwa kubita apfo, mwomghuma chinyala miyenu.’ ”<verse eid="DEU 25:3" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="DEU 25:4" />“Mleke kumwoha chibang'wa ing'ombe ahala hayotowa uhemba.”<verse eid="DEU 25:4" /></para>
  <para style="s">Ichinu cha ukutenda ndughu yako yang'afa</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="DEU 25:5" />“Ka ndughu weli wokala hamwe, na yumwe yang'afa bila kuleka mwana mmale, imwehe wake yaleke kukwelighwa kungi. Ndughu we munu yafile kobamighwa yamsole ipinga ayo na yamkwele. <verse eid="DEU 25:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="DEU 25:6" />Imwana mmale wa kwanza iyatsomweleka katsopetighwa wa ayula iyafile ili taghwa lyake lileke kuhupa mna isi ya Isiraeli. <verse eid="DEU 25:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="DEU 25:7" />Lekeni ka imunu ng'obama baye kumkwela ipinga wa ndugu yake iyafile, ipinga ayo yawaghendele iwakulu we ghumji na yawalongele, ‘Ndughu we mmale wangu iyafile kolema kughendeletsa taghwa lya ndughu yake mna isi ya Isiraeli, kolema ukunikwela nene ili nene nimwelekele ndughu yake imwana mmale.’ <verse eid="DEU 25:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="DEU 25:8" />Kuya iwakulu we ghumji wamkeme na walonge naye, ka koghendelela kulema na kolonga nene simkwela baye, <verse eid="DEU 25:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="DEU 25:9" />ipinga ayo yamseghelele hambele ha iwakulu, na yamtsule likwabatsa lyake limwe na yamtemele ghamate mchihanga na yalonge, ‘Apfi pfipfo pfayotendighwa immale iyolema kughendeletsa litaghwa lya ndughu yake.’ <verse eid="DEU 25:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="DEU 25:10" />Ikaye ya imunu ayo itsomanyika ka ‘Ikaye ya immale iyatsulighwe likwabatsa.’ ”<verse eid="DEU 25:10" /></para>
  <para style="s">Malaghitso ghangi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="DEU 25:11" />“Wamale weli wang'etowa, na mwehe wa yumwe wawo yang'atsa kumwapfila immale wake kwa kumkinda kuisi immale iyetowa na immale wake ili yamwapfile immale wake, <verse eid="DEU 25:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="DEU 25:12" />umghane ghumoko ghwake ipinga ayo wala uleke kumwonela libatsi.”<verse eid="DEU 25:12" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="DEU 25:13" />“Mleke kuwa na mabwe meli gha ukupimila, limwe bewe na lingi tito. <verse eid="DEU 25:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="DEU 25:14" />Mleke kuwa na pfipimo pfili mng'anda mwenu, chimwe chikulu na chingi chidodo. <verse eid="DEU 25:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="DEU 25:15" />Muwe na pfipimo pfinoghile na pfigholoke, ili mkale matsuwa mengi mna isi iyomwing'ani IMNDEWA Imulungu wenu. <verse eid="DEU 25:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="DEU 25:16" />Kwaapfila IMNDEWA, Imulungu wenu komuhila imunu iyotenda agho ghose, na wose iwoghutsuka.”<verse eid="DEU 25:16" /></para>
  <para style="s">Malaghitso gha kuwakoma Waamaleki</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="DEU 25:17" />“Mkumbuke achila chawawatendele Waamaleki hamng'ali mwa mnzila mwakuka kulawa Misiri. <verse eid="DEU 25:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="DEU 25:18" />Hamwipfile na kutsilika, wawo wetingana namwe mnzila, wawatowa wose iiwakalile kuchughu awala iwepfile ghendo. Waamaleki ng'awampfukile ghendo baye Imulungu. <verse eid="DEU 25:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="DEU 25:19" />IMNDEWA, Imulungu wenu hayatsowatenda mbwihile kulawa kwa awala wose iwowahila, iwali habehi namwe, mna isi iyomwing'ani iwe yenu, muwakome ghendo Wamaleki wose wahupe, alyo mleke kwisemwa.”<verse eid="DEU 25:19" /></para>
  <chapter eid="DEU 25" />
  <chapter number="26" style="c" sid="DEU 26" />
  <para style="s">Ipfijo pfamlimbula na izaka</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="DEU 26:1" />Musa kaghendelela kulonga, “Hampfika mna isi iyomwing'ani IMNDEWA, Imulungu wenu iwe yenu na kukala mumo, <verse eid="DEU 26:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="DEU 26:2" />msole chamlimbula kulawa ipfijo pfenu pfose mna isi iyomwing'ani IMNDEWA, Imulungu wenu, mwike pfijo apfo mna ichiseghe. Kuya mghende hanu hayahasaghule IMNDEWA, Imulungu wenu hawe hakaye yake. <verse eid="DEU 26:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="DEU 26:3" />Ughende kwa mtambika iyosang'ana mna matsuwa agho, na umlongele, ‘Leloli notoghola hambele ha IMNDEWA Imulungu wako, nyingila mna isi iyelahile Imulungu kwa iwahenga wetu ka katsotwing'a twetwe.’ <verse eid="DEU 26:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="DEU 26:4" />Imtambika yasole ichiseghe ichili mmoko mwako, na yeke hasi hana imatsabahu ya IMNDEWA, Imulungu wenu. <verse eid="DEU 26:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="DEU 26:5" />Naghwe ulonge apfino hambele ha IMNDEWA, Imulungu wako, ‘Aba wangu tsa Mwalami tsakanga akuno na akuno, kahulumka Misiri kakala kuko, yeye na wayaghe tsa wachidogho, kuko wongetseka wawa wengi, wane ngupfu. <verse eid="DEU 26:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="DEU 26:6" />Lekeni Wamisiri tsawatutendela pfihile, watudununza na watunanahitsa kusang'ana ng'onde ng'omu ka watumwa. <verse eid="DEU 26:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="DEU 26:7" />Kuya tumlilila IMNDEWA, Imulungu we iwahenga tsetu, na Imulungu katuhulika na kwona maghayo ghetu, na ng'onde ng'omu na pfatwonelighwe. <verse eid="DEU 26:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="DEU 26:8" />Apfo Imulungu katulapfa ako Misiri kwa ghumoko ghwake ghuna ingupfu na kwa ghumoko ghwake ighugholoke, kwa ipfihulo, na kwa pfinu pfa kukangawatsa, na pfa kughuma wogha. <verse eid="DEU 26:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="DEU 26:9" />Naye katughala hanu hano na katwing'a isi ino, inoghile kwa ukulima na ukufughila. <verse eid="DEU 26:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="DEU 26:10" />Na sambi nokughalila pfijo pfanyanzile kulimbula mna isi yaungaile.’</para>
  <para style="p" vid="DEU 26:10">“Kuya utseghetse ichiseghe acho hambele ha IMNDEWA, Imulungu wako, winame na umtamanile hambele hake. <verse eid="DEU 26:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="DEU 26:11" />Naghwe kutsodeng'elela aghala ghose ghanoghile ghakwing'ile IMNDEWA, Imulungu wako, kakwing'a ghweghwe na wanu wa akaye yako, na mdeng'elele hamwe na Walawi na wagheni wamkala nawo.<verse eid="DEU 26:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="DEU 26:12" />“Chila ghumwaka ghwa kadatu ulapfe lifungu lya kumi lye pfijo pfenu kwa Walawi, kwa iwagheni, na kwa iwachuwa, na ipfitsuka, ili nawo wadahe kuja chijo chose chawobama hawokala mmakaye mwenu. <verse eid="DEU 26:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="DEU 26:13" />Kuya ulonge pfino hambele ha IMNDEWA, Imulungu wako, ‘Ndapfa izaka ienzeluke kulawa mkaye yangu na niweng'a Iwalawi, na iwahenza, iwachuwa na ipfitsuka ka apfila pfaunilaghitse. Silekile baye kukinda wala kwisemwa laghitso lyako lyolyose. <verse eid="DEU 26:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="DEU 26:14" />Sijile baye izaka ahala hanikalile na chililo, na silibaghule baye ahala hanikalile nyiha hambele ha IMNDEWA, wala silapfile kwa iwanu iwafile baye. Nimtegheletsa IMNDEWA, Imulungu wangu, nitenda chila chinu chayanilaghitse. <verse eid="DEU 26:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="DEU 26:15" />Ulole hasi kulawa kulanga, hanu hako haenzeluke, uwabaliki iwanu wako wa Isiraeli na isi yautwing'ile ka pfawilahile kwe iwahenga wetu, isi inoghile kwa ukulima na ukufughila.’ ”<verse eid="DEU 26:15" /></para>
  <para style="s">Mkinde ghamalaghitso ghe IMNDEWA</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="DEU 26:16" />“Leloli ino, IMNDEWA, Imulungu wenu kowalaghitsa kuikinda imiko ino na malaghitso ghano, mghatende kwa ghumoyo ghwenu ghwose. <verse eid="DEU 26:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="DEU 26:17" />Leloli ino mwemwe mtoghola ghendo ka IMNDEWA yeye Imulungu wenu na mtoghola ukwanga mna tsinzila tsake tsose, na kukinda imiko yake, na malaghitso ghake ghose, namwe mtsotenda chochose chayowalongela. <verse eid="DEU 26:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="DEU 26:18" />Na leloli IMNDEWA, Imulungu wenu kawatoghola muwe wanu wake ghendo imsaghulighwe ka pfayalongile katsotenda, namwe mwobamighwa mghakinde malaghitso ghake ghose. <verse eid="DEU 26:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="DEU 26:19" />Mng'atenda apfo, yeye katsowatenda mwemwe muwe wanu wakulu kubita wanu wa isi tsingi wayawaumbile, na iwanu watsowatunya, watsowategheletsa na mtsomanyika. Namwe mtsakuwa wanu wake iwenzeluke, ka apfila pfayalongile.”<verse eid="DEU 26:19" /></para>
  <chapter eid="DEU 26" />
  <chapter number="27" style="c" sid="DEU 27" />
  <para style="s">Ghamalaghitso ighandikighwe mna ghamabwe</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="DEU 27:1" />“Kuya Musa na iwanzehe wa Isiraeli wawalongela iwanu, ‘Ghakindeni ghamalaghitso aghano ghanimwing'ani leloli.’ <verse eid="DEU 27:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="DEU 27:2" />Hamloka ghumto Yoridani na kwingila mna isi iyomwing'ani IMNDEWA Imulungu wenu, mwimitse mabwe meli makulu na mghakulughe. <verse eid="DEU 27:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="DEU 27:3" />Mghandike malaghitso ghose mna ghamabwe ghano hamloka na kwingila mna isi iyomwing'ani IMNDEWA, Imulungu wenu, isi inoghile kwa ukulima na kufughila, ka apfila IMNDEWA, Imulungu we iwahenga wenu pfayawalongele. <verse eid="DEU 27:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="DEU 27:4" />Na hampfika kumwambu mwa ghumto Yoridani, mghemitse ghamabwe ghano mna chidunda Ebali ka pfaniwalaghitsa leloli na mghakulughe.”<verse eid="DEU 27:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="DEU 27:5" />Baho mumtsengele matsabahu ye ghamabwe IMNDEWA, Imulungu wenu, na hamuhitsenga, mleke kughasongola ghamabwe agho kwa chinu chochose cha chuma. <verse eid="DEU 27:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="DEU 27:6" />Mtsomtsengela IMNDEWA, Imulungu wenu matsabahu kwa ghamabwe ng'ana ghasongolighwe baye. Imatsabahu yamtsomlapfila IMNDEWA, Imulungu wenu tsinambiko tsa ukulakatsighwa. <verse eid="DEU 27:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="DEU 27:7" />Baho mlapfe tsinambiko tsenu tsa kukala tseghamba na mtsije, na mdeng'elele hambele he IMNDEWA, Imulungu wenu. <verse eid="DEU 27:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="DEU 27:8" />Namwe mwandike pfinoghile ghamalaghitso ghose mna ghamabwe agho ghamghakulughe.<verse eid="DEU 27:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="DEU 27:9" />Kuya Musa na Walawi iwatambika, wawalongela Waisiraeli wose, “Mwinyamale, mwemwe Waisiraeli na mnitegheletse. Leloli ino mwemwe mwa iwanu wa IMNDEWA, Imulungu wenu. <verse eid="DEU 27:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="DEU 27:10" />Apfo mtegheletse chayowalongela IMNDEWA, Imulungu wenu na mkinde imiko yose na ghamalaghitso ghose ghanimwing'ani leloli.”<verse eid="DEU 27:10" /></para>
  <para style="s">Iwanu ing'awohulika wolighitighwa</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="DEU 27:11" />Tsuwa lilyo, Musa kawalaghitsa keli Waisiraeli, kalonga, <verse eid="DEU 27:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="DEU 27:12" />“Hampfika kumwambu mwa Yoridani, makabila ghano gheme mna chidunda cha Gerizimu wakemelele tsibalaka kwa iwanu, likabila lya Simoni, lya Lawi, lya Yuda, lya Isakari, lya Yosefu, na lya Banjamini. <verse eid="DEU 27:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="DEU 27:13" />Na makabila ghano gheme mna chidunda cha Ebali wakemelele ghamalighito, kabila lya Rubeni, lya Gadi, lya Asheli, lya Zabuloni, lya Dani, na lya Nafutali. <verse eid="DEU 27:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="DEU 27:14" />Kuya Walawi wawalongele iwanu wa Isiraeli kwa kukemelela.”<verse eid="DEU 27:14" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="DEU 27:15" />“Yalighitighwe imunu ayula iyosongola au iyolubula chinyagho che libwe, che mbiki, na che chuma na kuchitambikila kwa chinyelenyele. Ipfinyagho pfino pfawosongola iwanu pfomwihila IMNDEWA.”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="DEU 27:15">Kuya iwanu wose wedike walonge, “Amina!”<verse eid="DEU 27:15" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="DEU 27:16" />“Yalighitighwe imunu yula iyolema kumtegheletsa mai wake na aba wake.”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="DEU 27:16">Kuya iwanu wose wedike walonge, “Amina!” <verse eid="DEU 27:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="DEU 27:17" />“Yalighitighwe imunu wowose yula iyosoghetsa ilibwe lya ghumbaka ghwa miyaghe.”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="DEU 27:17">Na iwanu wose wedike walonge, “Amina!”<verse eid="DEU 27:17" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="DEU 27:18" />“Yalighitighwe imunu yula iyomlongotsa ichifita mna inzila imwaghisa.”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="DEU 27:18">Kuya wanu wose wedike walonge, “Amina!”<verse eid="DEU 27:18" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="DEU 27:19" />“Yalighitighwe imunu wowose yula iyowema ghawobamighwa weng'ighwe iwagheni, ipfitsuka na iwachuwa.”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="DEU 27:19">Kuya wanu wose wedike walonge, “Amina!”<verse eid="DEU 27:19" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="DEU 27:20" />“Yalighitighwe imunu yula iyowasa na mwehe wa aba wake, kwaapfila ayo komghuma chinyala aba wake.”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="DEU 27:20">Kuya iwanu wose wedike walonge, “Amina!”<verse eid="DEU 27:20" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="DEU 27:21" />“Yalighitighwe munu yula iyowasa na imnyama.”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="DEU 27:21">Kuya iwanu wose wedike walonge, “Amina!”<verse eid="DEU 27:21" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="DEU 27:22" />“Yalighitighwe immale iyowasa na lumbu wake, yawe koneka naye au koneka kunze.”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="DEU 27:22">Iwanu wose wedike walonge, “Amina!”<verse eid="DEU 27:22" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="DEU 27:23" />“Yalighitighwe immale wowose yula iyowasa na mai mkwe wake.”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="DEU 27:23">Iwanu wose wedike walonge, “Amina!”<verse eid="DEU 27:23" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="DEU 27:24" />“Yalighitighwe imunu yula iyomkoma miyaghe chinyelenyele.”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="DEU 27:24">Kuya iwanu wose wedike walonge, “Amina!”<verse eid="DEU 27:24" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="DEU 27:25" />“Yalighitighwe imunu iyobokela hongo ili yamkome imunu yalihela totso.”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="DEU 27:25">Iwanu wose wedike walonge, “Amina!”<verse eid="DEU 27:25" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="DEU 27:26" />“Yalighitighwe imunu yula iyolema kukinda ghamalaghitso na ghamalangulitso gha Imulungu.”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="DEU 27:26">Kuya iwanu wose wedike walonge, “Amina!”<verse eid="DEU 27:26" /></para>
  <chapter eid="DEU 27" />
  <chapter number="28" style="c" sid="DEU 28" />
  <para style="s">Mtsobalikiighwa mng'akinda malaghitso gha IMNDEWA</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="DEU 28:1" />“Musa kaghendelela ukulonga, Mng'amtegheletsa IMNDEWA, Imulungu wenu na kughakinda pfinoghile malaghitso ghake ghanimwing'ani leloli, yeye katsowatenda mwemwe muwe wakulu kubita wanu wose wali muisi.”<verse eid="DEU 28:1" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="DEU 28:2" />Mng'amtegheletsa IMNDEWA, Imulungu wenu, mtsobalikiighwa mna ipfinu apfino.<verse eid="DEU 28:2" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="DEU 28:3" />“IMNDEWA katsoibaliki imiji yenu na imighunda yenu.”<verse eid="DEU 28:3" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="DEU 28:4" />“IMNDEWA katsowabaliki muwe na wana wengi, mtsopfuna pfijo pfingi, na mtsakuwa na ng'ombe na ng'olo wengi.”<verse eid="DEU 28:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="DEU 28:5" />“IMNDEWA katsobaliki ipfiseghe pfenu pfitsomema ipfijo na ipfiya pfenu pfamkwambikila napfo pfitsomema ipfijo.”<verse eid="DEU 28:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="DEU 28:6" />“IMNDEWA katsobaliki hamkuya ukaye na hamlawa kunze.”<verse eid="DEU 28:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="DEU 28:7" />“Iwowehila wang'abama kwitowa na mwemwe, IMNDEWA wenu katsomwapfilani muwatowe. Watsakutsa kwa nzila imwe, lekeni watsotsumila nzila saba. <verse eid="DEU 28:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="DEU 28:8" />IMNDEWA, Imulungu wenu katsowatenda mbalikighwe mna tsing'onde tsenu tsamsang'ana na kumemesa kano tsenu, naye katsowatenda mbalikighwe mna isi iyomwing'ani.”<verse eid="DEU 28:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="DEU 28:9" />“IMNDEWA, Imulungu wenu katsowatenda mwemwe muwe wanu wake iwenzeluke ka pfayelaghane namwe, mng'akinda ghamalaghitso ghake ghose na mng'awinza nzila tsake tsose.”<verse eid="DEU 28:9" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="DEU 28:10" />Kuya iwanu wose wali muisi watsakona ghendo ka mwemwe msaghulighwa na IMNDEWA, ili muwe wanu wake imwenyegho, nawo watsowapfukani. <verse eid="DEU 28:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="DEU 28:11" />IMNDEWA katsowatenda mbalikigghwe ghendo, katsoweng'a wana wengi na mifugho mingi na pfijo pfingi mna isi iyelahile kwe iwahenga wenu kuweng'ani. <verse eid="DEU 28:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="DEU 28:12" />IMNDEWA katsopfughula ikano yake inoghile ili kulanga, naye katsoghala mvula itowe muisi mna ghumsimu ghwake, na katsobaliki chila ng'onde ya ghamoko ghenu. Mtsowatsima iwanu wa isi tsingi, lekeni mwemwe ng'amtsakwatsima baye. <verse eid="DEU 28:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="DEU 28:13" />Mwemwe mtsakuwa litwi wala ng'amtsakuwa mkila baye, mng'ategheletsa pfinoghile ghamalaghitso ghose ghanimwing'ani leloli na kughatenda, mwemwe mtsakuwa kuchanya na si hasi baye. <verse eid="DEU 28:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="DEU 28:14" />Mleke kuhunduka akuno wala akula mna ukughakinda ghamalaghitso ghanimwingani leloli, na wala mleke kuwinza milungu ingi na kuitumikila.<verse eid="DEU 28:14" /></para>
  <para style="s">Ichitsowalawila ahala hamlema kuhulika</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="DEU 28:15" />Lekeni ka mwolema kumtegheletsa Imulungu na mwoleka kukinda ghamalaghitso ghake na imiko yake yose yanimwing'ani leloli, malighito ghano ghose ghatsakuwa ghenu. <verse eid="DEU 28:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="DEU 28:16" />Kaye tsenu tsitsolighitighwa na mighunda yenu nayo itsolighitighwa. <verse eid="DEU 28:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="DEU 28:17" />Pfiseghe pfenu pfitsolighitighwa na pfiya pfenu pfamkwambikila pfitsolighitighwa.<verse eid="DEU 28:17" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="DEU 28:18" />Wana wenu watsolighitighwa na pfijo pfenu pfili muisi na mifugho yenu itsolighitighwa ileke kwongetseka. <verse eid="DEU 28:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="DEU 28:19" />Mtsolighitighwa hamkwingila na hamlawa kunze. <verse eid="DEU 28:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="DEU 28:20" />Ka mwotenda ighehile na mwomleka IMNDEWA, yeye katsowaghalila malighito, na kuwatenda muwelukeweluke, na mghanzike mna chila chinu chamtenda mbaka mwemwe mkomighwe ghendo. <verse eid="DEU 28:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="DEU 28:21" />IMNDEWA katsowaghalila matamu mbaka wose mkomighwe mna isi yamghenda kuisola iwe yenu. <verse eid="DEU 28:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="DEU 28:22" />IMNDEWA katsowaghalila utamu mkulu, lihoma, mapute, lijoto ililakatsa, kutsolawila chiyangayanga, na nyahemu, likungugu, agho ghatsowalawila mwemwe mbaka mhupe. <verse eid="DEU 28:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="DEU 28:23" />Kulanga kutsakuwa ka ishaba nitu, na muisi kutsakuwa ka chuma. <verse eid="DEU 28:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="DEU 28:24" />IMNDEWA katsotenda litimbwisi na msanga ghuwe mvula yenu, nalyo litsolawa mlanga na litsowatowa mbaka mwemwe mkomighwe. <verse eid="DEU 28:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="DEU 28:25" />IMNDEWA wenu katsowatenda mwemwe mtowighwe na iwanu iwowahila, mtsowaghendela kwa nzila imwe lekeni mtsotsumila nzila saba, na iwanu wose iwali muisi watsopfuka hawatsakona achila ichiwalawile. <verse eid="DEU 28:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="DEU 28:26" />Hamtsakufa ng'uli tsenu tsitsakuwa chijo kwa pfideghe iwali mlanga na chijo kwa wanyama iwali muisi, na kutsakuwa kuduhu munu wa kuwawinga. <verse eid="DEU 28:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="DEU 28:27" />IMNDEWA katsowaghalila mapute ighopwita, ka aghala ighawawapatile Wamisiri, na mtsakuwa na pfilonda na pfibuhu ipfikwawa, namwe ng'amtsohona baye. <verse eid="DEU 28:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="DEU 28:28" />IMNDEWA katsowadununza kwa kuwatenda muwe na lukwale na muwe pfifita na muweluke. <verse eid="DEU 28:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="DEU 28:29" />Nemisi mtsoghenda kwa kubumbulitsa bumbulitsa ka munu chifita wala inzila ng'amtsoyona baye na ng'amtsobweda baye kwa chochose chila chamtenda, mtsobunzighwa na kubokighwa na kutsakuwa kuduhu munu wa ukumwapfilani. <verse eid="DEU 28:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="DEU 28:30" />Mtsowalapfila tsengele wapinga, lekeni wanu wangi watsowasa nawo. Mtsotsenga tsing'anda lekeni watsokala wanu wangi, mtsohanda tsinzabibu, lekeni ng'amtsakuja baye ghamatunda ghake. <verse eid="DEU 28:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="DEU 28:31" />Wang'ombe wenu watsochinjighwa aku mwolola kwa tsinenge tsenu, lekeni ng'amtsakuja baye inyama yawo, mtsobokighwa pfihongwe wenu aku mwemwe mwolola kwa tsinenge tsenu, lekeni ng'awatsowoyitsa baye. Wang'olo wenu watsoweng'a iwanu iwowehila, na kutsakuwa kuduhu munu wa kumwapfilani. <verse eid="DEU 28:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="DEU 28:32" />Wana wenu wapinga na wamale watsosolighwa na wanu wangi wakawe watumwa aku mwemwe mwolola. Matsuwa ghose mtsotsodola tsinenge tsenu, na chila tsuwa mtsowalangula iwana wenu kubama woye, lekeni ng'amtsakuwa na ngupfu ya ukutenda chochose baye. <verse eid="DEU 28:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="DEU 28:33" />Iwanu wa isi ing'amuimanyile watsakuja pfijo pfa isi yenu na ipfijo pfamsang'ane kwa ngupfu yenu. Namwe ng'amtsakwambulila chinu chochose baye, na mtsakonelighwa na kughanzika matsuwa ghenu ghose. <verse eid="DEU 28:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="DEU 28:34" />Mtsakuwa na lukwale kwa aghala ghamkwona kwa tsinenge tsenu wenyegho. <verse eid="DEU 28:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="DEU 28:35" />IMNDEWA katsowadudunza kwa kuwaghalila mapute mmafindi na mmaghulu, ighatsowatenda mleke kuhona, na ghatsowenela kulawa kwitsayo mbaka kune litwi. <verse eid="DEU 28:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="DEU 28:36" />IMNDEWA katsowaghala mwemwe na mfalume wenu yamtsomsaghula wenyegho mna isi ila ng'ana mwemwe muimanye baye wala iwahenga wenu. Ako mtsoitumikila milungu ingi ye mibiki na ghamabwe. <verse eid="DEU 28:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="DEU 28:37" />Iwanu wa isi iyatsowaghala hawatsomwonani watsokangawala, watsowatendela utalatsi na kuwabetsa. <verse eid="DEU 28:37" /><verse number="38" style="v" sid="DEU 28:38" />Mtsohanda mbeghu nyingi mna mighunda yenu, lekeni mtsobeta chidogho, kwaapfila wanzighe watsakuja. <verse eid="DEU 28:38" /><verse number="39" style="v" sid="DEU 28:39" />Mtsohanda mitsabibu na kuisambulila, lekeni ng'amtsakuja baye ghamatunda ghake wala kunwa idipfai yake, kwaapfila wang'onyo watsakuja. <verse eid="DEU 28:39" /><verse number="40" style="v" sid="DEU 28:40" />Mitseituni itsomela chila hanu mna isi yenu, lekeni ng'amtsopata baye mapfuta ghake, kwaapfila mitseituni itsopughutika. <verse eid="DEU 28:40" /><verse number="41" style="v" sid="DEU 28:41" />Mtsakweleka wana wamale na wapinga lekeni ng'awatsakuwa wenu baye, kwaapfila iwanu watsowaboka na kukuka nawo. <verse eid="DEU 28:41" /><verse number="42" style="v" sid="DEU 28:42" />Mibiki yenu yose na ipfijo pfenu ipfili kumghunda pfitsakuwa pfa iwanzighe. <verse eid="DEU 28:42" /><verse number="43" style="v" sid="DEU 28:43" />Iwagheni iwokala muisi mwenu watsakuwa na ngupfu ghendo namwe mtsoghendelela kuwa nyondenyonde. <verse eid="DEU 28:43" /><verse number="44" style="v" sid="DEU 28:44" />Mtsowatsima lekeni wawo ng'awatsowatsima baye, wawo watsakuwa litwi namwe mtsakuwa mkila <verse eid="DEU 28:44" /><verse number="45" style="v" sid="DEU 28:45" />Malighito ghano ghose ghatsowapatani mwemwe, ghatsowadununza mbaka mkomighwe, kwaapfila ng'amumtegheletse baye IMNDEWA wenu na kughakinda ghamalaghitso ghake ghose ghayaweng'ile. <verse eid="DEU 28:45" /><verse number="46" style="v" sid="DEU 28:46" />Kutsolawila pfitango na pfihulo mna mwemwe na watsukulu wenu matsuwa ghose. <verse eid="DEU 28:46" /><verse number="47" style="v" sid="DEU 28:47" />IMNDEWA tsakawatenda mbalikiighwe kwa chila chinu, lekeni mwemwe ng'amumtumikile baye kwa ghumoyo ghwa kudeng'elela na ghugholoke. <verse eid="DEU 28:47" /><verse number="48" style="v" sid="DEU 28:48" />Apfo mtsowasang'anila iwanu iwowehila iyatsowatuma IMNDEWA aku mna nzala, mna ng'ilu, mwa chidako, na mhungukighwa na chila chinu. Katsowoha inila ya chuma mna tsisingo tsenu mbaka hayomalitsa kuwakoma. <verse eid="DEU 28:48" /><verse number="49" style="v" sid="DEU 28:49" />IMNDEWA katsowaghalila wanu wa isi ingi kulawa kutali, ka chitema pfayoghuluka, na ilugha yawolonga ng'amtsoitanga baye. <verse eid="DEU 28:49" /><verse number="50" style="v" sid="DEU 28:50" />Wanu wane chihanga chine ndita awo ng'awomwalangula baye imbala wala ng'awomwonela baye libatsi imdodo. <verse eid="DEU 28:50" /><verse number="51" style="v" sid="DEU 28:51" />Watsakuja iwanyama wenu, na ipfijo pfenu ipfili kumghunda mbaka mwemwe mkomighwe, ng'awatsowalekela baye ipfijo, idipfai, mapfuta, iwang'ombe, iwang'olo mbaka mwemwe mkomighwe. <verse eid="DEU 28:51" /><verse number="52" style="v" sid="DEU 28:52" />Watsoipfingilila imiji yenu yose ili mna isi yenu iyomwing'ani IIMNDEWA, na mibanda yenu yamuitoghole ighwe hasi. <verse eid="DEU 28:52" /><verse number="53" style="v" sid="DEU 28:53" />Awala iwowehila hawatsoipfingilila imiji yenu na kuwadununza, mwemwe mtsakuwa na nzala mbaka mtsakuja wana wenu wamale na wapinga, awala imuweleke wenyegho, iyaweng'ile IMNDEWA, Imulungu wenu. <verse eid="DEU 28:53" /><verse number="54" style="v" sid="DEU 28:54" />Hata imunu mwenyepfale na iyalelighwe pfinoghile katsakuwa na nzala sideke mbaka katsomwima inyama ayo indughu yake, au mwehe wake iyomkunda au iwanaghe iwakalile. <verse eid="DEU 28:54" /><verse number="55" style="v" sid="DEU 28:55" />Naye ng'atsomgholela baye munu wowose mna wawo inyama ye wanaghe iyatsakuja. Ng'atsokala na chinu chochose baye mna matsuwa agho gha kupfingililighwa na kudununzighwa na iwowahila mna imiji yenu. <verse eid="DEU 28:55" /><verse number="56" style="v" sid="DEU 28:56" />Hata pinga ayula mdekeke na iyadeghete hata yang'ana yakanyaghe hasi kwa tsayo lya mghulu ghwake, katsomwima hata mlume wake iyomkunda na hata imwanaghe immale na ipinga, <verse eid="DEU 28:56" /><verse number="57" style="v" sid="DEU 28:57" />katsomja hata imwanaghe iyamweleka sambi, na libapo ahala imwana hayakoneka bila immale wake iyomkunda na iwanaghe kumanya. <verse eid="DEU 28:57" /><verse number="58" style="v" sid="DEU 28:58" />Ka ng'amkinda baye pfinoghile ghamalaghitso ighandikighwe mna ichitabu chino, na ka ng'amlitegheletsa baye na kulitunya litaghwa lya IMNDEWA Imulungu wenu ilighuma wogha, <verse eid="DEU 28:58" /><verse number="59" style="v" sid="DEU 28:59" />IMNDEWA katsowaghalilani mwemwe na wanenu matamu makulu namwe ng'amtsohona baye, na maghayo makulu ing'aghomala baye. <verse eid="DEU 28:59" /><verse number="60" style="v" sid="DEU 28:60" />Katsowaghalila keli chila utamu wamng'ali muupfuka akula Misiri, mtsokala nawo matsuwa ghose. <verse eid="DEU 28:60" /><verse number="61" style="v" sid="DEU 28:61" />Pfipfila IMNDEWA katsowaghalila chila utamu na maghayo ghangi, aghala ng'ana ghandikighwe baye mna ichitabu chino cha malaghitso mbaka muhupe. <verse eid="DEU 28:61" /><verse number="62" style="v" sid="DEU 28:62" />Hata ka mwemwe mwawengi ka tsinondo itsili kulanga, lekeni mtsokala chidogho, kwaapfila ng'amtegheletse baye chayolonga IMNDEWA, Imulungu wenu. <verse eid="DEU 28:62" /><verse number="63" style="v" sid="DEU 28:63" />Ka apfila IMNDEWA pfayang'ali yowadeng'elela mwemwe kwa kuwatendela ighanoghile na kuwatenda mwongetseke, pfipfo pfayatsodeng'elela ukuwaghalila ghamaghayo, na ukuwakoma. Namwe mtsohupa mna isi yamkwingila kuisola iwe yenu. <verse eid="DEU 28:63" /><verse number="64" style="v" sid="DEU 28:64" />Kuya IMNDEWA, katsowapwililisa mna isi tsose, kulawa hane membe imwe ye isi mbaka membe ingi ya isi, na ako mtsoitumikila milungu ingi ye ghamabwe na mibiki, yang'ana mwemwe muimanye baye wala iwahenga wenu. <verse eid="DEU 28:64" /><verse number="65" style="v" sid="DEU 28:65" />Mna tsiisi atso mtsakuwa kuduhu ukubweda, kuduhu hanu ha kunyagha tsayo lya mghulu ghwako ubwihile, lekeni IMNDEWA katsowenga ghumoyo ghwa kughudema, nenge tsififiya na ghumoyo ighudundadunda. <verse eid="DEU 28:65" /><verse number="66" style="v" sid="DEU 28:66" />Matsuwa ghose mtsokala aku mwakwalangula kwalangula iwowahila watsowalagha, mtsakwona wogha chilo na misi, na ng'amtsokala tseghamba baye.<verse eid="DEU 28:66" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="67" style="v" sid="DEU 28:67" />“Imimoyo yenu itsomema wogha wa chila chinu chamkwona. Nemitondo mtsolonga, ‘Ng'apfu ing'awile nemihe,’ na nemihe mtsolonga, ‘Ng'apfu ing'awile nemitondo,’ ” <verse eid="DEU 28:67" /><verse number="68" style="v" sid="DEU 28:68" />IMNDEWA katsowoitsa keli Misiri kwa melikebu, kwa nzila ila yaniwalongele mleke kwang'a keli. Ako mwitseutsa muwe watumwa kwe wanu iwowahila, lekeni kuduhu munu iyatsowaghula.<verse eid="DEU 28:68" /></para>
  <chapter eid="DEU 28" />
  <chapter number="29" style="c" sid="DEU 29" />
  <para style="s">IMNDEWA kakwika laghano lingi ne Waisiraeli</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="DEU 29:1" />Agha ghagho ghamalonga gha lilaghano IMNDEWA ghayamlaghitse Musa yeke na iwanu wa Isiraeli mna isi ya Moabu, ghawe nyongetsa mna lilaghano lyayekile nawo mna ichidunda cha Horebu.<verse eid="DEU 29:1" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="DEU 29:2" />Musa kawakema hamwe Waisiraeli wose kawalongela, “Mwemwe muwenyegho mwona kwa nenge tsenu aghala ghose IMNDEWA ghayamtendele Farao mna isi ya Misiri, yeye hamwe na watumwa wake na isi yake yose. <verse eid="DEU 29:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="DEU 29:3" />Tsamwona maghayo makulu, pfihulo na pfinu pfa ukukangawatsa. <verse eid="DEU 29:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="DEU 29:4" />Lekeni mbaka leloli aino IMNDEWA ng'amwing'ileni baye tsimbutsi tsa ukumanya, na nenge tsa ukulola, na maghutwi gha ukuhulika. <verse eid="DEU 29:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="DEU 29:5" />Kwa miyaka alubaini IMNDEWA tsakawalongotsa mwemwe mnyika, ghamaghwanda ghenu ghampfalile ng'aghalalile baye wala imikwabatsa yenu ng'ailalile baye mna ghamaghulu ghenu. <verse eid="DEU 29:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="DEU 29:6" />Ng'amjile baye chighate wala ng'amnwele baye idipfai yoyose aila, katenda apfo ili mmanye ghendo ka yeye IMNDEWA yuyo Imulungu wenu. <verse eid="DEU 29:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="DEU 29:7" />Na hampfikile hanu ahano, Sihoni mfalume wa Heshiboni na Ogi mfalume wa Bashani watsa kwitowa na twetwe, lekeni tuwatowa, <verse eid="DEU 29:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="DEU 29:8" />tuisola isi yawo na tuweng'a Warubeni, Wagadi, na nusu ya likabila lya Manese, iwe yawo. <verse eid="DEU 29:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="DEU 29:9" />Lelo ghakindeni, na mghatende ghamalonga gha lilaghano alino ili mbwede mna ghose ghamtenda. <verse eid="DEU 29:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="DEU 29:10" />Leloli mwemwe mwose mwima hambele ha IMNDEWA, Imulungu wenu, wapfilongotsi wa ghamakabila, iwanzehe wenu, na iwamale wose wa Isiraeli, <verse eid="DEU 29:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="DEU 29:11" />hamwe na iwana wenu, na wehe wenu, na iwagheni iwokala mmakaye mwenu iwowatulila tsingodi na iwowadeghela ghamatsi. <verse eid="DEU 29:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="DEU 29:12" />Leloli aino mwima ahano mwike lilaghano na IMNDEWA Imulungu wenu, laghano lyayakwika na mwemwe leloli kwa ukwilaha, <verse eid="DEU 29:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="DEU 29:13" />ili yawatoghole mwemwe ka mwa wanu wake, naye yawe Imulungu wenu, ka pfayelaghane namwe, ahala hayelahile na iwahenga wenu Abrahamu, Isaka na Yakobu. <verse eid="DEU 29:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="DEU 29:14" />Wala lilaghano alino na ukwilaha akuno leloli sikwika na mwemwe yamwimile ahano mliyeka baye, <verse eid="DEU 29:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="DEU 29:15" />ila nakwika na awala wose iwali baha hambele ha IMNDEWA Imulungu wetu, pfipfila hamwe na awala wose ing'awali baha baye na twetwe. <verse eid="DEU 29:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="DEU 29:16" />Mwemwe muwenyegho mwomanya pfatukalile akula Misiri na pfatupfosile mna tsiisi. <verse eid="DEU 29:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="DEU 29:17" />Mwona muwenyegho ipfinyagho pfawo ipfimwihila Imulungu, mwona imilungu ya ghamabwe na imibiki, ya fetsa na nzahabu. <verse eid="DEU 29:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="DEU 29:18" />Mwalangitse ghendo kuleke kulawila mmale wala pinga, wala lukolo wala likabila mna mwemwe ilimleka IMNDEWA Imulungu wenu na kuitambikila imulungu ya isi atso. Chinu chino chakuwa ka sina mna mwemwe ilikweleka ghamatunda ighali usungu na ghana isumu. <verse eid="DEU 29:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="DEU 29:19" />Imunu yang'ahulika ghamalonga gha lilaghano alino na apfila pfayelahile, naye yang'atoghola imwenyegho mna ghumoyo ghwake na kolonga, ‘Nitsokala tseghamba, hata ka kowinza ichidandali chake mwenyegho, acho chitsowakoma wose, iwanoghile na iwehile’ <verse eid="DEU 29:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="DEU 29:20" />IMNDEWA Imulungu ng'atsomleghusila baye totso lyake imunu ayo, imaya ya Imulungu na wipfu wake utsomwakila imunu ayo, malighito ghose ighali mchitabu achino ghatsomlawila, naye Imulungu katsomtenda yahupe ghendo muisi. <verse eid="DEU 29:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="DEU 29:21" />IMNDEWA katsombaghula kulawa mna ghamakabila ghose gha Isiraeli na katsomghalila ghamalighito gha lilaghano ighandikighwe mna ichitabu achino cha ghamalaghitso.<verse eid="DEU 29:21" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="DEU 29:22" />“Iwana wenu iwatsakoneka mna lweleko lwenu lukutsa, na iwagheni iwolawa kutali watsakona apfila IMNDEWA pfayaghalile maghayo na matamu mna isi yenu. <verse eid="DEU 29:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="DEU 29:23" />Isi yose itsolakala kwa baluti na munyu, kuduhu chinu ichihandighwa wala ichikota, wala mibagho ikota, isi yenu itsakuwa ka isi tsa Sodoma, Gomola, Adima na Seboimu, iyatsihinyile IMNDEWA hayonile maya. <verse eid="DEU 29:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="DEU 29:24" />Iwanu wose iwali muisi watsoghutsa, ‘Heule Imulungu kaitenda apfi isi aino? Hebali yaghudubuke apfino na maya yake ng'ulu apfino?’ ”<verse eid="DEU 29:24" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="DEU 29:25" />Iwanu watsakwidika apfino, “Kwaapfila iwanu wa IMNDEWA tsawaleka kuliwinza lilaghano lya IMNDEWA Imulungu wa iwahenga wawo, lyayekile nawo ahala hayawalapfile mna isi ya Misiri. <verse eid="DEU 29:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="DEU 29:26" />Waghenda kuitumikila na kuitambikila milungu ingi, imilungu ing'awaimanyile baye wala Imulungu mwenyegho ng'aweng'ile baye. <verse eid="DEU 29:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="DEU 29:27" />Apfo imaya ya IMNDEWA ilakatsa isi aino naye kaghala malighito ghose ighandikighwe mna ichitabu achino. <verse eid="DEU 29:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="DEU 29:28" />IMNDEWA kona maya ng'ulu, na kwa imaya yake ayo ng'ulu kawabula mna isi yawo na kawasa mna isi ingi, ka pfaili leloli.” <verse eid="DEU 29:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="DEU 29:29" />Aghala ighapfisike ghake yeye IMNDEWA, Imulungu wetu, lekeni aghala ighaghubulighwe ghakwetu na wanetu matsuwa ghose, ili tughakinde aghano ghose ighali mna ghamalaghitso aghano.<verse eid="DEU 29:29" /></para>
  <chapter eid="DEU 29" />
  <chapter number="30" style="c" sid="DEU 30" />
  <para style="s">Mng'amuyila Imulungu mtsobalikighwa.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="DEU 30:1" />Musa kaghendelela ukulonga, “Ukubalikighwa na ukulighitighwa kwose hakutsowatsila ka pfaniwalongele, mtsoghakumbuka agho ghose ahala IMNDEWA Imulungu wenu hayatsowapwililisa mna tsiisi tsingi, <verse eid="DEU 30:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="DEU 30:2" />mwemwe na wanenu hamtsomuyila IMNDEWA wenu na kumtegheletsa yeye kwa ghumoyo ghwenu ghwose na kwa ghumuhe ghwenu ghwose mna aghala ghose ghaniwalaghitsa leloli, <verse eid="DEU 30:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="DEU 30:3" />kuya IMNDEWA wenu katsowoyitsila aghala ghose ighanoghile ighali ghenu, na katsowonela libatsi na katsoweka keli hamwe kulawa mna isi tsose tsa kutali tsampwililikile. <verse eid="DEU 30:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="DEU 30:4" />Hata ka tsakawapfilisa mna isi ili kutali ghendo, kulawa ako kutali Imulungu wenu katsowatinganitsa hamwe na kuwoyitsa, <verse eid="DEU 30:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="DEU 30:5" />na katsowaghala mna isi yawakalile wahenga wenu, namwe mtsoisola keli isi ayo iwe yenu, naye katsowatendela ghanoghile, na katsowatenda mwongetseke muwe wengi kubita wahenga wenu. <verse eid="DEU 30:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="DEU 30:6" />IMNDEWA Imulungu wenu katsowatenda mwemwe na watsukulu wenu muwe na mimoyo ya kutegheletsa, ili mumkunde yeye kwa ghumoyo ghwenu ghwose, na ghumuhe ghwenu ghose ili muwe wagima mna isi ayo. <verse eid="DEU 30:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="DEU 30:7" />IMNDEWA Imulungu wenu katsogheka malighito ghose mchanya mwa iwanu iwowehila, awala iwawadununze. <verse eid="DEU 30:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="DEU 30:8" />Namwe mtsomtegheletsa chayolonga IMNDEWA, kughakinda malaghitso ghake ghose ghanimlaghitsani leloli. <verse eid="DEU 30:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="DEU 30:9" />Na IMNDEWA Imulungu wenu katsowatenda mwemwe mbwede kwa chila ng'onde ya ghamoko ghenu yomsang'ana, mtsakweleka wana wengi, na mtsakuwa na ng'ombe wengi na mighuda yenu itsakweleka pfijo pfingi. Kwaapfila Imulungu katsowadeng'elela keli, na kuwatenda mbwede ka apfila Imulungu pfayadeng'elele kuwatenda iwahenga wenu wabwede. <verse eid="DEU 30:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="DEU 30:10" />Mng'amtegheletsa IMNDEWA, Imulungu wenu kwa kughakinda malaghitso ghake ghose ghandikighwe mna chitabu cha malaghitso na kumuyila yeye kwa ghumoyo ghwenu ghwose na mbutsi tsenu tsose. <verse eid="DEU 30:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="DEU 30:11" />Kwaapfila ghamalaghitso ghaniwalaghitsa leloli si makomu ng'ani kuna mwemwe baye, wala ng'aghali kutali ng'ani baye na mwemwe. <verse eid="DEU 30:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="DEU 30:12" />Ng'aghali kulanga baye mbaka mlonge, ‘Yuhi yatsodina kulanga yatughalile, ili tughahulike na kughakinda?’ <verse eid="DEU 30:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="DEU 30:13" />Wala ng'aghali kumwambu mwa ibahali baye, mbaka mlonge, ‘Yuhi yatsoloka kumwambu yatughalile twetwe ili tughahulike na tughakinde?’ <verse eid="DEU 30:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="DEU 30:14" />Lekeni ghamalaghitso ghahabehi na mwemwe ghendo, ghamumlomo mwenu na mmoyo mwenu ili mdahe kughakinda.<verse eid="DEU 30:14" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="DEU 30:15" />“Mlole, leloli nowabama msaghule ghanoghile au ghehile, ugima au ukufa. <verse eid="DEU 30:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="DEU 30:16" />Kwaapfila nowalaghitsa leloli mumkunde IMNDEWA, Imulungu wenu, mtende aghala ghayobama, mkinde imiko yake yose, amri na ghamalaghitso ghake ghose, mtsokala wagima na kongetseka, na IMNDEWA wenu katsowatenda mweme mbalikighwe mna isi yamghenda kuisola iwe yenu. <verse eid="DEU 30:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="DEU 30:17" />Lekeni ka ghumoyo ghwako ghoghalambuka, gholema kumtegheletsa yeye, na ghokweghighwa kutambikila milungu ingi na kuitumikila, <verse eid="DEU 30:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="DEU 30:18" />leloli nowalongelani ghendo mtsokomighwa. Ng'amtsokala baye matsuwa mengi mna isi yamloka kughenda kuisola iwe yenu, kumwambu mwa ghumto Yoridani. <verse eid="DEU 30:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="DEU 30:19" />Leloli aino nokema lilanga lyone na isi yone pfaniwabama mwemwe msaghule, ughima au ukufa, ukubalikighwa au ukulighitwa. Lelo msaghule ughima ili mwemwe na watsukulu wenu muwe wagima. <verse eid="DEU 30:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="DEU 30:20" />Mkundeni IMNDEWA Imulungu wenu, mtegheletseni yeye, mumkindilise yeye. Kwaapfila Imulungu yuyo yana ugima wenu, naye katsomwikani mkale miyaka mingi mna isi iyelahile kuweng'a wahenga wenu, Abrahamu, Isaka na Yakobu.”<verse eid="DEU 30:20" /></para>
  <chapter eid="DEU 30" />
  <chapter number="31" style="c" sid="DEU 31" />
  <para style="s">Joshua kosaghulighwa kuwalongotsa Waisiraeli.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="DEU 31:1" />Musa kaghendelela kuwalongela Waisiraeli wose, <verse eid="DEU 31:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="DEU 31:2" />“Nene sambi nina miyaka miya imwe na ishilini, nilala na sidaha baye kuwalongotsa mwemwe keli. IMNDEWA kanongela ka nene sitsoloka baye ghumto Yoridani. <verse eid="DEU 31:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="DEU 31:3" />IMNDEWA, Imulungu wenu imwenyegho katsolongola kuloka kumwambu. Katsowakoma iwanu awo hambele henu, namwe mtsoisola isi yawo iwe yenu. Joshua naye katsowalongotsa hamloka, ka IMNDEWA pfayalongile. <verse eid="DEU 31:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="DEU 31:4" />Na IMNDEWA, Imulungu wenu katsowatendela achila chayawatendile Sihoni na Ogu, wafalume wa Waamori, iyawakomile hamwe na iwanu wa isi tsawo. <verse eid="DEU 31:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="DEU 31:5" />IMNDEWA katsomwapfilani ukuwatowa, namwe muwatendele ka pfanimlaghitseni. <verse eid="DEU 31:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="DEU 31:6" />Msindamale na muwe na ngupfu, mleke kuwapfuka, kwaapfila IMNDEWA, Imulungu wenu koghenda hamwe namwe, ng'atsoleka baye kumwapfilani wala kuwaleka mkale mliyeka.” <verse eid="DEU 31:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="DEU 31:7" />Musa kamkema Yoshua, na kamlongela hambele ha Waisiraeli wose, “Uwe na ngupfu na uwe na ghumoyo, kwaapfila kutsoghenda nawo iwanu awano kuna isi IMNDEWA, Imulungu iyelahile kuweng'a iwahenga wawo iwe yawo. <verse eid="DEU 31:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="DEU 31:8" />Imulungu mwenyegho katsokulongolela na kuwa hamwe naghwe, ng'atsoleka baye kukwapfila wala kukuleka uliyeka. Uleke kupfuka wala kutenyuka ghumoyo.”<verse eid="DEU 31:8" /></para>
  <para style="s">Ghasomeni ghamalaghitso chila mwaka ghwa saba</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="DEU 31:9" />Apfo Musa kandika ghamalaghitso, kaweng'a iwatambika, iwana wa Lawi, iwadutile lisanduku lya lilaghano lya IMNDEWA, na kaweng'a wapfilongotsi wose wa Isiraeli. <verse eid="DEU 31:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="DEU 31:10" />Kuya Musa kawalaghitsa kaonga, “Chila haghumala ghumwaka ghwa saba, ghumwaka ghwa kuwalekelela ghamadeni wayenu, matsuwa gha ichihungo cha pfibumbulika, ghasomeni kwa kukemelela ghamaghitso aghano hambele ha Waisiraeli wose waghahulike, <verse eid="DEU 31:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="DEU 31:11" />aho Waisiraeli hawakutsa hambele ha IMNDEWA Imulungu wao hanu hayohasaghula. <verse eid="DEU 31:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="DEU 31:12" />Wakemeni hamwe, wamale, wapinga, iwana wenu na iwagheni iwokala mmakaye mwenu, waghategheletse na welangitse ukumpfuka Imulungu wenu na kughakinda ghose ighali mna ghamalaghitso aghano. <verse eid="DEU 31:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="DEU 31:13" />Kwa ukutenda apfo watsukulu wenu, awala ng'ana waghamanye baye ghamalaghitso aghano, waghategheletse na wamanye ukumpfuka IMNDEWA Imulungu wenu, matsuwa ghose ghawokala mna isi yamloka kughenda kuisola iwe yenu ili kumwambu mwa ghumto Yoridani.”<verse eid="DEU 31:13" /></para>
  <para style="s">Ukughalambuka kwa Waisiraeli kotabilighwa</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="DEU 31:14" />IMNDEWA kamlongela Musa, “Matsuwa ghako gha ukufa gha habehi. Mkeme Yoshua, utse naye hana Lihema lya kwitinganila, aho nitsomlaghitsa.” Apfo Musa na Yoshua waghenda hana Lihema lya kwitinganila. <verse eid="DEU 31:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="DEU 31:15" />Kuya IMNDEWA kawalawila hana Lihema mna ingutso ya libingu, na libingu lima hambele ha ghumlango ghwa Lihema. <verse eid="DEU 31:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="DEU 31:16" />IMNDEWA Imulungu kamlongela Musa, “Ghweghwe kwa habehi kuhupa, iwanu awano watsondeka na watsoghenda kuitambikila milungu ingi ili mna isi yawoighendela kuisola. Watsondeka na kuleka kulikinda lilaghano lyanyikile nawo. <verse eid="DEU 31:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="DEU 31:17" />Hawatsotenda apfo, nene nitsoghudubuka na kuwaleka waliyeka, nitsofisa ichihanga changu waleke kumbona, nawo watsokomighwa. Ghehile na maghayo ghatsowatsila, na matsuwa agho wetseghutsa, ‘Maghayo ghano ghatutsila ng'ambe kwaapfila Imulungu katuleka tuliyeka?’ <verse eid="DEU 31:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="DEU 31:18" />Na nene nitsofisa ghendo ichihanga changu matsuwa agho, kwaapfila watenda ghehile na waitambikila milungu ingi.”<verse eid="DEU 31:18" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="DEU 31:19" />“Lelo wandike wila auno, na uwafunde iwanu wa Isiraeli na uwaleke wembe, ili uwe ukalangama kuna wawo. <verse eid="DEU 31:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="DEU 31:20" />Hanitsowaghala mna isi inoghile kwa ukulima na ukufugha, isi yanilahile kwa iwahenga wawo ka nitsoweng'a, nawo watsakuja weghute na kuneneha, kuya watsoihundukila milungu ingi na kuitumikila, watsonibetsa na kuleka kukinda laghano lyangu. <verse eid="DEU 31:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="DEU 31:21" />Ghehile na maghayo haghatsowatsila, wila uno utsakuwa ukalangama ka nene sili hamwe nawo baye, na iwatsukulu wawo ng'awatsousemwa baye wila auno. Hata sambi nene nomanya aghala ghawobama ukutenda hata ng'ana niwaghale mna isi yanilahile ukuweng'a.” <verse eid="DEU 31:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="DEU 31:22" />Apfo Musa kandika wila awo tsuwa lilyo, na kawafunda Waisiraeli ukwimba.<verse eid="DEU 31:22" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="DEU 31:23" />IMNDEWA Imulungu kamwing'a laghitso alino Yoshua mwana wa Nuni. “Uwe na ngupfu na ugangamale, kwaapfila kutsowalongotsa Waisiraeli mna isi yanilahile kuweng'a, na nene nitsakuwa hamwe na ghweghwe.”<verse eid="DEU 31:23" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="DEU 31:24" />Musa hayamalitse kwandika ghamalonga gha ghamalaghitso aghano mna chitabu kulawa hayachanzile mbaka hachitsighile, <verse eid="DEU 31:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="DEU 31:25" />kawalaghitsa Walawi iwang'ali woliduta Lisanduku lya lilagho lya IIMNDEWA, kawalongela, <verse eid="DEU 31:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="DEU 31:26" />“Mchisole ichitabu achino cha ghamalaghitso na mchisoghetse habehi na lisanduku lya lilaghano lya IMNDEWA wenu, chikale baho ka ukalangama kuna mwemwe. <verse eid="DEU 31:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="DEU 31:27" />Kwaapfila nowamanya mwemwe pfamli wasughu na pfamli na chidandali. Ka tsamkala wasughu kumtoghola Imulungu aku nene ning'ali namghima na hamwe namwe, lelo usughu wenu awo utsakuwatse hanitsakufa? <verse eid="DEU 31:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="DEU 31:28" />Lelo nikemeleni hamwe wanzehe wose wa ghamakabila ghenu na pfilongotsi wenu, nilonge nawo malonga aghano waghahulike, aku lilanga lyakona na isi yakona. <verse eid="DEU 31:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="DEU 31:29" />Kwaapfila nomanya ghendo hanitsakufa mtsakuwa wanu wehile ghendo na kughaleka aghala ghose ghaniwalaghitse. Mna matsuwa ighakutsa, maghayo ghatsowatsilani, kwaapfila mtsotenda ghehile hambele ha IMNDEWA na mtsomtenda IMNDEWA yawaghudubukile kwa aghala ghamtenda.”<verse eid="DEU 31:29" /></para>
  <para style="s">Wila wa Musa</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="DEU 31:30" />Naye Musa kalonga ghamalonga ighali mna wila awo mbaka wila wose umala aku Wasiraeli wose wohulikitsa.<verse eid="DEU 31:30" /></para>
  <chapter eid="DEU 31" />
  <chapter number="32" style="c" sid="DEU 32" />
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="DEU 32:1" />“Tegheletsa, ghwe lilanga, agha ghanilonga,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="DEU 32:1">hulika, ghwe isi, agha ghanilonga umlomo mwangu,<verse eid="DEU 32:1" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="DEU 32:2" />Malangulitso ghangu ghahulumke ka mvula,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="DEU 32:2">ghanilonga ghawe ka tungwe,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="DEU 32:2">ka mawagha mna mitsani mibisi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="DEU 32:2">ka imvula ndodo mna mitsani ikota sambi.<verse eid="DEU 32:2" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="DEU 32:3" />Nitsolikemelela litaghwa lya IMNDEWA,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="DEU 32:3">namwe mlonge, ‘Mulungu wetu mkulu.’<verse eid="DEU 32:3" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="DEU 32:4" />Yeye kabambalawe, sang'ano tsake tsitimilika,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="DEU 32:4">nzila tsake tsose tsinogha.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="DEU 32:4">Imulungu iyotogholighwa, iyalihela totso,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="DEU 32:4">yeye kotenda aghala ighanoghile na ighagholoke.<verse eid="DEU 32:4" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="DEU 32:5" />Lekeni mwemwe mumtendela pfihile yeye,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="DEU 32:5">mwighuma chinyala muwenyegho, na ng'amli wanaghe keli baye,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="DEU 32:5">mwemwe mwa lweleko lwihile na ilwaghile.<verse eid="DEU 32:5" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="DEU 32:6" />Apfi mwobama kumliha apfino IMNDEWA,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="DEU 32:6">mwemwe wanu wabotsi na mlihela tsimbutsi?</para>
  <para style="q" vid="DEU 32:6">Angu yeye si aba wenu baye, Maumba wenu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="DEU 32:6">iyawaumbile na kuweka muwe na tsingupfu?<verse eid="DEU 32:6" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="DEU 32:7" />Mkumbuke matsuwa gha ghumwande,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="DEU 32:7">mwalangule ipfeleko ipfihupile,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="DEU 32:7">waghutseni aba tsenu nawo watsowalongela,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="DEU 32:7">waghutseni iwanzehe wenu, nawo watsowapetela.<verse eid="DEU 32:7" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="DEU 32:8" />Imulungu iyali kuchanya ng'ani hayawagholele iwanu isi tsawo,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="DEU 32:8">hayawabaghulile iwanu isi tsawatsokala,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="DEU 32:8">kawekela imibaka chila wanu, kwa ukulola iwana wa Isiraeli wali wangapi.<verse eid="DEU 32:8" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="DEU 32:9" />Kwa apfila kesaghulila iwanu wa Yakobu wawe wake,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="DEU 32:9">na tuwe mali yake.<verse eid="DEU 32:9" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="DEU 32:10" />Kawona mna isi ya inyika,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="DEU 32:10">mna isi ya nyika ng'ulu ighuma wogha, ina beho kulu iliduma,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="DEU 32:10">kawakinga na kawalela, kawatunza ka imunu pfayochitunza ghoya ichiluli cha inenge yake.<verse eid="DEU 32:10" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="DEU 32:11" />Ka apfila magengele pfayochifumula ichibali chake,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="DEU 32:11">koghuluka mchanya mwa iwanaghe,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="DEU 32:11">kopamanyala ghamabawa ghake yawakindilise,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="DEU 32:11">kowaduta mchanya mwa ghamabawa ghake.<verse eid="DEU 32:11" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="DEU 32:12" />Yeye IMNDEWA yaliyeka yuyo iyawalongotse,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="DEU 32:12">tsakuduhu mulungu yungi iyamwapfile.<verse eid="DEU 32:12" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="DEU 32:13" />Kawabititsa mna isi tsili mpfidando,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="DEU 32:13">nawo waja pfijo pfa kumghunda,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="DEU 32:13">kaweng'a uki ulawile mna mabambalawe walambite,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="DEU 32:13">na waja ghamapfuta ighalawile mna lidongo lya mabwemabwe.<verse eid="DEU 32:13" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="DEU 32:14" />Kaweng'a ijibini, na matsiwa gha wanyama wanwe,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="DEU 32:14">ghamapfuta gha wang'olo na wamene wanenehe,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="DEU 32:14">na wang'olo wamale wa Bashani na wamene,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="DEU 32:14">kaweng'a ingano inoghile ghendo waje, na dipfai inoghile wanwe.<verse eid="DEU 32:14" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="DEU 32:15" />Waisiraeli tsawaneneha na wamlema,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="DEU 32:15">tsawaneneya na wadegheta,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="DEU 32:15">kuya wamleka Imulungu iyawaumbile,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="DEU 32:15">walibetsa Libambalawe liwakombole.<verse eid="DEU 32:15" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="DEU 32:16" />Wamtemda yayonele wipfu milingu ingi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="DEU 32:16">wamtenda yone maya kwa ipfinu pfa ukudesa pfawatendile.<verse eid="DEU 32:16" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="DEU 32:17" />Wapfitambikila pfinyamkela, ipfili si milungu baye,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="DEU 32:17">imilungu aila ing'ana imanyike baye,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="DEU 32:17">imilungu itsile sambi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="DEU 32:17">imilungu aila ng'ana wahenga wawo waipfuke baye.<verse eid="DEU 32:17" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="DEU 32:18" />Mumleka Bambalawe iyaweng'ile ugima,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="DEU 32:18">mumsemwa Imulungu iyaweleke.<verse eid="DEU 32:18" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="DEU 32:19" />IMNDEWA kona alino, naye kawalema iwanaghe wamale na wapinga,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="DEU 32:19">kwaapfila iwanaghe wenyegho wamtenda yaghudubuke.<verse eid="DEU 32:19" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="DEU 32:20" />Kalonga, ‘Nitsopfisa chihanga changu, ndeke kuwapfila,’</para>
  <para style="q" vid="DEU 32:20">ndole watsotsighila kwani,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="DEU 32:20">kwaapfila wawo wawa lweleko lwihile,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="DEU 32:20">iwana ing'awotogholighwa baye.<verse eid="DEU 32:20" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="DEU 32:21" />Wanenda nene mbone wipfu kwa achila ichili si mulungu baye,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="DEU 32:21">wanenda nene mbone maya kwa pfinyagho pfawo,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="DEU 32:21">na nene nitsowatenda wawe na wipfu kwa iwanu awala iwali si wanu baye,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="DEU 32:21">nitsowatenda wone maya kubitila isi ya iwanu wabotsi.<verse eid="DEU 32:21" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="DEU 32:22" />Imaya yangu itsokoletsa moto,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="DEU 32:22">yolakatsa mbaka hasi kutsimu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="DEU 32:22">yolakatsa isi na chila chinu chili mumo,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="DEU 32:22">yolakatsa misingi ya ipfidunda.<verse eid="DEU 32:22" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="DEU 32:23" />Nitsolunditsa ghamaghayo mna mwemwe,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="DEU 32:23">nitsowatowa na mishale yangu mbaka yose imale.<verse eid="DEU 32:23" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="DEU 32:24" />Watsosoka kwa nzala,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="DEU 32:24">matamu makulu ghatsowakoma,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="DEU 32:24">nitsowaghalila wanyama wa kubagho wawaghoghe,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="DEU 32:24">na wanzoka wana isumu iwotambala hasi wawalume.<verse eid="DEU 32:24" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="DEU 32:25" />Ing'ondo itsoghala ukufa kunze mwa tsikaye tsenu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="DEU 32:25">wogha utsakwingila mghati mwa tsing'anda tsenu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="DEU 32:25">iwasongolo na iwandele watsokomighwa,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="DEU 32:25">iwana iwakong'a na iwanzehe nawo watsokomighwa.<verse eid="DEU 32:25" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="DEU 32:26" />Tsanonga nitsowahonda wawe timbwisi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="DEU 32:26">iwanu wawasemwe ghendo.<verse eid="DEU 32:26" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="DEU 32:27" />Lekeni sibamile baye awala iwowehila weghode,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="DEU 32:27">walonge, ‘Twetwe yatuwatowile,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="DEU 32:27">na si MNDEWA baye iyawatendile agha ghose.’<verse eid="DEU 32:27" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="DEU 32:28" />Waisiraeli wawanu walihela tsimbutsi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="DEU 32:28">na wahela ghamahala ghendo.<verse eid="DEU 32:28" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="DEU 32:29" />Wang'awile na tsimbutsi wang'amanyile hebali tsawatowighwa,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="DEU 32:29">na wang'atangile choni chitsowalawila.<verse eid="DEU 32:29" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="DEU 32:30" />Angu munu yumwe tsayodahatse kuwatowa wanu elufu imwe,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="DEU 32:30">na wanu weli tsawodahatse kuwawinga wanu elufu kumi?</para>
  <para style="q" vid="DEU 32:30">Kwaapfila iyali Bambalawe lyao kawasa,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="DEU 32:30">na iyali IMNDEWA wawo kawalapfa watowighwe.<verse eid="DEU 32:30" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="DEU 32:31" />Hata awala iwotuhila womanya ghendo,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="DEU 32:31">ka bambalawe wawo si ka Bambalawe wetu baye.<verse eid="DEU 32:31" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="DEU 32:32" />Wawo ka minzabibu ya Sodoma,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="DEU 32:32">ilawa mna mighunda ya Gomola,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="DEU 32:32">tsinzabibu tsake tsimema sumu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="DEU 32:32">pfikungwi pfake pfimema usungu.<verse eid="DEU 32:32" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="33" style="v" sid="DEU 32:33" />Dipfai yake sumu ya nzoka,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="DEU 32:33">ka sumu ya moma.<verse eid="DEU 32:33" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="34" style="v" sid="DEU 32:34" />IMNDEWA kolonga, ‘Angu nene sighekile akiba baye agha ghose,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="DEU 32:34">na kughahindila mna ihatsina yangu?<verse eid="DEU 32:34" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="35" style="v" sid="DEU 32:35" />Nene nitsowoyitsila chawatendile, nitsowaliha chicho,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="DEU 32:35">maghulu ghawo haghatsotelebuka,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="DEU 32:35">matsuwa ghawo gha ukughaya gha habehi ghendo,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="DEU 32:35">na ukutsigha kwawo kwa habehi.’<verse eid="DEU 32:35" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="36" style="v" sid="DEU 32:36" />IMNDEWA katsowahigha na kuwona iwanu wake wahela matotso,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="DEU 32:36">na kuwonela libatsi iwatumwa wake,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="DEU 32:36">ahala hayowona wahela ngupfu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="DEU 32:36">na kuduhu munu iyatsolekighwa, imtumwa wala ayula iyali si mtumwa baye.<verse eid="DEU 32:36" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="37" style="v" sid="DEU 32:37" />Naye IMNDEWA katsoghutsa, ‘Lelo milungu yenu ilikwani?</para>
  <para style="q" vid="DEU 32:37">Ayo ng'ambe mibambalawe yenu yamtsumilile kwipfisa.<verse eid="DEU 32:37" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="38" style="v" sid="DEU 32:38" />Imilungu ijile ghamapfuta gha tsinambiko tsenu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="DEU 32:38">inwele idipfai ye nzabibu yamlapfile nambiko,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="DEU 32:38">lelo inuke imwapfileni,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="DEU 32:38">lelo iweng'eni hanu ha ukwipfisa.<verse eid="DEU 32:38" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="39" style="v" sid="DEU 32:39" />Lelo sambi mlole, nene na Imulungu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="DEU 32:39">wala kuduhu Imulungu yungi ila nene niliyeka,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="DEU 32:39">nene nokoma na nakwing'a ugima,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="DEU 32:39">nene nolagha na nohonetsa,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="DEU 32:39">na kuduhu munu iyodaha kumkombola yoyose mna ghumoko ghwangu.<verse eid="DEU 32:39" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="40" style="v" sid="DEU 32:40" />Nakwinula ghumoko wangu kulanga na nelaha,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="DEU 32:40">ka nene pfanikala mgima matsuwa ghose,<verse eid="DEU 32:40" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="41" style="v" sid="DEU 32:41" />haninola limaghe lyangu ilimelemeta,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="DEU 32:41">na hanigholosa ghumoko ghwangu nihighe,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="DEU 32:41">nitsowoyitsila ghaghala ghawonendela iwonihila,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="DEU 32:41">na kuwakoma awala iwonihila nene.<verse eid="DEU 32:41" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="42" style="v" sid="DEU 32:42" />Mishale yangu itsakunwa idamu mbaka ipatike,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="DEU 32:42">limaghe lyangu litseghuta inyama,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="DEU 32:42">na kunwa idamu ya awala iwakomighwe na iwaghoghighwe,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="DEU 32:42">na kunwa idamu ya pfilongotsi wawo.<verse eid="DEU 32:42" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="43" style="v" sid="DEU 32:43" />Deng'eleleni mwe wanu wa tsiisi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="DEU 32:43">hamwe na iwanu wake, kwaapfila kowoyitsila ghaghala ghawawatendele iwatumwa wake,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="DEU 32:43">kowatendela ghaghala awala iwomwihila,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="DEU 32:43">koitenda isi yele, hamwe na iwanu wake.’”<verse eid="DEU 32:43" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="44" style="v" sid="DEU 32:44" />Musa na Yoshuwa mwana wa Nuni walonga ghamalonga ghose gha wila uno aku Waisiraeli woutegheletsa mmaghutwi mwawo.<verse eid="DEU 32:44" /></para>
  <para style="s">Musa komalitsila kwa ukuwalaghitsa Waisiraeli</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="45" style="v" sid="DEU 32:45" />Musa hayamalitse kuwembila malonga aghano Waisiraeli, <verse eid="DEU 32:45" /><verse number="46" style="v" sid="DEU 32:46" />kawalongela, “Ghekeni mmoyo malonga aghano ghose ghaniwalongele leloli aino, namwe mdahe kuwafunda wanenu waghakinde ghendo ghose ighali mna malaghitso aghano. <verse eid="DEU 32:46" /><verse number="47" style="v" sid="DEU 32:47" />Kwaapfila ighali mumo simalonga hela baye, lekeni ghana ugima wenu, ghakindeni namwe mtsokala matsuwa mengi mna isi yamghenda kuisola iwe yenu kumwambu mwa ghumto Yoridani.” <verse eid="DEU 32:47" /><verse number="48" style="v" sid="DEU 32:48" />Litsuwa lilila IMNDEWA kamlongela Musa, <verse eid="DEU 32:48" /><verse number="49" style="v" sid="DEU 32:49" />“Ghenda kuna ipfidunda pfa Abarimu ipfili mna isi ya Moabu, ilolesa na ghumji ghwa Yeriko, ukagheluke chidunda cha Nebo na uilole isi ya Kanaani yaniweng'a Waisiraeli iwe yawo. <verse eid="DEU 32:49" /><verse number="50" style="v" sid="DEU 32:50" />Kutsakufila kuko kuna ichidunda acho chaugheluka, naghwe kutsoghenda akula kwawali iwahenga wako, ka pfayafile ndughu yako Aruni mna chidunda cha Holi, na kughenda kwawali iwahenga wake. <verse eid="DEU 32:50" /><verse number="51" style="v" sid="DEU 32:51" />Kwaapfila mwemwe mwose weli tsamnitendela matotso hambele ha Waisiraeli ahala hamkalile hana ghamatsi gha Meriba, habehi na ghumji ghwa Kadeshi mna inyika ya Sini, mwemwe ng'amnitendile baye nyoneke nienzeluka mna Waisiraeli. <verse eid="DEU 32:51" /><verse number="52" style="v" sid="DEU 32:52" />Apfo, kutsoyona isi kwa kutali, lekeni ghweghwe ng'utsakwingila baye mna isi yaniweng'a iwanu wa Isiraeli.”<verse eid="DEU 32:52" /></para>
  <chapter eid="DEU 32" />
  <chapter number="33" style="c" sid="DEU 33" />
  <para style="s">Musa koghabaliki makabila gha Isiraeli.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="DEU 33:1" />Atsino tsitso tsibalaka Musa imunu wa Imulungu tsayawabaliki Waisiraeli ahala ng'ana yafe baye. <verse eid="DEU 33:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="DEU 33:2" />Naye kalonga,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="DEU 33:2">“IMNDEWA katsa kulawa ichidunda cha Sinai</para>
  <para style="q" vid="DEU 33:2">katutsila kulawa chidunda cha Seiri,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="DEU 33:2">kalangatsa kulawa chidunda cha Parani,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="DEU 33:2">kalawila na wamalaika makumi elufu</para>
  <para style="q" vid="DEU 33:2">na ghumoto ghwakwaka mna ghumoko ghwake ghwa kujilo.<verse eid="DEU 33:2" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="DEU 33:3" />IMNDEWA kowakunda iwanu wake,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="DEU 33:3">katsowalolesa iwanu wake iwenzeluke,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="DEU 33:3">nawo wotowa mapfindi hana ghamaghulu ghake,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="DEU 33:3">wobokela malaghitso kulawa kuna ghweghwe.<verse eid="DEU 33:3" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="DEU 33:4" />Musa katulaghitsa kughakinda ghamalaghitso,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="DEU 33:4">ghatwing'ighwe twetwe ghawe ghetu, wana wa Isiraeli.<verse eid="DEU 33:4" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="DEU 33:5" />IMNDEWA kawa mfalume wa Waisiraeli,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="DEU 33:5">ahala pfilongotsi wa iwanu hawetingane,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="DEU 33:5">hamwe na ghamakabila gha Isiraeli.”<verse eid="DEU 33:5" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="DEU 33:6" />“Iwanu wa likabila lya Rubeni wakale wagima na wala waleke ukufa,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="DEU 33:6">na waleke kuwa chidogho.”<verse eid="DEU 33:6" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="DEU 33:7" />Likabila lya Yuda kalilonga apfino,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="DEU 33:7">“Ghwe IMNDEWA, tegheletsa ichililo cha likabila lya Yuda,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="DEU 33:7">uwoyitse keli kwa wandughu tsawo,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="DEU 33:7">uwatowele kwa ghamoko ghako,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="DEU 33:7">uwapfile ahala hawetowa na awala iwowehila.”<verse eid="DEU 33:7" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="DEU 33:8" />Na likabila lya wanu wa Lawi, kalilonga apfino,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="DEU 33:8">“Ghamabwe gha Thumimu na Urimu, keng'ighwa imunu wako iyenzeluke,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="DEU 33:8">yumghetsile ako Masa,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="DEU 33:8">yung'ali uhila naye hana ghamatsi ako Meriba.<verse eid="DEU 33:8" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="DEU 33:9" />Walawi wawabela aba tsawo na mai tsawo</para>
  <para style="q" vid="DEU 33:9">wawasemwa ghendo ndughu tsawo,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="DEU 33:9">ng'awawatangile baye hata iwana wawo,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="DEU 33:9">lekeni waghakinda ghamalaghitso ghako,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="DEU 33:9">na kukinda lilaghano lyako.<verse eid="DEU 33:9" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="DEU 33:10" />Walawi watsowafunda iwana wa Yakobo kughakinda ghamalaghitso ghako,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="DEU 33:10">watsowafunda iwanu wa Isiraeli isheria yako,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="DEU 33:10">watsodusula upfumba hambele hako,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="DEU 33:10">na watsolapfa nambiko tsa kulakatsighwa mchanya mwa imatsabahu yako.<verse eid="DEU 33:10" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="DEU 33:11" />Ghwe IMNDEWA tsibaliki tsingupfu tsao,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="DEU 33:11">utsibokele tsing'onde tsawotenda kwa ghamoko ghawo,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="DEU 33:11">upfighojole ipfighudi pfa awala iwowehila,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="DEU 33:11">na utsihinye tsingupfu tsao na waleke kwinuka keli.”<verse eid="DEU 33:11" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="DEU 33:12" />Likabila lya wanu wa Benjamini kalilonga apfino,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="DEU 33:12">“Likabila lyenu IMNDEWA kolikunda na kolikinga,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="DEU 33:12">kolilolesa misi yose,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="DEU 33:12">naye kolihabatila mmambagha mwake.”<verse eid="DEU 33:12" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="DEU 33:13" />Likabila lya iwanu wa Yosefu kalilonga apfino,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="DEU 33:13">“IMNDEWA yaibaliki isi yawo iwe na litungwe linoghile kulawa kulanga,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="DEU 33:13">na ghamatsi igholawa hasi ha lidongo.<verse eid="DEU 33:13" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="DEU 33:14" />Isi yawo imele ghamatunda ghanoghile ighakwipfa kwa litsuwa,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="DEU 33:14">iwe na ghamatunda mengi ighanoghile gha chila msimu.<verse eid="DEU 33:14" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="DEU 33:15" />Na ipfidunda pfake pfa ghumwande pfimele ghamatunda ghanoghile,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="DEU 33:15">na ing'aghohupa baye igholawa mna ipfidunda pfa ghamatsuwa ghose.<verse eid="DEU 33:15" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="DEU 33:16" />Isi yake imeme ghose ighanoghile,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="DEU 33:16">ibwede kwa ghose ighanoghile gha IMNDEWA,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="DEU 33:16">iyakalile akula kuna ichibagho ichikwaka,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="DEU 33:16">ukubweda akuno kuwaghendele iwanu wa likabila lya Yosefu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="DEU 33:16">yeye iyali mbala wa wandughu tsake.<verse eid="DEU 33:16" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="DEU 33:17" />Yosefu kana ngupfu ka ng'ombe mmale iyalongole koneka,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="DEU 33:17">membe tsake tsa nyati,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="DEU 33:17">kwa tsimembe atso katsokunughitsa iwanu wa tsiisi mbaka kuna tsimembe tsa isi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="DEU 33:17">nawo watsakuwa wanu makumi elufu wa Efuremu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="DEU 33:17">na wanu maelufu wa Manase.”<verse eid="DEU 33:17" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="DEU 33:18" />Na likabila lya Zabuloni na lya Isakari kaghalonga apfino,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="DEU 33:18">“Deng'eleleni mwemwe wa zabuloni, hamghenda mna ghumwanza,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="DEU 33:18">na mwemwe wa Isakari, mbwede imkala mna ipfibumbulika pfenu.<verse eid="DEU 33:18" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="DEU 33:19" />Mwemwe mtsowakema iwanu waghende kupfidunda,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="DEU 33:19">na kuko mtsolapfa nambiko itsibamighwa,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="DEU 33:19">namwe mtsopata pfinu bwelele kulawa mbahari,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="DEU 33:19">na aghala ighapfisike mna ghumsanga.”<verse eid="DEU 33:19" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="DEU 33:20" />Likabila lya Gadi kalilonga apfino.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="DEU 33:20">“Yabalikighwe Imulungu iyoyongetsa isi ya Gadi iwe ng'ulu.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="DEU 33:20">Wanu wa Gadi wokala ka simba iyotsaula ghumoko ghwa imnyama iyamghoghile, na lilotsi lya litwi.”<verse eid="DEU 33:20" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="DEU 33:21" />Kesaghulila imwenyegho isi ina lidongo linoghile kubita tsose,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="DEU 33:21">hanu hasaghulighwe hawe ha chilongotsi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="DEU 33:21">pfilongotsi wa iwanu hawetingane hamwe,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="DEU 33:21">watenda aghala ghose ghaoyobama IMNDEWA,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="DEU 33:21">katenda chayabamile Imulungu kwa Isiraeli.<verse eid="DEU 33:21" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="DEU 33:22" />Na likabila lya Dani kalilonga,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="DEU 33:22">“Dani ka mwana simba</para>
  <para style="q" vid="DEU 33:22">iyoghuluka kulawa Bashani.” <verse eid="DEU 33:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="DEU 33:23" />Likabila lya Nafutali kalilonga,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="DEU 33:23">“Wanafutali webweda ighanoghile na tsibalaka tsa IMNDEWA,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="DEU 33:23">isi yako ya kusini na maghalibi mwa litsiwa lya Galilaya.”<verse eid="DEU 33:23" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="DEU 33:24" />Na likabila lya Asheri kalilonga apfino,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="DEU 33:24">“Likabila lya Asheri libwede kubita makabila ghose gha Isiraeli,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="DEU 33:24">yatogholighwe na ndughu tsake,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="DEU 33:24">yapfabike mghulu ghwake mna ghamapfuta.”<verse eid="DEU 33:24" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="DEU 33:25" />Ghamalango ghako kutsoghahindila komeo tsa chuma na tsa shaba,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="DEU 33:25">namwe mtsokala na ngupfu matsuwa ghose.<verse eid="DEU 33:25" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="DEU 33:26" />Musa kamalitsa kwa ukulonga, “Kuduhu yungi iyali ka Imulungu wa Isiraeli,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="DEU 33:26">yeye koghuluka kulawa kulanga yatse kukwapfila,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="DEU 33:26">naye koghuluka kulanga mna ukulu wake.<verse eid="DEU 33:26" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="DEU 33:27" />Imulungu wa matsuwa ghose yuyo wa ukumtsumila mwemwe,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="DEU 33:27">na ghamoko ghake ghatsokukinga matsuwa ghose,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="DEU 33:27">kowawinga iwanu iwowehila hambele henu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="DEU 33:27">kolonga, ‘Wakomeni.’ ”<verse eid="DEU 33:27" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="DEU 33:28" />Apfo Waisiraeli watsokala tseghamba waliyeka,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="DEU 33:28">watsukulu wa Yakobo waliyeka,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="DEU 33:28">mna isi ina ingano na idipfai,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="DEU 33:28">na mlanga mwake mwolaghala mawagho.<verse eid="DEU 33:28" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="DEU 33:29" />Mbweda mwemwe, Waisiraeli,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="DEU 33:29">nani iyali ka mwemwe,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="DEU 33:29">iwanu iwakombolighwe na IMNDEWA,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="DEU 33:29">yeye ka ngao yenu na komwapfilani,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="DEU 33:29">na limaghe iliwatenda muhume,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="DEU 33:29">na awala iwowehila watseghala wenyegho kuna mwemwe,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="DEU 33:29">namwe mtsohabajugha hanu hawo henulighwe.<verse eid="DEU 33:29" /></para>
  <chapter eid="DEU 33" />
  <chapter number="34" style="c" sid="DEU 34" />
  <para style="s">Musa kakufa</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="DEU 34:1" />Musa kagheluka kuchidunda cha Nebo kulawa mna ichiwala cha Moabu, mbaka kuna ichidando cha ichidunda cha Pisiga, ubali wa mashaliki iching'ali chilolesa na Yeriko. Aho IMNDEWA kamlangusa isi yose kulawa Gileadi mbaka Dani, <verse eid="DEU 34:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="DEU 34:2" />na isi yose ya Nafutali, na ya Efuremu na Manase, na isi yose ya Yuda mbaka ibahari ya Mediterania, <verse eid="DEU 34:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="DEU 34:3" />na isi ya Negebu, na ichiwala cha ulwanda wa Yeriko, ighukemighwa ghumji ghuna imibiki ya mitende, mbaka Soari.<verse eid="DEU 34:3" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="DEU 34:4" />Kuya IMNDEWA kamlongela Musa, “Aino iyo isi yanilahile na Aburahamu, Isaka, na Yakobu, hanilongile, ‘Nitsoweng'a watsukulu wenu.’ Nikulangusa wone kwa nenge tsako ghumwenyegho, lekeni ng'utsoloka upfike ako baye.” <verse eid="DEU 34:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="DEU 34:5" />Na Musa imtumighwa wa IMNDEWA kafa mna isi ya Moabu, ka IMNDEWA pfayalongile. <verse eid="DEU 34:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="DEU 34:6" />IMNDEWA kamtsika mlwanda, mna isi ya Moabu, ing'ali ilolesa na Beti Peori, lekeni mbaka leloli aino kuduhu munu yamanyile hanu halili likabuli lyake. <verse eid="DEU 34:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="DEU 34:7" />Musa tsakafa aku kana miyaka miya imwe na ishilini, lekeni nenge tsake ng'atsibofuke baye, wala ilukuli lwake ng'alulalile baye. <verse eid="DEU 34:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="DEU 34:8" />Waisiraeli wamlilila Musa mna ulwanda wa Moabu kwa matsuwa selasini, walila mbaka ghamatsuwa gha ukudomboketsa haghamalile.<verse eid="DEU 34:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="DEU 34:9" />Yoshua mwana Nuni tsakamema na iloho ya ukukengela, kwaapfila Musa tsakamwikila ghamoko ghake. Apfo iwanu wa Isiraeli tsawamtegheletsa na watenda ka apfila IMNDEWA pfayamlaghitse Musa. <verse eid="DEU 34:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="DEU 34:10" />Ng'ana yalawile baye nabii yungi mna isi ya Isiraeli ka Musa, iyalongile na IMNDEWA chihanga kwa chihanga. <verse eid="DEU 34:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="DEU 34:11" />Kuduhu nabii yungi iyatendile pfitango na pfinu pfa kukangawatsa ka apfila IMNDEWA pfayamtumile Musa yatende kwa Farao na iwatumwa wake wose, na kwa isi yake yose. <verse eid="DEU 34:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="DEU 34:12" />Kuduhu ghendo inabii yungi iyatendile pfinu pfikulu na ipfighuma wogha ka apfila pfayatendile Musa hambele ha Waisiraeli wose.<verse eid="DEU 34:12" /></para>
  <chapter eid="DEU 34" />
</usx>